<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Bahasa Buli</book>
  <para style="h">Matius</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matius</para>
  <para style="toc1">Injil Matius</para>
  <para style="h">Matius</para>
  <para style="mt">Matius</para>
  <para style="mt2">Abar mafia ga Yesus Kristus ta Matiuse ntona</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Abar mafia</char>: Kitab Matius tae, biasa ite tu, “Abar Mafia” (B. Ind: <char style="it">Injil</char>, pene pa <char style="it">Abar Mafia</char>). Ni caritana ga Jou Lahatalla ncula Yesus Kristus nlafo mali dunia tae ga ise be ta ndela I, ni dosana osta nduk ampung fare i osta ntub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Smat ta nlefo Kitab tae</char>: Kitab tae Matiuse nlefo i. Matius tae isa mali Jou Yesuse ni murit yafasa re silu tasa. I nlefo kitab tae bo nfabinga ahai ta i nem fare nlongana oras ta i nderera Yesus. I cia smat Yahudi i. I nderera Yesus paubena, i ni karajanna biasa ntagi pajak bo pamarenta Romana.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Kitab tae bo ise</char>: Kitab Matius tae en rlefo bo smat agama Yahudina. Smat agama Yahudi tane ite biasa tu, smat Israel, penepa smat Ibrani. Si tina ta Jou Lahatalla nfisange ntuba si bo rdadi I ni smat fare npo si I ni Mauting, ta ngahnyo <char style="it">Perjanjian Lama.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Sogaro mali kitab tae</char>: Mali kitab tae, Matiuse nafetang ga Yesuse lale to nfamafia smat, fare nfaungo setan mali smatna. Mali Kitab tae, en sogaro mamagal pilim mali Yesus i: sogaro mali popoca (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5">Mat. 5</ref></char>–<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 7">7</ref></char>), sogaro ta Yesuse npo oras I nololaw fare ncula I ni muritna (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10">Mat. 10</ref></char>), sogaro ta lolona andeande ga Jou Lahatalla bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali I ni smatna (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13">Mat. 13</ref></char>), sogaro ga mfalaisa rir tub smat ta tdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18">Mat. 18</ref></char>), fare sogaro ga ahai ta osta bo ndadi i oras kimatna (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24">Mat. 24</ref></char>–<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 25">25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Matiuse nlefo hawe ga Jou Lahatalla ni jaji mali smat agama Yahudina, I bo ncula Mesias, Kolano ta bo nfasalamate smatca. Gabe, mali Kitab tae, lalna gaole Matiuse npake ayat mali Perjanjian Lama bo smat Yahudina rto, Yesus cia to ta si rtotoman I. Fare mali cicapo Kitab tae, Matiuse nafetang ga mfalaisa agama Yahudina riri ta rfaboboko sina diyawa lalinge bo rpun famat Yesus (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26">Mat. 26</ref></char>–<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27">27</ref></char>). Matius bena nafetang mfalaisa Yesuse nduk kangelana, rcalip i denabe nmat. Ga mali wol ta faicolca, Yesuse npaling hawe ga fola tina, I ncula ni muritna rfane dua smate nesana bo rdadi I ni murit si hawe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28">Mat. 28</ref></char>). Smate nesa ta bo rdadi murit tina, ise be fare mali suku ahai be mali dunia tae, bo farumi smatna rdela be Yesus Kristus.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Yesus Kristus hma re bbu tantuba riri durina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk. 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Yesus Kristus tae kolano Daute ni duri i fare Apa Abraham. Tane I hma re bbu tantuba ngahnyorina:<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abrahame ntu Ishak, Ishake ntu Yakub, Yakube ntu Yehuda fare Yehuda teno re rama ta nesana.<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yehuda ntu Peres fare Zerah, mali ni ngolota i Tamar. Perese ntu Hezron, Hezrone ntu Ram,<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Rame ntu Aminadab, Aminadabe ntu Nahason, Nahasone ntu Salmon,<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salmone ntu Boas mali ni ngolota Rahab, Boase ntu Obet mali ni ngolota Rut, Obete ntu Isai,<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Isaie ntu Daut, Daut cia ta ndadi smat Israelna riri kolano i. Daute ntu Salomo mali ni ngolota Batsyeba. Batsyeba cia Uria ni ngolo i ta ntubana.<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Salomone ntu Rehabeam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:7">Rehabeame ntu Abia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:7">Abia ntu Asa,<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa ntu Yosafat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:8">Yosafate ntu Yoram,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:8">Yorame ntu Uzia,<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia ntu Yotam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:9">Yotame ntu Ahas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahase ntu Hizkia,<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hizkia ntu Manasye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:10">Manasye ntu Amon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:10">Amone ntu Yosia,<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />taga Yosia ntu Yekhonya fare wawai ta nesana oras ta smat Israel rtopa si mali Babel fare rfakangela si puli tina.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Fare, oras ta smat Israel ta rtopa si mali Babelna duwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:12">Yekhonya ntu Sealtiel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:12">Sealtiele ntu Zerubabel,<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabele ntu Abihud,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:13">Abihude ntu, Elyakim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:13">Elyakime ntu Azor,<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azore ntu Zadok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:14">Zadoke ntu Akhim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:14">Akhime ntu Eliud,<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliude ntu Eleazar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleazare ntu Matan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:15">matane ntu Yakub,<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />taga Yakube ntu Yusuf.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:16">Yusuf tae ta nfasawa Maria,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:16">taga Maria tae ta ndadikna Yesus.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:16">Yesus tae to ta smatna biasa dololaw I Kristus, Kristus ningalena, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatca.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Gabe mulain mali Abraham denabe kolano Daut, en ni durina yafasa re sifat. Taga mali kolano Daut denabe oras ta smat Israelna rtopa si fare rfakangela si mali Babelna, en ni durina yafasa re sifat hawe. Taga smat Israelna rtub mali Babelna denabe oras Yesuse ntubna, en ni durina yafasa re sifat.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus Kristuse ntub</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk. 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Yesus Kristuse ntub ni caritana laitane: Maria Yesuse hnye, nfajaji re Yusuf bo rfasaw. Maria tae nto man paube, garayanna i reni badan. Maria reni badan ningalena Jou ni Rohca. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Yusuf tae smat ta ntubna molang mali Jou Lahatalla nbona. Oras ta i nto Maria reni badan, mali wlona bo nfateam Maria fare smatna mati rtona. Ningalena i nailow pa bo Maria nduk maimai mali smat laloca nbona.<verse eid="MAT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ga oras ta Yusufe nfik-fikir sube i ni rencana tina, Jou Lahatalla ni malaekat isa nlafo ga nua i, “Yusuf, kolano Daute ntu re bbu ta Aw. Mati mamcaitna myal Maria ndadi nim ngolo i, ningalena wai ta i mali hnyao lolo cia i mali Jou ni Rohca mali. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Maria ntuca bo ntub waica mani. Ga aw nane mfanganyo wai cia Yesus, ningalena I cia ta bo nfasalamate ni smatna mali riri dosana.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Farumi tina Jou Lahatalla nua I ni nabina ntuba to, ga oras tae farumi tina ndadi to. Ta Jou Lahatalla nu ntuba to tina laitane, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Osta en males isa ta nto man paube, bo re ni badan. I ntu isa bo ntub Wai cia man i, ga smatna bo dololaw wai cia, Imanuel,” (Imanuel tina mauting Ibrani, ta ningale, Jou Lahatalla nfarerer re it).<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Gabe Yusufe namtuli npaling, i npei e ndumi ta Jou Lahatalla ni malaekatca nua i na. I nyal Maria ndadi i ni ngolo i. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Yusufe denabe waica ntub i namtuli re Maria pa. Yusufe nfangahnyo I, Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Smat ta rpandena dem ototafca ningale si rlafo bo rcuba Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesuse ntub mali Betlehem batang Yudea, oras cia Herodese ndadi kolano pulina. Oras cia, smat sifis ta rpande dem ototafca ningale, si rlafo polao malei rfan lali bendar isa ngahnyo Yerusalem. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Si rfautno smat ta puli nana, “Manca e, smat Yahudina riri kolano ta ntub poca? Ningalena, amame kem ototaf isa polao ta ndadi fafayal i ntube to. Gabe tane amame klafo bo ksuba I.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Rlonga si du en kolano ta po Ica, kolano Herodese wlona kangela, laina bena re smat ta en mali bendar Yerusalemna. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Gabe, kolano Herodese ncula rfayalo smat Yahudina riri imam ta rfaboboko sina fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa. Taga nfautno si, “Co fabinga ya, i manca Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji cia osta ntub?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Si rcanglo, “I bo ntub mali Betlehem, mali batang Yudea, ningalena tantuba mali be, Jou Lahatalla nua ni nabina, ga tina rlefo mali Jou ni Kitabca laitane,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Mewe smat Betlehem mali batang Yudea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">Biarega nimew bendarca nena, ga osta ndadi bendar ta nfoloi mali farumi bendar ta en mali Yehudana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">Ningalena mali nimew bendar cia osta en smat isa ta bo nfaboboko Ya nik smatna, smat Israelna, laisa smat ta rjaga riri dombana.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Nlonga tina, kolano Herodese n'gogan i, taga nololaw smat ta rpande tasa dem ototaf cia. Fare nfautno si, bo nto molang popise i si dem ototaf cia ncapangna. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Fola tina, i ncula si rfan lali Betlehem. I nua si, “Mewe ffane to lali Betlehem, fare fningo I famafia Wai cia. Gabe laisa fduk i to, flolai mali fabinga bo ya ma ifan lali bena isuba I.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Rlonga kolano Herodese nu fola tina, si ma rfan. Oras si rfanna, si rgaranyanna ototaf ta si demi bahnga to polao malica nfane ntuba mali sili fare nfola mali gagaw ta Wai cia ntubna. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Oras ta si dem ototaf cia, si rcangnangna gaole. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Gabe oras ta si rcung namul ebaica, si dem wai cia i re hnye, Maria. Fare si rcuba Wai cia. Si rcalawe riri arata gagaona taga rcapnga okosesi ta mulona mamagal bo doce Wai cia. Okosesi ta si rpona: guraci, kemenyan fare egat mur ta pauna mafia.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Fola tina, Jou Lahatalla nfaem mahngel lali smat ta rpandena bo dem ototaf cia. Jou Lahatalla nua si bo mati rlolai lali kolano Herodes i na to. Gabe si duwe lali si riri batangna rderera lalinge nesa.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusuf i re Maria rpiya Yesus lali Mesir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Oras smat ta rpandena dem ototaf cia duwe, Jou Lahatalla ni malaekatca nfaeme ni dirica lali Yusuf i mali mahngel lolo. Malaekat cia nua i, “Yusuf, mpalinge to! Mut Wai cia fare nim ngolota fpiya lali batang Mesir. Mew fteteam mana to denabe Ya ifabinga opfis mewe flolai malina, ningalena kolano Herodese niyawa Wai cia bo npun famat I.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Nlonga tina, Yusufe npaling, fare doramca to, i nute ntuca fare ni ngolota, taga rpiya lali Mesir. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Si rteteam pulina denabe kolano Herodese nmat. Farumi tina ndadi i laisa re ta Jou Lahatalla nua nabina ntuba to laitane, “Ya ikololaw Ya ntukca bo ncapang mali batang Mesir.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolano Herodese nfasula rpun famat wai nenena ta mali Betlehemna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Oras ta kolano Herodese nto, smat ta rpandena dem ototaf cia rderera ta i nuna pa, i ntolena gaole. Gabe i netang orasna mulain mali si ta deme ntuba ototaf cia, sal pana taun failu to nfan mali tane. Fare i ncula ni smatna rfan Betlehem fare pnu ta ndahle manana bo rpun famat wai man nene ta riri umurna taun failu nduri.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Oras ta si rpun famat wawai tina, tantuba mali be ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nua nabi Yeremiana ndadi to, laitane,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Puli bendar Rama, en smatna rtangis, ningalena rmagogoru sina gaole.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rahele ntangis ningalena i nlolame ntuna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Isa pa ta bo npeo i mangina, ningalena i ntuna rmate ndumi to.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusuf i re ntu re bbuna rlolai lali batang Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Oras ta kolano Herodese nmatna, Yusuf i mali Mesir sube, ga i nmahngel Jou Lahatalla ni malaekat isa nlafo, fare nua i, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />“Yusuf, mpalinge to. Mute ntumca fare hnye bo flolai lali batang Israel, ningalena kolano Herodes fare smat ta bo rpun Wai ciana rmate to.”<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Nlonga tina, Yusufe npaling nut Wawai cia fare hnye duwe lali batang Israel. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ga oras Yusufe nlonga Arkhelaus ndadi kolano niwane hma Herodes mali batang Yudea, Yusufe ndadi namcait bo nuwe lalina. Ga Jou Lahatalla ni malaekatna rfabinga i mali mahngel lolo, bo i mati nfan lali batang Yudeana, ga nfan lali batang Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Si rlafo mali batang Galilea, rteteam mali bendar isa ngahnyo Nasaret. Tina ndadi i laisa re ta tantuba mali be Jou Lahatalla nua nabina laitane, “I cia osta smatna du smat Nasaret i.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohanes ta nfasisopca ncula smatna diwane wlorina bo rsiap rderera Jou</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mrk. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">Luk. 3:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />En smat isa ngahnyo Yohanes, i jaga ncisope smat. Bahngana, i nfan lali batang Yudea mali padang gurun, gagaw isa ta namliley. Mana, i jaga nfabinga Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna. I nu, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Fiwane wlomewna to bo fderera Jou Lahatalla, ningalena mnu panto Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdela I na.”<verse eid="MAT 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yohanes cia ta ntuba mali be Jou Lahatalla nu bo nlafo, ga tina rlefo mali nabi Yesaya ni kitabca laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Osta en smat isa nmautingna nfacicoal i lali smat ta si mali padang gurunna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">I nu, ‘Famawa lalingna bo failow Jou, faolang lalingna bo ftotoman I.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohanese npake juba mali unta pluna. Hnyao ni pitpitanca mali aiwani gico. I na anna kasiso fare madu ailolo. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Oras ciana, smatna lal rlafo Yohanes. Si rlafo mali bendar Yerusalem, fare mali farumi gagawe nesa mali batang Yudea, fare mali batang ta ndahle waya Yordanna. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Si rfatuwo riri dosana, gabe Yohanese ncisop si mali waya Yordan.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />En bena smat Yahudi ta rderera sogaro farisi fare sadukina lal rlafo Yohanes. Si rdore bo Yohanese ncisop si. Ga oras ta Yohanese nem si, i nu, “Ee mew tane smat ta fmayai. Nimew mayaina laisa gu ni bisana. Mati fu mewe flafo mali fduk sisope to, mewe fu osta Jou Lahatalla nfasale mew pa. <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Gabe laisa fatutua fiwane wlomewna to, mewe nane fpei be okosesi ta mafia, bo ndadi fafayal mew fiwane wlomewna to. Tina fatailo laisa ai ta nboka, piyona mafia. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Mati mew fu Abrahame ntu re bbu mewe ga Jou Lahatalla osta nfasale mew pa. Ya ikuwa mew, gabe laisa Jou Lahatalla nailow, I bisa npei pat tane ndadi Abrahame ntu re bbu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Jou Lahatalla nciape to bo nfasal farumi smat ta rderera I pana. Tina fatailo laisa smat isa nciap re bacu bo ncelap ai ta piyona mayai, taga ntopa i lali yapca.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Ya isisope mew re waya, ga tina ndadi fafayal mew fiwane wlomewna to fderera Jou Lahatalla. Ga fola ya tane, en Smat isa bo nlafo, I ni kawasana foloi mali ya i. Ga bo idadi I ni sulsula bo ikute ni nal tasa bere ya bisa pa. I cia ta bo ncisope mew npake Jou ni Rohca fare yap. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />I bo nfara smat ta rderera I fare smat ta rderera I pana. Tina fatailo laisa smat ta rtafa gandum bo rfara ni irna. Gandum ta mafiana dising mali gagaona, taga ni irna rtopa lali yap ta nmatmat paca.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohanese ncisop Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mrk. 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk. 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Oras tina, Yesuse nlafo mali batang Galilea nfan lali waya Yordan bo Yohanese ncisop I. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Ga Yohanese nbasamna pantas pa bo ncisop Yesusna, gabe i nu, “Ya ta nane iduk sisop mali Apa i. Pesaga Apa mlafo mali ya ina?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Gabe Yesuse nua i, “Laina to aw ta msisop Ya. Ningalena gabe aw msisop Ya tina, ite tpei tderera ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nailowna.” Yohanes nlonga tina, ncisop Yesuse.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Yohanese ncisop Yesuse fola, Yesuse ncapang mali wayaca. Oras cia to, langitca nmarasia gabe Yesuse nem Jou Lahatalla ni Rohca laisa mani pombona nduri nap Yesus I. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Fare rlonga Jou Lahatalla lio mali sorogaca laitane, “Tae Ya Ntuk I, Ya i igogoru I na gaole. I ta npei wlokna sangnang.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Setanna riri kolanoca nyakul Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mrk. 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk. 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Fola tina, Jou ni Rohca nut Yesus lali padang gurun gagaw isa ta namliley, bo setanna riri kolanoca nyakul I. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Mali gagaw cia, Yesuse nceli pa mnuwona wol yafafat doram yafafat, denabe I nbibisil. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Oras cia, setanna riri kolanoca nlafo lali Yesus i gabe nu, “Aw tane Jou Lahatalla Ntu Aw, paga? Gabe laina, msula pat tane bo ndadi roti.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Ga Yesuse nailow pa, gabe nu laitane, “Mali Jou ni Kitab cana en rlefo laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">‘Smatna rtubna mali an be pa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:4">ga mali farumi Jou Lahatalla ni mauting ta nuna.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Fola tina, setanna riri kolanoca nut Yesus lali bendar Yerusalem, bendar ta smatna du Jou Lahatalla ni bendar i. Mana, i nising Yesus mali gagaw ta tigo molang puis mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Taga nua Yesus laitane, “Aw tane Lahatalla ntu Aw paga? Gabe laina, mpawil Aw nape to! Aw osta mpei paisa pa, ningalena mali Jou ni Kitab cana en rlefo Awna laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Jou Lahatalla bo ncula ni malaekatna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">rcagam Aw oras ta marapawilna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">bo ficomna mati neta pat nana.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Ga Yesuse nailow pa, gabe nua setanna riri kolanoca laitane, “Mali Jou Lahatalla ni Kitab cana en rlefo laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:7">‘Jou Lahatalla ta mew fsuba I, mdel pa ta mewe mtohnga I.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Fare setanna riri Kolanoca nut Yesus hawe nais lolas isa tigona gaole. I nfaemo Yesus farumi kerajaan ta mali dunia taena fare kerajaan tina ni kayangna. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Gabe setanna riri kolanoca nua Yesus, “Farumi ta Aw mem tane ya bo ipo Aw, gabe laisa Aw msuba ya.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Ga Yesuse nua i, “E setanna riri kolano, mpiya mana! Ningalena mali Jou ni Kitab cana rlefo laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">‘Mew nane fsuba Jou Lahatalla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:10">fare mew nane flonga be I.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Fola tina, setanna riri kolanoca nfateam Yesus, gabe malaekatna rlafo ga si re I fare rleleane I.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule mali batang Galilea bo smatna diwane wlorina rderera Jou</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mrk. 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk. 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Oras ciana, Yesuse nlonga, Yohanes ta nfasisopca rwafo i ga rfasunga i bui. Nlonga abar tina, I nuwe lali pnu Nasaret mali batang Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Mali Nasaret, I nfan hawe taga nteteam mali bendar Kapernaum ta i mali talaga Galilea lapoca, mali suku Zebulon re suku Naftalina riri batang. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Fare Yesuse nteteam mali Kapernaum tina, bo ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nuwa nabi Yesaya ta ntuba ndadi i to laitane,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Smat ta rteteam mali batang Zebulon fare batang Naftalina, ta si mali talaga Galilea lapo, fare mali batang waya Yordan puli paona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">smat ta rteteam manana, smatna Yahudi pa.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Smat ta manana rfayala Jou Lahatalla pa, laisa smat ta rteteam pumul dororamna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Ga si demi to plangan isa ta nmamagalna gaole.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Smat ta rteteam pumul dororam ciana bo rmatna, si re Jou Lahatalla pa denabe lali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">ga plangan cia i mana to bo nfafcule laling bo si rduk salamat.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Oras mali Kapernaumna, Yesuse mulaine nfabinga Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna, “Fiwane wlomewna to bo fderera Jou Lahatalla, ningalena mnu panto Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdela I na!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw ni murit ta ntubana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mrk. 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk. 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Bahnga laitane, Yesuse nfan ndel mali talaga Galilea lapo, gabe I nem smat silu rfatenow. Isa ngahnyo Simon ta smatna jaga dololaw i Petrus, fare isaca ngahnyo Andreas. Smat silu tasine rfalabang iyan mali talagaca, ningalena si riri karajanna diyawa be iyan. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesuse nololaw si, “Mali, bo fderera Ya! Mew biasa fiyawa iyan, ga Ya bo ifafcule mew fiyawa smate bo rderera Ya.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Rlonga tina, smat silu tasa rfateame riri labangna taga rderera Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan hawe I nem smat silu rfatenow hawe. Ta isa ica ngahnyo Yakobus, isa haweca ngahnyo Yohanes. Smat silu tasa rfarerer re hmarica Zebedeus, rfapepeya riri labangna mali pelang tasa. Ga Yesuse nololaw si. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Fare tina to smat silu tasa rfateame riri pelang tasa fare hmarica, taga rderera Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule fare nfamafia smatna lal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk. 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Fola tina, Yesuse nyel farumi gagaw mali batang Galilea fare nfafcule mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina. I nfabinga Abar Mafia lali smatna ga Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano lali smat ta rdelana. I ma nfamafia smatna mali farumi riri panyaketna. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Mana smatna dafetang lali re mali ahai ta Yesuse npeina mali farumi gagaw mali batang Siria. Gabe si dut smat ta dowilna lal lali Yesus i. Smat ta dowile ga dut si lali Yesus i tina rpanyaketna rupa lalo i: En ta rbasamna kangela ningalena pirpir, en ta setanna rcung si, en bena ta rpanyaket tokobo, fare ta rfanfan pa, gabe Yesuse nfamafia ndumi si tina. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Mulain oras cia, lalna gaole smat ta rderera Yesusna: Smat mali Galilea, mali batang Dekapolis, mali bendar Yerusalem, mali batang Yudea, fare mali batang ta en mali Waya Yordan puli paona.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga Jou ni mauting puis popoca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk. 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Oras Yesuse nem smat ta rderera I na lal, I ndawil nais popo isa. Taga ntotolang, ni muritna si lali ga rdahle I. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Fare, Yesuse nmulaine nfabinga si. I nu laitane,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Rcangnange to smat ta riri re rari pa mali Jou Lahatalla nbona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">ningalena si tina to ta rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Rcangnange to smat ta wlorina nmagogoru i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">ningalena Jou Lahatalla osta npei wlorina sangnang.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Rcangnange to smat ta wlorina gagalum fare rfanenena si,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">ningalena Jou Lahatalla osta npo dunia tae lali sili.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Rcangnange to smat ta rlokolo rpei be okosesi ta mafia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">ningalena Jou Lahatalla osta nfasangnang si.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Rcangnange to smat ta rfaeme riri masiena lali smate nesanana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">ningalena Jou Lahatalla osta nfaem I ni masiena lali sili.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Rcangnange to smat ta wlorina mafia mali Jou Lahatalla nbona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">ningalena si osta dem Jou Lahatalla.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Rcangnange to smat ta rfamafio smate nesa ta rfatotolena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">ningalena Jou Lahatalla osta nu tina I ntu si.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Rcangnange to smat ta rduk kangelana ningalena rpei be okosesi ta mafia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">ga si tina to ta bo rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Fsangnange to ningalena mew fderera Ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:11">smatna osta riri le mew,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:11">rfakangela mew, fare en ta rfamayai ngahnyo mewna.<verse eid="MAT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Fsangnang fare fsenga to, ningalena Jou Lahatalla nfasiape namew sagige mulona mamagal mali soroga i.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:12">Ningalena, nabi ta ntubanama rduk kangela laisa ta mewe fduk tane.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rdelana nane dute smate nesana mafia fatailo laisa gasi fare planganna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mrk. 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk. 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mew tane fatailo laisa re gasi ta mali dunia tae nfamna an. Laina bena re nimew tubca mali dunia tae, mewe nane fpei smate nesana mafia. Gabe mew fpei smatna mayai, mewe laisa gasi ta mtuna fare bisa panto bo payasing hawena. Ta mafiana topa to bo smatna rfafilfila.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Mew bena fatailo laisa plangan ta mali dunia tae bo nfaplangno smatna. Laina bena re nimew tub ta mali dunia tae, mew nane fute smatna famafia. Ga smatna osta dem okosesi ta mafia ta mew fpei, laisa re si dem bendar isa puis lolasca bisa pa bo tgogan i na. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Enpa smat ta rtaping padamara taga rtabake plangnona. Ta molangna i osta nising padamaraca mali gagaona bo nfaplangno farumi smat ta en mali ebai ciana. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Laina bena re mew. Mewe nane fpei be okosesi ta mafia bo smatna dem ahai ta mew fpei tina bo si rcuba re rfamamagal Jou Lahatalla, mew nimew Apa ta mali soroga i ca.”<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nlafo bo farumi ta nabina rlefo mali Jou ni Kitab ciana bisa ndadi i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Yesuse nu, “Mati mew fbafikire fu, Ya ilafo mali dunia tae bo ifayangis fatfato ta en mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare mali nabi nesana riri kitabna. Ga, Ya ilafo bo ahai ta rlefo tina bisa ndadi i. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Mewe flonga famafia e! Langit fare bumi tae osta mjakam, ga fatfato ta mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare nabi nesana riri kitabna tina osta mnyangis pa, biarega hurup isa. Farumi tina en denabe ta Jou Lahatalla nu ntuba to tina ndadi ndumi i to. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Gabe tina, ise ta ncapial fatfato isa be, biarega nenena molang, taga nfafcule smate nesana rderera laisa i, i cia bo ndadi smat ta riri ngale pa mali Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano. Ga ise ta nderera ndumi fatfato tina taga nfafcule smate nesana bo smatna rderera laisa i, i cia bo ndadi smat ta ningalena mamagal mali Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Gabe, flonga famafia ta Ya bo iku tane. Guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi, si du rderera Jou Lahatalla ni fatfatona, naga si rpei pa ta mafia mali Jou Lahatalla nbona. Ga mew tane nane fpei ta mafia mali Jou Lahatalla nbona gabe laisa failow fdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smate mew ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali nimew tubca.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati ffatotolena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk. 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mewe ftoto fatfato ta ite hma re bbur tantuba rdukna, laitane ‘Mati fpune smatna. Ise ga npune smat osta rfasal i.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Gabe Ya bo ikuwa mew e, ise gabe ntolea be ni delca, i nane rfasal i. Gabe ise nfapopta be ni delca, nane durus i mali agama Yahudina riri smat mamagal ta tigo molangca ta ngahnyo Mahkama Agama. Fare ise ta nu ni delca nto paisa pa, i nane rfasal ina mali narakaca. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Gabe laisa mew fute nimew aiwani bo fpo sadaka lali Jou Lahatalla I, mali gagaw ta rtapngo i sadakaca, ga oras ciana mew wlomew yaneto en smat ta wlorina mayai mali mewi, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />mewe fateam su nimew sadaka aiwani tina mali gagaw cia nbona. Taga ffan lali smatca bo famafio mew su re i, taga flolai fpo nimew sadakana lali Jou Lahatalla i.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Okosesi nesa hawe, laisa en smatna du mew fsal, gabe bo dute mew lali hakimna, mew nane fatoale famafio mew su oras ta mali lalingca fapaluan. Ningalena gabe laisa famafio mew pa, ta molangna osta rfabo mew lali hakimna. Taga hakimna rpo mew lali smat ta njaga buica, taga smat cia nfasunga mew bui. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Flolam famafia, mew osta fsapang pa mali buica gabe laisa fpalase ndumi paube ahai ta hakimca ncula fpalasna.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati fyal salna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />Mewe fto to fatfato tae, ‘Mati flokolo smate ni uatna fare smate ni ngolona.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ga Ya bo ikuwa mew, gabe laisa en manna dem maping ga mali wlona nlokolo i fare bo namtuli re i, tina laisa re nyal sale to. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Poko be mta mew welana denabe mew fderera Ya panto, ffablelate to bo ftopa mta mew tina! Ta mafiana mta mew pao mnyangis ga Jouca nfasale mew pa, biare ga mta mewna ntotim ga nimew badanca farumi i rtopa i lali narakaca. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Gabe laisa kakamo mew welana npei denabe mew ndadi fbaradosa, fkati to bo ftopa kakamo mew tina! Ga ta mafiana kakamo mew paona mnyangis, biarega kakamo mewna ntotim ga nimew badanca farumi i ncung naraka.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati ffatalakna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat. 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mrk. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk. 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />Yesuse nu hawe, “En fatfato nesa hawe laitane, ‘Ise ga ntalake ni ngolota, i nane npo surat talakca lali ni ngolota i.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ga Ya bo ikua mew e, manca bisa ntalake ni ngolota gabe laisa ni ngolota nyal cal mali mane nesa. Gabe enpa, ga man cia ntalake ni ngolota, tina i npei ni ngolo cia ndadi ncal mali Jou Lahatalla nbona. Ningalena, gabe maping ta ntalak i to ca nfasaw hawe re mane nesa, tina laisa re maping cia nlokolo mane nesa ta i ni uat i pa, gabe man ta nfasawa ica ncal bena mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, ningalena man cia ma nlokolo mapinge nesa ta i ni ngolo i pa.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati fsasina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mew flonga to fatfato isa hawe ta ite hma re bbur tantubana rduk i, laitane, ‘Mati fcapial sasina. Gabe laisa mew fsasi fu Jou Lahatalla, mew nane fpei sasi cia.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ga Ya bo ikuwa mew, mdel pa ta bo fsasi! Mati fsasi fu ‘langit cana’, ningalena langit cia Jou Lahatalla ni karapesa i bo nkawasana. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Mewe ma mati fsasi fu bumi cana, ningalena bumi cia Jou Lahatalla ni gagaw i bo nfatige ficona. Mewe ma mati fsasi fu bendar Yerusalemna, ningalena bendar cia Jou Lahatalla ni i, I cia Kolano ta nmamagal. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Mewe ma mati fsasi fu boboko mew nana, ningalena mew nimew kawasa pa, bo fpei fa bubulang pene pa fa gogo nimew utana biarega cicapo isa.<verse eid="MAT 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Gabe laisa fatutua, fu, fatutua, gabe enpa fu enpa, ningalena gabe laisa mew funa foloi mali tina, tina mali setanna riri kolanoca mali.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fbalco si ta mafia smat ta wlorina mayai lali mewina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk. 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mewe ma flonga to sogaro ta nu laitane, ‘Gabe en smat ta rfamayai mtamewna, mewe ma fbalco i ffamayai mtana. Gabe en smat ta rwogale fmomewna, mewe ma fbalco i fwogale fmona.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ga tane Ya bo ikua mewe, gabe laisa smatna rpeo mew okosesi ta mayai, mew mati fbalco si ta mayaina. Gabe laisa ise naspakale ngengeo mew welana fpo hawe ngengeo mew balitna. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Fare en smatna rtuntute mew mali pengadilanna bo i nuntunge mew nduke nimew kabayaca, mew fpo hawe nimew jubaca lali. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Gabe laisa en smatna rpaksa mew fpapa riri ginana laona kilo pusa, mew fpapa to bo fan fbang kilo fapusa hawe bo ndadi kilo pilu. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Gabe laisa en smatna rdoro mew okosesi, mewe fpo si to ahai ta si rdorna. Gabe laisa smatna rbawi okosesi mali mewi, mewe fbawo si to.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fgogoru nimew musuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk. 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />Mewe flonga to fatfato ta nu laitane, ‘Mew nane fgogoru nimew del delona, fare nimew le musuna.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ga tane Ya bo ikua mew e, mewe nane fgogoru nimew musuna, fare fsombayang si smat ta jaga rfakangela mewna. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Gabe mewe fpei laina, tina mew ffaem ga mew Apa ta mali sorogaica ntuna. I ta npei wolca bo nfaplangno smat ta wlorina mafia fare ta wlorina mayai. I bena ta nfadurea ulan mali smat ta rpei okosesi ta molang fare smat ta rpei okosesina molang pa. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Gabe laisa mewe fgogoru be smat ta rgogoru mewna, ahai ta mewe bo fdukna? Mati fmaulango fu Jou Lahatalla bo nbalase nimew mafianana. Smat ta nfayalo pajakca nbaradosa ga si ma rgogoru smat ta rgogoru sina. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Gabe laisa mew fu tabeana lali nimew del-delona be, mati fmaulango Jou Lahatalla ntaile mewna. Ningalena, smat ta rfayala Jou Lahatalla pana bere rbalco tabea lali smat ta du tabea lali silina. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Ga mewe nane fgogoru farumi smatna re tutuo, laisa mewe nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica ta n'gogoru farumi smatna re tutuo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Tgali smatna nane fatutua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Flolam famafia! Mdel pa ta bo mew fpei okosesi ta molang mali smatna rbona bo si dem taga rfamamagale mew. Gabe laisa mew fpei laina, mew osta fduk sagige mulo pa mali nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Gabe, laisa mew fpo okosesi bo fgali smat ta riri re rari pana, mati fabinga smatnana laisa smat ta rmadarawa nana. Oras ta si rpo tiwi, lali ebai sombayangna mali lalingna, si jaga duf trompet bo smatna rto si rpo okosesi gabe smatna rfamamagal si. Flonga famafia, taitail ta si rduk mali smat tina, tina to si rari sagige mulona, ga mali Jou Lahatalla I na si rduk paisa pa. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Ga laisa mewe bo ffaoce okosesi lali smat ta riri re rari pana mewe ffaocena mati lio mewna. Tina laisa ahai ta kakamo mew welana npo, kakamo balitna mati ntona. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Laina to smate nesana rto pa mew ffaoce okosesi lali smat ta riri re rari pana, ga paisapa nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica nto. I neme mew fpei lainana, gabe I osta nbalco mew ta mafiana.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule mfalaisa bo tcombayangna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk. 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe laisa mew bo fsombayang, mati fsombayang laisa smat ta rmadarawa nana. Ningalena, si tina laisa rcombayang rlokolo dosal mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina fare mali gagaw ta ni smatna lalna, rpei laina bo smatna dem fare rfamamagal si. Flonga famafia e, taitail ta si rduk mali smat tina, tina to si rari sagige mulona. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Ga laisa mewe bo fsombayang, fsung namul nimew kamar i fkait bawa, taga fsombayang lali nimew Apa ta smatna demi pa cia. Gabe laisa mew fpei laina, mew nimew Apa ta smatna demi pa cia, osta nbalco re ta mafiana lali mewi. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Gabe laisa mew bo fsombayang, mati laisa smat ta rfayala Jou Lahatalla pana biasa rpei. Si rcombayangna mlanga fare rfaloloila, si du nama, gabe laisa tcombayang laina, Jou Lahatalla bo nlonga fare npo okosesi ta si rdorna. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Gabe mew, mati fderera sina. Biarega mew fdor paube, nimew Apaca nto to ahai ta mew bo fdorna. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Gabe, laisa mew bo fsombayang, fsombayangna laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Animam Apa ta Aw mali soroga i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">farumi kfamamagal Apa.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Ame kdor Apa mlafo bo mkawasa mdadi Kolano mali nimam tub tae.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">Biarega farumi ta Apa mailowna ndadi i mali dunia tae, laisa re ta ndadi i mali soroga i. <verse eid="MAT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Mpo am an mali wol pusa tae.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Fare mampunge nimam salna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">laisa re amam kampunge smat ta rcal mali amamina.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ga mati mfabiar ame bo kpei okosesi ta mayaina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">ga mowe ame to mali okosesi ta mayaina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">[Ningalena Apa ta mdadi Kolano, Apa ta nim kawasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">fare ta mafiana amame kfamamagal Aw fare ksuba Aw denabe lali. Fatutua fare molang.’]<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Gabe laisa, mew fampunge smat ta rpei sal mali mewina, nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica ma osta nampunge mew. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Gabe laisa mew failow pa fampunge smat ta rpei sal lali mewina, nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica ma osta nampunge mew pa.”<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Puasa ta molang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe laisa mew fpuasa, mati faeme uhngo mew ta gugufanana laisa smat ta rmadarawana. Si rfaem laina bo smate nesa nem si rpuasa gabe rfamamagal si. Mewe flonga famafia e! Taitail ta si rduk mali smat tinana, tina to si rari sagige mulona. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ga laisa mewe fpuasa, famafia nimew utana fpake egat, fare fauwase uhngo mewna bo fberesi, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />bo smate nesana rto pa mewe fpuasa, ga nimew Apa ta smatna demi pa cia ta nto. Gabe laisa mewe fpei laina, mew nimew Apa ta nem cia, osta nbalco mew ta mafia.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fayalo arata mali Sorogaca be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk. 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mewe mati fayalo arata mali dunia ina ningalena gigoap fare kacenna bo nfamayai, fare smat ta rmaloisna faparparle ga jal arata tina. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Ta mafiana nimew tubca fpake i bo ffpei be ta Jou Lahatalla wlo lolona. Gabe mewe fpei laina, tina laisa mewe fayalo arata mali sorogai. Gigoap fare kacenna bisa rfamayai pa arata tina fare smat ta rmaloisna bisa rfaparparle pa bo jalna arata tina. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Ya iku laina ningalena manca me nimew aratana en, mana bena mew wlomewna en.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mewe mta mewna fatailo laisa padamara ta nfaplangno wlomewna. Gabe laisa me mta mewna femana mafia, me wlomewna ma nderera ga plangan. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Gabe laisa mta mewna femana tutiyai pa, wlomew nama dororam, tina ningale, me wlomewna dororamna gaole.<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Enpa smat isa nkarajanna bahnga be mali tuan siluna, ta molangna i osta nlonga be ni tuan isaca, taga ta isaca i nlonga i pa. Laina bena re mew, gabe laisa mew ftubna fayalo be arata mali dunia tae, mew fkarajanna fatutua pa bo Jou Lahatallana.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati wlomewna ncusa re nimew tubcana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk. 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe tina, flolam famafia ta Ya bo ikua mew tane, mati wlomewyancusana re nimew tubcana, ahai ta mew bo fan fare ahai ta bo fdomna. Mewe ma mati wlomewna ncusa re nimew badan cana, ahai ta mew bo fpakena. Mew fto nimew tub cia npentingna foloi mali ahai ta mew bo fan fare fdomna. Fare nimew badan cia npenting foloi mali pake ta mew bo fpakena. <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Co mew ftarokira mani ta dopana! Mani tina rcake gei pa, rfakati pa, re disinge rari an pa, ga hma mew ta mali sorogaica nfaseli si. Ahai ga mew! Jou Lahatalla n'gogoru mewna gaole foloi mali mani tina? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Gabe laisa mew wlo mewyancusana re nimew tubca wol de wol, ga mew bisa falanga nimew umurna? Bisa pa, o?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Fare mewe ma mati wlo mewyancusana re nimew kabayanana. Co mew ftarokira bungana ta rtub mali betina, mafiana gaole. Bunga tina rkarajan pa, fare rpei lawe pa bo rpei kabayana. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Gabe flonga famafia ta Ya bo ikua mew tane, kolano Salomo ta ni re naca, i ni kabayana mafia pa, mafia be bungana. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Bunga ta mali betina bere Jou Lahatalla neyan fare nfamafia, naga bunga tina wol pusa tae en, mdoma mang fare rtaping i to. Laina bena re mew smatna, Jou Lahatalla osta neyane mew fare famafia nimew tubca. Pesaga mewe fdela I uwatu pana?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Gabe, mew mati famcaitna bo fu, ‘Ahai ta amame bo kanna?’ Fare, ‘Ahai ta bo kdomna?’ Fare, ‘Ahai ta amame bo kpakena?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Ningalena, smat ta rdela Jou Lahatalla pana be ta wlorina ncusa farumi tina. Ga mew, mati wlo mewyancusana, ningalena nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica nto ndumi ahai ta mew fparlu tina. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ta mafiana, mew fiyawa Jou Lahatalla to bo I ta nkawasa ndadi kolano mali nimew tubca, fare fpei ta molang mali I nbona. Re laina, Jou Lahatalla osta npo ndumi ahai ta mew fparluna. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Gabe, mew mati wlo mewyancusana ahai ta bo ndadi i mdomana, ningalena mdoma ni mularatna nesa bena. Nlafo ito mularat ta mew fbasam wol pusa taena, mati fikir wol ta mdoma tae ni mularat nana.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Mati fasala smat nana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk. 6:37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mdel pa ta bo fasala smate nesanana, bo Jou Lahatalla mati nfasale mewna. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Ningalena laisa mew fasala smate nesa, Jou Lahatalla ma osta nfasala mew. Gabe laisa mew fngise smate na sal, Jou Lahatalla ma nngise namew salna. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Mew flokolo ftarokira be smate nesa na sal ta nenena, taga menamew sal ta mamagalna fatengtengna! Tina fatailo laisa ai mumuno ta nenena mali smate nesa mtana, mew bisa femi, taga balak ungo ta ntibane mta mew naca, femi pa. <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Mfalaisa mew bisa fua smate nesana, ‘Mali bo isalawe ai mumuno ta mali mtamnaca’, taga balak ungo ta mali mtamew naca, mew fatengtengna i. <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Ee, smat ta mew tane fmadarawa. Mew nane fsapnga isu balak ungo ta mali mtamew naca, taga mew bisa femna mafia, bo mew bisa fsapnga ai mumuno ta mali smate nesa mtarina.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Jouca ni mautingna mati falafo lali smat ta dailow panana. Ningalena, tina fatailo laisa re mew ftopa okosesi ta mafia lali funna, gabe fun tina rlolai donge mew, laisa re mew ftopa mutiara ta mulona mamagal lali bowna, fare bow tina rfafil-fila mutiara tina.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fdor lali Jou Lahatalla i ahai ta mewe fparluna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk. 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Fdore to lali Jou Lahatalla i ahai ta mewe fparluna, lomanta I osta npo ahai ta mew fdor tina. Fiyawa to lali Jou Lahatalla I ahai ta mewe fparluna, lomanta mew osta fduk tina mali I. Ftoki to Jou Lahatalla ni bawaca, I osta ncalawe bawaca bo n'gali mew. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Ningalena ise ta ndor lali Jou Lahatalla I, i osta nduk. Ise ta niyawa i ni parluna lali Jou Lahatalla I, i osta nduk. Fare ise ta ntok Jou Lahatalla ni bawaca, Jou Lahatalla osta ncupat bawaca bo n'gali i.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Osta bisa pa, gabe laisa ntu mewca ndor an ga mew fpo i patna. <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Fare bisa pa, gabe laisa ntumewca ndor iyan, ga fpo i guna. <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Gabe makse wlomewna mayai, ga mew fto mfalaisa fpo okosesi ta mafia lali ntumewnana. Laina bena nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica! I wlona mafiana gaole, I osta npo ta mafiana lali smat ta rdoro I na.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Gabe laisa mew flokolo smatna rmasie mew, mewe ma nane fmasie si bena. Gabe fmasie smatna laina, mew fpei ndumi to ta rlefo mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare mali nabi nesana riri kitabna.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tderera laling ta nkangelaca bo tduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk. 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Fsunge to fdelo bawa ta nkosca! Gabe laisa fsungna fdelo bawa ta namsaica, tina bo fan lali narakaca, ga ni lalingna kangela pa, fare smatna lal ta rdel manana. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Gabe laisa mew fsung fdelo bawa ta nkosca, mewe bo fduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali, ga ni lalingna kangela, fare lal pa smat ta rdel manana.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Famafia re nabi ta damolang pana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk. 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mewe nane fpei famafia re nabi ta damolang pana ta rlafo mali mewi! Ga si du, si tina smat ta jaga rfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna, naga enpa. Tem sina laisa dombana, ga ta molangna si rmayai laisa fun ailolona. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Mewe bisa fto si tina nabi ta damolang pana mali ahai ta si rpeina. Tina laisa mom ta ni sogana, bisa pa bo piyona anggur penepa ara. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Farumi ai ta mafia, osta piyona ma mafia, ga ai ta mayaina osta piyona ma mayai. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Osta bisa pa aica nmafia ga piyona mayaina, fare bisa pa bena aica nmayai ga piyona mafiana. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Ga ai ta piyona mayaina, osta smatna rcelap taga rtaping. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Gabe ite bisa tto smat cia fatutua nabi i, gabe laisa ta i npei tina mafia.”<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna farumi pa bo rdai Jou Lahatalla ni smatna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk. 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Farumi smat pa ta dololaw Ya, ‘Jou, Jou’ bo rdai Ya nike smatna ga Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali riri tubca, ga smat ta jaga rpei Ya nik Apa ta mali sorogaica nimauna be. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Lomanta mali wol kiamatca, smatna lal ta bo dua Ya laitane, ‘Jou! Jou! Amam tane ta kfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna kpake Jou Lahatalla ngahnyo. Amame ma kfaungo setan mali smatna, kpake Jou ni kawasa. Fare amam bena kpei mujizatna lal kpake Jou ni kawasa.’<verse eid="MAT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Ga oras cia to, Ya bo ikua si laitane, ‘Ya ifayala mew bahnga paube. Fpiya to mantane, mew ta jaga fpei be okosesi ta mayai!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rdelana nane tderera ta Yesuse nuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk. 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe smatna isa nlonga ta Ya ku tane ga nderera, i cia fatailo laisa smat ta rpandena ta nfaosal ebai mali fandasi ta ni patna cicoal. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Gabe biarega ulan mamagalca nlafo denabe ipis, latanca ncicoal fare ncipang ebai cia, ebai cia namop pa ningalena i nosal puis fandasi ta ni patna cicoalca.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Ga smat ta rlonga ta Ya iku tane ga rderera pa, ifatailo laisa smat ta rto paisapana ta rfaosal ebai mali nyinyenca popo. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Oras ulan mamagalca nlafo ipis, fare latanca ncicoal ncipang ebai cia, ebai cia namope ga abis i.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna lal rdadi rherang oras ta rlonga Yesuse ni nfafculena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Oras ta Yesuse nmautinge fola, smat ta lal tina rdadi rherang re ni fafcule tina. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Ningalena isa pa ta nto fafcule ga laisa Yesusnana, nfaiteta ipa re laisa si riri guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa npado</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mrk. 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk. 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesuse nduri puis popo cia, ga smatna lal ta rderera I na. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Oras cia, en smat isa npanyaket pado nlafo lali Yesus i. Smatca nlu nap Yesuse nbona taga nu laitane, “Apa, gabe laisa mailow, mfamafia ya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Gabe Yesuse nice smat cia fare nu, “Ya ikailow aw mmafia. Gabe oras tae, awe mmafia to!” Oras cia to, smat ta npado cia nmafia.<verse eid="MAT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua smat cia, “Wlomyaneto e, aw mati mfabinga smat nana, Ya ta ifamafia aw. Gabe mfan lali imamca bo i nem ga awe mmafia to, fare mpo nim aiwani faisa bo mpoi sadaka bo Jou Lahatalla, laisa ta nabi Musa nfasulana. Aw mpei laina bo smatna rto, aw fatutua mafia to.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia tentara Romana riri ta nfaboboko sica ni smat karajan isa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk. 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Oras ta Yesuse ncung bendar Kapernaum, tentara Romana riri ta nfaboboko sica nlafo lali Yesus I. I ndor lali Yesus I. I nu, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />“Apa, ya nik smat karajan isa oras tae i mali ebai i nowil. Ni badanca bisa n'ngangala panto. I nkangelana gaole.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesuse nua i, “Ya bo ifan lali nim ebai i bo ifamafia i.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Ga tentarana riri ta nfaboboko sica nua Yesus, “Apa, mati mlafo mali ya nik ebai cana, ningalena ya smat Yahudi ya pa gabe pantas pa bo Apa mfan mali nik ebai ina. Ta mafiana Apa mu mauting fapusa mantane, osta nike smat karajanca nmafia. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Ningalena, ya ito Apa anim kawasa msula smatna bisa rmafia, fatailo re amam tentarana ma bisa ksula smatna. Ya en nike smat ta rfaboboko ya na, ya ma en ni wawai ta rlonga ya. Gabe laisa ya isula nik wawaina, ‘Mfan,’ i osta nfan. Gabe laisa ya isula nik wawai ta nesana, ‘Mlafo,’ i osta nlafo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Nlonga tentarana riri ta nfabobokoca nu laina, Yesuse nherangna gaole, gabe nua smat ta rderera I na, “Flonga famafia e ta Ya bo ikua mew tane, taga bahnga tane Ya iduke smat isa ndela Jouna cicoalna gaole mali farumi smat Israelna, naga i smate Israel i pa, smat Roma i! <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Flolam e, osta smatna lal ga smat Yahudi pa mali farumi gagaw mali dunia tae, mali po lao denabe po leo, si farumi bo rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat, fare si rtotolang rceli farerer re Abraham, Ishak fare Yakub mali Jou Lahatalla gagaoca ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Ga biare smat Yahudina Jou Lahatalla nfisange ntuba si bo rdadi I ni smat si, mali silina lal ta si pulina pana. Jou Lahatalla osta ntopa si mali gagaw ta ndororamca. Mana si osta rtangis fare rkangelana gaole.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua tentarana riri ta nfaboboko sica, “Tane to apa muwe! Apa mdela biarega Ya i mauting mantane, apa nim smat karajanca osta nmafia. Gabe oras tae apa nim smat karajanca nmafia to laisa re ta apa mdelana.” Oras cia to smat karajanca nmafia.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia Simone ohmo fare smate nesana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mrk. 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Fola tina Yesuse nfan lali Petruse ni ebai i. I nem Petruse ohmo ta maping ica namtuli, ningalena nowil. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yesuse nice maping cia kakamona, fare tina to mapingca nmafia. Maping cia npalinge ga nleleane Yesuse nceli.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Lase bo doram, en ta rlafona dute smat ta setane ncung sina lali Yesus I, fare I nfaungo setan tina re parenta isa be. Yesus bena nfamafia farumi smat ta dowilna. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Farumi ta Yesuse npeina, ndadi ndumi i laisa ta Jou Lahatalla nua nabi Yesaya tantuba malina laitane, “I ta ntanggo ite rir kangelana fare famafia it mali rir owilna.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gabe tderera Yesus nane fatutua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk. 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Oras Yesuse nem smatna lal rjeli I, I ncula ni muritna rfasiap pelange bo rcali lali talagaca puli pao. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Ga en guru agama isa ta nto Musa ni kitab silim tasa nlafo Yesus. I nu laitane, “Guru, ya bo iderera Aw manca be Guru bo mfanna.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesuse ncanglo i npake andeande laitane, “Fun ailolona gagaori bo damtuli. Laina bena manina riri fafual. Ga Ya Smat ta mali sorogaica, gagaok pa bo ifafolfola Ya na.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Ga smate nesa isa hawe ta nderera Yesus, nua I laitane, “Apa, mpo ya orase bo ikuwe igaile fmakca su. Fola tina taga ya ilafo iderera Apa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Ga Yesuse nua i, “Inanaito smat ta rmatna lomanta si rfagaile tutuling.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ga smat Yahudina uparaca ta bo rgaile sina pentingna gaole ga Yesuse nu ta pentingna fderera Ya smat ta rmatna duruse smat ta rmatna tutuling. Ningalena, nmat rohani.</char></note> Ga aw nane mderera Ya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafola latan ta ncicoalca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mrk. 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk. 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Fola tina, Yesuse I re ni muritna rdawil pelang tasa, taga rfalai. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Oras ta si mali talagaca, garayanna latan ta ncicoalca nlafo. Latan cia npei denabe talagaca ni mumatna gaole, denabe wayana ncapil mali riri pelang tasa. Ga oras cia, Yesuse namtuli. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Fare I ni muritna dololi I, si du, “Apa! Mgali am, amame bo kamduri to tane ya!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Gabe Yesuse npaling, fare nua si, “Ee, mew tane smat ta fdelana uwatu pa, pesaga famcaitna?” Fare Yesuse nosale ga nfafola latan fare mumat tina liona nuto mamagal. Oras tina to, latan fare mumatna nfola, gabe talagaca namnin.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Dem tina, ni muritna ndadi rherang. Gabe rfauwo si, “Latan fare mumatna rderera ta I nuna! Tae smat ahai ga e?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo setanna lal ta rcung smat silu tasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mrk. 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk. 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Rlafo puli talagaca puli pao, mali smat Gadarana riri batang. Manana, en smat silu setane ncung si, gabe smatna damcait si, denabe smatna isa pa ta bo rdel mali laling ciana. Garayanna smat si lu tasa rcapang mali piling goa na, rlafo Yesus. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ga setan ta si mali smat silu tasa rgigam, “Adodo, Yesuse Jou Lahatalla Ntu ta aw! Pesaga mlafo mantanena bo mfakangela ame lae? Anim oras ta bo mfakangelan amna nlafo paube paga?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Laupa mali tina, en bouna lalna gaole oras ciana diyawa an. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ga setanna rdor lali Yesus i laitane, “Gabe bo mfaungo am, msula ame bo ksung bou tina.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Fsapange to bo ffan lali!” Fare setanna rcapang mali smat silu tasa taga rfan rcung bou tina. Bou tina rfarerana rfacicoal si lali ta maratopasna, taga rpawile ndumi nap talagaca fare rmat mana. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Smat ta rjaga bouna dem tina, rfarera ga rlafo mali bendarna, si dafetange ndumi ta ndadi i tina. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Smat ta mali bendar ciana rlonga tina si damcait gabe rcapang mali bendar cia rfan lali Yesus i. Oras ta si rfadukduk re Yesus, si rdore bo Yesuse ncapang mali riri batangna.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa nfanfan pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mrk. 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Fola tina, Yesus I re ni muritna rcaplo pelang tasa taga rpalan si hawe lali talagaca puli pao, mali bendar ta I ntetemo ica<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bendar ta I ntetemo ica bendar Kapernaum. Bisa fem mali Mat. 4:12-13 </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Garayan laitane, en smat sifis dute smat isa nfanfan pa lali Yesus I, si rfatuli i mali musala isa. Oras ta Yesuse nem si dute smat ta nfanfan paca lali I, I nto si rdela I. Gabe Yesuse nua smat ta nfanfan paca, “Tenok ta aw, anim dosana Ya ifayangise to gabe aw msangnange to.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Manana en bena guru agama diranca ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa. Rlonga Yesuse nu laina, si rmauting mali wlorina laitane, “Ga smat tae npei ni dirica laisa Jou Lahatalla.”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Ga Yesuse nto si wlorina, gabe I nua si laitane, “Pesaga mew fututa ta mayainana? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Oras ta Ya kua smat ta nfanfan pa tae, ‘Anim dosana ifayangise to,’ mewe osta fdela pa smat cia ni dosana Ya ifayangise to. Gabe laisa Ya iku, ‘Mpalinge bo mfan,’ mewe fto Ya nik kawasa, ningalena mew fem i nfan. <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Gabe tane Ya bo ifamafia i, bo mewe fto, mali dunia tae Ya Smat ta mali sorogaica en bena nik kawasana bo nfayangise smatna riri dosa.” Gabe Yesuse nua smat ta nfanfan pa cia, “Mpalinge to, mlange nim musalaca, fare muwe to lali nim ebai i!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Fare smat ta nfanfan paca npaling, nuwe lali ni ebai i. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Smat ta lalna dem tina, si damcait gabe si rcuba re rfamamagal Jou Lahatalla, ningalena I npo kawasa ta mamagal tina lali smat ta mali dunia tae.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw Matiuse bo nderera I</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mrk. 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan nfateam gagaw cia, ga I nem smat ta nfautno pajakca ntotolang mali ebai pajakca lolo. Smat cia ngahnyo Matius. Gabe Yesuse nua i, “Mali bo mderera Ya.” Nlonga tina, Matiuse nosale ga nderera Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Fola mana, Yesus I re ni muritna rfane rceli mali Matiuse ni ebaica. Manana en bena smat ta rfautno pajakna fare smate nesa ta smatna du si rbaradosa. Si rceli farerer re Yesuse ni muritna.<verse eid="MAT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mana ma en bena smat agama Yahudi ta rderera sogaro farisi. Oras ta si dem Yesuse nceli farerer re smat ta du si rbaradosa tina, si dua Yesuse ni muritna, “wataw, pesaga nimew Guruca nceli farerer re smat ta rfautno pajakna fare smate nesa ta rbaradosanana?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesuse nlonga si du laina, fare nua si laitane, “Smat ta rcehatnapa rparalu mamana, ga smat ta dowilna. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Co mew flonga ahai ta, Jou Lahatalla nu mali Kitabcana laitane, ‘Ta Ya ikalow tina, mewe nane fmasie smate nesana, biarega fpo nimew aiwani bo rpeo sadaka, gabe nimew masie lali smatna enpa nfaiteta i be.’ Ningalena Ya ilafo bo ikololaw smat ta rbasam riri dirica namolang napa ga Ya ilafo bo ikololaw smat ta rbaradosana.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ni muritna rpuasa pa oras ta si re I subena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mrk. 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Fola tina, Yohanes ta nfasisopca ni muritna rlafo Yesus. Si rfautno I, “Amam fare smat ta rderera fatfato Farisina biasa kpuasa, pesaga Apa nim muritna rpuasa pana?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesuse ncanglo si npake andeande laitane, “Ya tane fatailo laisa man ta nfasawca. Gabe laisa man ta nfasawca i mali rame fasawca sube, osta ni del-delona rmagogoru si pa. I re si rfasangnang si sube. Ga osta en ni orasna, smatna rjal man ta nfasaw cia mali si fapaluanna. Oras cia taga si rpuasa.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Laina bena, smatna isa pa ta ndilip obat po npake ni kabaya ta ago icana. Ningalena gabe laisa bo tosfa kabaya cia, obat po ta ndilpe ica osta nluli i fare kabaya agoca osta nmarasekanna mamagal hawe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesus npei andeande silu tasine bo si rto I ni sogarona mdel pa ta bo fabangbanga re fatfato agama ta smatna rpeina. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Laina bena, aiwani gico ta si rpeo anggur gagao. Gabe laisa ago ito osta enpa smat ta dafrao i anggur ta pona. Ningalena gabe laisa, anggur gagao ta mali aiwani gicoca ago i to, i ni gicoca ncicoal. Gabe, smatna laisa dafrai anggur ta po mali anggur gagao ta ago tona fare anggur ta pona ndawi, anggur po tina osta nfarapes anggur gagao ta ago ica, fare anggurna maraepa. Gabe tina, smatna osta dafrai anggur ta pona mali gagao ta po bena, bo anggur tina fare gagaoca ntahanna mnu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfapaling Yairuse ntu ta nmatca fare nfamafia maping ta nfanye laflafca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mrk. 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk. 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Oras ta Yesuse nmauting re Yohanes ta nfasisopca ni muritna, en smat isa nlafo Yesus. I cia ta nfaboboko mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina isa. Smat cia nlu mali ta Yesuse nbona, taga nu laitane, “Guru, ya ntukca maping i, taga nmat. Gabe laisa masie ya Guru mlafo su, bo mfatige kakamomna mali wai cia, bo i npaling hawe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesuse nlonga tina, nosal, gabe I re ni muritna rderera smat cia rfan lali ni ebai i.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Oras ta si rfanfanna, en maping isa ndahle Yesus mali taona, taga nice Yesuse ni jubaca cicapo okoce. Maping cia taun yafasa re failu to nfanye laflafna. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />I nice Yesuse ni jubaca cicapo okoce, i nbafikir mali wlona, “Asal ta ikice I ni jubaca be ya osta imafia.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Oras cia, Yesuse nninga namul tao, fare I nem maping cia ga nua i, “Maping ta aw, mati liomna to! Aw mafia to ningalena awe mdela Ya.” Oras cia to, maping cia nmafia.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan turus, denabe nlafo mali ta nfaboboko ebai sombayangca ni ebai i. Mana Yesuse nem smat ta duf suling fare smat ta rtangisna lal. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Ga Yesuse nua si, “Mewe fsapange to, ningalena wai maping tae nmat pa, i namtuli be.” Ga si damlifa Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Oras ta smat tina rcapang, Yesuse ncung namul wai cia ni kamarca fare nice kakamona, waica npaling hawe. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Fare farumi ta ndadi i tina smatna dafetang lali re mali farumi batang tina.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat silu ta dempa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfani mana. Gabe smat silu ta dem pa tasa rderera I fare rgigam, “Apa, Kolano Daute ntu re bbu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Denabe si dololaw i Kolano Daute ntu re bbu ningale tantubana Jou Lahatalla njanji bo npo smat isa bo nfasalamat smat, Smat cia Daute ntu re bbu i. Smat ta dem pa tasa si rfayal ta nfamafi si ca smat ta Jou Lahatalla janji bo nlafoca.</char></note> mmasie ame lae!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Oras Yesuse ncung mali ebai isa, smat silu ta dem pa tasa rlafo Yesus. Gabe Yesuse nfautno si, “Gabe mewe fdela Ya bisa ifamafia mew?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Si rcanglo I, “Ime Apa, ame kdela.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Gabe Yesuse nisinge kakamona mali mtarina taga nu, “Mewe fdela Ya to gabe oras tae ndadi to mali mewi, tderera ta mew fdelana.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Oras tina to, smat silu tasa dem hawe. Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mdel pa ta bo fabinga smatna mfalaisa denabe mewe fem hawena.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ga oras ta si rcapang mali ebai ciana, si dafetang ga Yesus mali farumi batang tina.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa nmomou ta setane ncungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Oras ta smat silu ta dem pa tasa rmafia to rcapang, garayanna en hawe ta dut lali Yesus i smat isa setane ncung i denabe nmomou. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Yesuse nfaungo setan ta ncunge smat ta nmomou cia, i ma nmauting hawe. Smat ta rfayalo si manana rherangna gaole, gabe rfauwo si, “Bahnga paube ite tem ahai ta ndadi tane mali Israel!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Ga smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina rfauwo si, “I npake setanna riri kolanoca ni kawasa nfaungo setan tinana.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna lal ta rlokolo rlonga abar ta mafia ga smat ta rfafculena lal pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesuse nyel mali farumi bendar fare pnuna, fare nfafcule mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina. I nfabinga Abar Mafia ga Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano lali smat ta rdelana. I ma nfamafia smat mali farumi panyaket fare nfamafia smat ta rcacatna. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Oras ta Yesuse nem smat ta lal tina, I nbasamna nmasie si. Ningalena, si rfatoto pa bo rpei ahai fare rmaulango isa pa, fatailo laisa domba ta riri tuan pana. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Mana Yesuse nua ni muritna, “Smat ta rlonga paube Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i ga rciap dailowna lal, ga smat ta bo rfabinga Abar mafiana lal pa. Fatailo laisa gandum ta mali betina motle be tkati, ga smat ta rfakatina lal pa. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Smat ta rkarajan mali bet ciana nane rdor lali ta na bet cia, bo I nbange smat ta rfakati mali bet ciana, laina bena re mew fsombayang fdor Jou Lahatalla ncula smatna lal hawe bo rfabinga Abar mafia lali smat ta rlonga paubena.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw ni murit smat yafasa re silu tasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mrk. 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesuse nololaw ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, taga npo si kawasa bo rfaungo setan fare smat ta rduk panyaketna rupa lalo i fare smat ta rcacatna. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Murit yafasa re silu tasa, bo rdadi I ni susula si, ta smatna du rasul. Tane si ngahnyorina: Simon (i ngahnyo nesana Petrus), Andreas (Simone teno tutuwo i), Yakobus fare Yohanes (Zebedeuse ntu si), <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipus, Bartolomeus, Tomas, Tadeus, Matius (ta ni karanjanna nfautno pajak), fare Yakobus (Alfeuse ntu i). <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />En bena Simon (ta i re ni del delona diyawa smat Roma ta rkawasa mali Israelna bo rfaungo si), fare Yudas Iskariot (ta fola bo nwage Jouca).<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncula ni murit yafasa re silu tasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mrk. 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk. 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesuse ncula ni murit yafasa re silu tasa rfanye ni karajanna, fare nfatnawe si, “Mewe mati ffan lali smat ta Yahudi sipana, fare mati fsung mali smat Samariana riri bendarnana. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ga mew ffan lali ite tenor fare ramar smat Israelna, ningalena si rderera Jou Lahatalla panto, laisa domba ta rdelencal laling. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Gabe mew fane fabinga si laitane, ‘Mnu panto, Jou Lahatalla osta Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdela Ina’. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Mewe famafia si to smat ta dowilna, fapaling si to smat ta rmatna, famafia smat ta rpanyaket padona, fare faungo setan ta rcunge smatnana. Mewe fduk kawasa tina re ni paisapa, gabe mewe ma nane fpake kawasa tina bo fgali smate nesana re ni paisapa bena. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Oras mewe fan, mdel pa ta bo fut tiwi, biarega tiwina mas, tiwi perak, ma tiwi tambaga. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Mewe ma mati fut tas ta tafrao anna, pake afianna, nal fare titialna. Ga smat ta rfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou i, i osta nduk ahai ta i nparluna bo i ni tubca.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Gabe laisa mew fsung mali bendar isa penepa pnu isa, mewe fiyawa smat ta dailowe mewna, fare fteteam mana to denabe mewe fsapang mali batang tina. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Oras ta mew ffsung mali smatna riri ebaina, mewe nane fu, ‘Tabea’, kdor Jou nbarakati farumi smat ta rteteam mali ebai taena. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Gabe laisa dute mewna mafia, barakat ta mewe fdorna osta en mali sili. Gabe laisa dute mewna mayai, barakat ta mew fdorna osta en mali sili pa. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Gabe laisa en smat mali ebai isa penepa bendar isa dailowe mew pa fare rlonga nimew sogaro napa, fsapang mali ebai cia fare bendar cia. Pepesa ta en mali ficomewna fatibtibe mana, bo fawloyaneto si, ningalena si rcal mali Jou Lahatalla I. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Flolam famafia e, lomanta mali wol kiamatca, oras ta Jou bo nadili farumi smatna, smat ta dailowe mew pa tina osta rduk salna tebtebna foli mali sal ta smat mali bendar Sodom fare bendar Gomora rdukna.”<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfacicoale ni muritna wlori oras ta ncula sina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mrk. 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk. 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Yesuse nua ni muritna hawe, “Flonga e! Ya isula mew ffan lali smat ta rmayaina fapaluan, tina fatailo laisa domba ntu isa nfan lali fun ailolona fapaluan. Gabe mewe nane fpei famafia, fare wlomewna nane molang. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mewe nane fpei famafia lali farumi smat! Ningalena, en smat ta bo rpo mew lali agama Yahudina riri ta rfabobokona bo dadili mew. Mewe ma bo fduk punpun mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina, rpake wala ga mali cicapona en ni okosesi ta mdalim. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Ningalena mewe fderera Ya, lomanta si dute mew fbo gubernurna fare kolanona. Tina me nimew oras bo fabinga ga Ya lali sili fare lali smat ta rfayala Jou Lahatalla pana. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Gabe laisa dute mew taga rpo mew bo dadili mew, mati famcaitna ahai ta mew bo funa. Lomanta mali oras cia to, Jou Lahatalla osta npo mew ahai ta mew bo fua sina. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Ningalena, mew nimew mauting pa ta ncapangna, ga nimew Apa ni Rohca, I ta bo npo mauting tina lali mewi.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Lomanta en ni orasnan, smatna osta rpo tenori fare ramarina rpun famat si. Laina bena re apana, si osta rpeo nturina laina. Fare en bena wawaina osta rfakotale re hma re hnyerina, gabe si osta rpo hma re hnyerina bo rpun famat si. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Fare farumi smatna osta riri le mew ningalena mew fderera Ya. Ga smat ta rdela Ya turusna riri tubca denabe lali cicapo, si tina ta Jou Lahatalla bo nfasalamat si. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Gabe laisa smatna rfakangela mew mali bendar isa, mewe fpiya to lali bendar ta nesana. Flolam famafia e, mew fabinga Abar Mafiana farumi paube lali bendar ta puli Israelna, Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo to.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Enpa murit ta foloi mali ni gurucana, fare enpa smat karajanna foloi mali ni tuancana. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Nlafoi to gabe laisa murit isa ndadi laisa ni guruca, fare nlafo i to bena gabe smat karajan isa nkaranjanna foloi mali ni tuanca. Ya tane laisa me nimew tuanca, gabe mew tane Ya nike smat. Gabe laisa smatna du Ya tane setanna riri kolanoca,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beelzebul, setana riri kolanoca.</char></note> ta mayai foloina mew ta fderera Yana, Gabe mew nane fpei famafia!”<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe mew mati famcait sina smat ta bo rfakangela mewna. Ningalena ahai ta si rgoganna, ga smatna osta rto, fare farumi ta ttopana fare ta tlonga pana osta ncapang. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Ahai ta Ya ikuwa mewna ta smate nesana rlonga pa, mewe nane fabinga smatna fatutua mati fgoganna. Fare ahai ta Ya imu mumo mewna, mew nane fabinga lali smat laloca nbona fatailo laisa re mew fmauting puis ebaica popo. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mew bena mati famcaite smatnana. Ningale smatna dafena rpun famat be nimew badanca, ga enpa kawasana bo rpune famat nimew jiwacana. Famcait be Jou Lahatalla ta ni kawasa bo npune nimew badanca taga nfasale nimew jiwaca mali narakaca. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Co mew fikir famafia, mani budubadang silu, smatna rwage si mulorina okocebe. Ga biarega laina, isa pa ta bo nmarapawilna gabe laisa nimew Apa nailow pa <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Laina bena re mew, Jou Lahatalla nto ndumi mew, denabe nimew uta ta mali boboko mewna I netange ndumi gabe nto lalona. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Gabe mew mati famcaite, ningalena mew mulo mewna mamagalna, foloi mali mani budubadang tina.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Ise ta nfatuwo ndela Ya mali smat laloca nbona, Ya ma osta ifatuwo Ya ifayala i mali Ya nik Apa ta mali sorogaica nbona. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Ga ise ga nu nfayala Ya pa mali smat laloca nbona, Ya ma iku ifayala i pa mali nik Apa ta mali sorogaica nbona.”<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rdela Yesus pana rfakotale re smat ta rdela Yesusna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk. 12:51-53</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mati mew fu, Ya ilafo mali dunia tae bo smatna rfamafio ndumi si. Ga Ya ilafo tane, smatna lal osta rfakotale, denabe en ta rfapunpuna ga rmat. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Ningalena, re Ya ilafo, smat ta rdela pana rfakotale re smat ta rdela Yana: Wai manna rfakotale re hmarica, wai mapingna rfakotale re hnyerica, malafaca nfakotale re ohmo ta mapingica. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Morco napna si ebaica lolona diranca rfasangnang pa. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Ise ta n'gogoru hma fare hnyena mamagal foloi mali ta n'gogoru Yana, i cia pantas pa bo nderera Yana. Fare ise ta n'gogoru ntu man fare ntu maping mamagal foloi mali ta n'gogoru Yana, i cia ma pantas pa bo nderera Yana. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Ise ta npapa i ni salip capa, tina ni ngalena inciap pa bo nkangela denabe nmatna nderera Ya, i cia pantas bo nderera Ya. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Gabe ise ntub bo i ni dirica tutuling, i cia osta nmatna i re Jou Lahatalla pa denabe lali. Ga ise ta npo ni tubca ningalena nderera Ya, i cia osta nduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali.”<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta dailow Jouna bo rduk ta mafia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mrk. 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Ise ta nailowe mew fare ndela Ya, tina ningalena i nailow Ya. Fare isa nailow Ya, i ma nailow Jou Lahatalla ta ncula Ya. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Ise ta nailow nabina isa, ningalena i cia nabi i, smat ta, nailow nabi cia bo nduk sagige mulo mali Jou Lahatalla i, laisa re sagige mulo ta nabina rdukna. Ga ise ta nailow smat ta jaga npei ta molang mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, smat ta nailow cia bo nduk sagige mulo mali Jou Lahatalla i laisa re sagige mulo ta smatna jaga npei ta molang rdukna. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Smat ise ta n'gali smat ta biasa be ningalena smat cia nderera Ya to, biarega npo i waya galas pusa be, Ya ikua mew e, smat ta n'gali i cia osta nduk sagige mulo mali Jouca.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nafetang Yohanes ta nfasisopca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk. 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesuse nfafcule fola ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, I nfateam gagaw cia. Taga nfane nfafcule fare nfabinga Jou Lahatalla ni Abar Mafia lali smat ta rteteam mali bendar fare batang Galileana.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Oras cia, Yohanes ta nfasisopca i mali buica lolo. Ga oras Yohanese nlonga ga farumi ta Yesuse Kristuse npeina, i ncula ni muritna rfan rfautno Yesus. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Si rfautan laitane, “Apa, Aw to Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo mlafona? Pare amame nane ktotoman ta nesana?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mewe flolai lali Yohanes i bo fabinga i ahai ta mew fem fare ta flongana: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Smat ta rbiafna deme to, smat ta rfanfan pana rfane to, smat ta rpadona rmafia to, smat ta rlonga pana rlonga to, smat ta rmatna rpaling hawe, fare smat ta riri re rari pana rlonga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i.” <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Fare Yesuse ncula si dua Yohanes hawe, “Smat ta rtaf Ya pa fare rdela turus, i to ta osta ncangnangca.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Oras ta Yohanese ni muritna rfane to, Yesuse mulaine nua smat ta manana ga Yohanes. I nu laitane, “Bahngana oras ta Yohanese nfafcule mali padang gurun, gagaw isa ta namliley fare nalaspa mali pnuna, mewe ffan lalina bo fpesa? Pare mewe bo fem smat ta wol pusa tae nu nesa mdoma nu nesaca, laisa mom ta ngangala ningalena latanca nufi? Osta enpa paga? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Pare bo ahai mew fan lalina? Bo feme smat ta rpake kabaya mafiana? Osta enpa, smat ta rpake kabaya mafiana si gagao rina mali kolanoca ni istanaca. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Gabe bo ahai mewe ffan lalina? Pare mew ffan lali bo fem Yohanes ningalena i nabi i, smat ta nfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw? Fatutua to! Yohanese nabi i ga mew flolam, Yohanese nfoloi mali nabi ta nesana. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ga tantuba be mali Jou Lahatalla ni Kitabca Jou Lahatalla nu ga Yohanes laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">‘Flolam e! Ya bo isula nik susulaca nlafo ntuba mali Awi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">I cia ta bo nfamawa laling</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">bo smatna rciap rderera Aw.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Flolam famafia e, mali farumi smat ta mapingna rdadikna si mali dunia tae, isa pa ta nfoloi mali Yohanes ta nfasisopca. Ga oras tae, ise be, biarega smatca ningale pa, gabe laisa Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali i ni tubca, smat cia ta nfoloi mali Yohanes i. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Mulain mali Yohanes ta nfasisopca nlafo denabe oras tae, en smat ta wlorina mayai rfakotale re smat diranca ta rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat si tona bo si mati rdela Jou Lahatallana to, fare si le ma rmario bo rkawasa smat tina. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Ga, oras ta Yohanese nlafo paube, mali farumi fatfato ta en mali Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare mali kitab ta nabi nesana rlefo, rfabinga to ahai ta ndadi i oras tae, Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa to mali smat ta rdela i na. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ga mana en rfabinga, nabi Elia bo nlafo hawe. Ya iku mew, biarega mali mewina diranca rdela pa nabi Elia ta du bo nlafo cia, cia Yohanese to. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Gabe, flonga tina famafia fare fising mali wlomewna!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Ya bo ifatailo smat ta oras taena re ahai e? Si laisa wai nene ta rtotolang mali pasarna ga rfable fare rgigam lali riri delna laitane,<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Amame kuf suling bo mew,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">ga mew failow pa bo fowana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">Amame kmanyanyi nyanyian ta smatna rmat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">ga mew failow pa bo fftangisna.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe andeande cia ningalena laitane, “Smat ta rtub oras taena laisa wai nene tina. Si dailow pa ndumi. Oras Yohanese nlafo si dailowi pa. I jaga npuasa fare i ma ndom anggur pa, ga si du, ‘I, setane ncung i!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Ga oras tae, Ya Smat ta mali sorogai ilafo to. Ya ipuasa pa fare Ya ma jaga idom anggur. Ga smatna du, ‘Co fem! Smat tae nmasefsefat fare nmadom. I ma jaga ifadel-delo re smat ta jaga rfautno pajakna fare smat ta rbaradosa nesana.’ Ga biarega mew failow Ya re Yohanes pa, Jou Lahatalla ni kawasana osta mew fem oras smat ta rderera Jou Lahatalla ni sogarona si osta rfaem riri tabeat ta mafiana.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ntolea smat ta diwane wlorina pana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk. 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Fola tina, Yesuse nmulaine ntolea smat ta si mali bendar sifis tasa, ningalena faifise to I npei mujizat mali bendar tina, ga si dailow pa bo diwane wlorina rderera Jou Lahatallana. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />Yesuse nu, “Ee mew smat Khorazim fare Betsaida! Fkapalange to mew ya! Jou Lahatalla bo nfasale mewna tebtebna gaole, ningalena Ya ipeo mew mujizat, ga mew failou pa bo fiwane wlomewna bo fderera Yana. Gabe laisa popise ina mujizat tina Ya ipeo smat mali bendar Tirus fare Sidon, biarega si wlorina mayai, ga si osta diwane wlorina fare si dising gigiap puis bobokorina fare rpake kabaya karung, fafayal i si rmanyasal mali riri dosana. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Flolam famafia e, tomanta mali wol kiamatca, oras ta Jou bo nadili farumi smat, smat Tirus fare Sidon riri salna mayanana foloi mali mewi.<verse eid="MAT 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Ga mew smat Kapernaumna, mew fu Jou Lahatalla bo nlange mew nais sorogai? Enpa. Ta molangna I bo ntopa mew lali narakaca, ningalena mew feme to Ya ipei mujizatna ga mew failow pa fiwane wlomewnana. Gabe laisa popiseina mujizat tina Ya ipei mali bendar Sodom, osta bendar cia i mana sube dane oras tae. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Flolam famafia e, lomanta mali wol kiamatca, oras ta Jou bo nadili farumi smat, smat mayai ta mali batang Sodom tina riri salna mayanana foloi mali mewi smat Kapernaumna.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw smatna rlafo lali I bo si wlorina tengtengan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk. 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Oras ciana Yesuse ncombayang, “Ya iku tarima kase lali Apa i, Jou ta mkawasa mali sorogai fare mali dunia tae. Ya iku tarima kase ningalena Apa mfabingana tinana tutiyai pa lali smat ta rpandena fare ta rto okosesina lal. Ga mali smat ta biasa bena, Apa Aw mpei denabe si rto <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Apa, tina to ta npei Apa wlomna sangnang.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Farumi ta en mali Ya nik Apa ina, Apa npo Ya to. Smatna isa pa ta bo nfayala Ya, Ya Lahatalla Ntu Ya, ga Lahatalla be ta nfayala Ya. Ga smatna isa bere enpa ta rfayala Apana, ga Ya be Lahatalla ntuca, fare smat ta Ya fisangna bo rfayala Apa.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Flafo to mali Ya i, farumi mew ta famgaina fare ta fbasamna tebteb, ga Ya bo isalawe farumi tina mali mewi bo wlomewna ndadi sangnang. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Flonga fare fderera Ya nik sogaro, laisa sapi ta npake wala taga nderera ni tuanca. Fbalajar mali Ya i to ga Ya tane imafia fare ifasusa mew pa, fare mew wlomewna osta ndadi sangnang. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Ningalena, mew ta fderera Yana osta fkangela pa, fare lowlowat ta Ya ipo mewna tebteb pa.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse en nkawasa bo nfato ahai ta smatna bisa rpei mali wol sabat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mrk. 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Oras wol sabat, wol ta smat agama Yahudina bisa rkarajan pa, Yesus I re ni muritna rfan rdel mali bet gandumca. Ga Yesuse ni muritna rbibisil, gabe si rkati gandum ese, taga dan sina rfanfan. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Mana, en smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi. Oras ta si dem muritna rkati gandumna, si dua Yesus, “Apa co mem nim murit tina! Si rkarajan rkati gandum mali wol sabat! Tina si rcapial animam agamaca ni fatfatona!”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ya ito mewe fbaca to carita mali Jou ni Kitabcana ga kolano Daut, oras ta i re smat ta rderera i na rbibisile to. <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Kolano Daute ncung namul Jou Lahatalla ni ebai sombayangca taga nan roti ta smatna rpeo sadaka lali Jou Lahatalla i na. Fare, i ma noce roti tina lali smat ta rderera i na. Ta molangna roti tina, bo tderera ite rir agamaca ni fatfatona, si bisa dan pa, ta danna imamna be. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Mewe rasa fbaca to carita mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa, ga imamna riri karajan etnga be wol Sabat mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Denabe si rpei karajan tinana mali wol Sabat, tina si rcapial fatfato ga bisa tkarajan pa mali wol ciana. Ga biarega laina, Jou Lahatalla nu si rcal pa. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Mewe flolam famafia! Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca npenting, ga mantanena en ta pentingna foloi mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Jou Lahatalla nu mali I ni Kitabca laitane, ‘Ta Ya ikalowna, mewe nane fmasie smate nesana, biarega ffpo nimew aiwani bo rpeo sadaka gabe nimew masie lali smatna enpa nfaiteta i be.’ Gabe laisa mew ftaif ta Jou Lahatalla nuna, mew osta ffasala Ya nik muritna pa ta rpei sal pusa pana. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Ga Smat ta mali sorogaica nik kawasa bo ifafcule smatna ahai ta bisa rpei mali wol Sabat.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smatna neta mali wol Sabat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mrk. 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk. 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesuse nfateam gagaw cia taga nfan lali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Mana, en smat isa ta kakamo paona nmat, fare en bena smat Yahudi mali fatfato Farisi. Si rfautno Yesus, “Bisa pare bisapa, tfamafia smat mali wol Sabat?” Si rfautan laina, ningalena gabe laisa Yesuse nfamafia mali wol Sabat, wol ta smat agama Yahudina bisa rkarajan pa, si bo rfasala I.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Ga Yesuse nua si, “Gabe laisa en mali mew domba isa nmarapawlo lop neta mali wol Sabaat, mewe osta fduri nap lopca bo fyal i fare fsapnga i, paga? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Laina bena smatna! Mulo rina foloi mali domba, cia paga? Gabe laina, ite bisa tgali smatna mali wol Sabat.”<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Gabe Yesuse nua smat ta kakamo pao nmat cia, “Mtena kakamomna mali!” Smatca ntena kakamona lali, fare tina to kakamo ta nmatna ndai mafia, laisa re kakamo pao ta nmat pana. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Ga smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi dem Yesuse nfamafia smat ta kakamo pao nmatca si rcapang mali ebai sombayang cia, taga rfatatore bo rpun famat Yesuse. <verse eid="MAT 12:14" /><verse number="15a" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15a" />Yesuse nto si wlorina bo mayai, gabe I nfani mana.<verse eid="MAT 12:15a" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus cia Jou Lahatalla nfisang I bo npei ahai ta I nfasulana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15b" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15b" />Oras ta Yesuse nfan, smatna lal rderera I fare I nfamafia farumi smat ta dowilna. <verse eid="MAT 12:15b" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Ga I nua si, “Mdel pa ta bo ffabinga smatna, Ya tane Ise.” <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Fare ta Yesuse npei tina, ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nua tantuba nabi Yesayana tina ndadi i to, laitane,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Tae to ta Ya ifisang ica bo npei ahai ta Ya ifasulana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Ya igogoru I.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">I npei wlokna sangnang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Ya nik Rohca, bo ipo I,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">I ta bo nfabinga smat mali farumi suku re bangsana, Lomanta Ya bo ikadili farumi smat re ni laling ta molang.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />I osta nfakotale re isa pa fare osta n'gigmo smat pa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">Fare smatna bena osta rlonga pa nmautingna nfacicoali lali smat lalo uhngori mali lalingna.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />I ni mafia lali smat ta rcicoal pana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">tina laisa re I nfaorit i pa sop ta namgoica,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">tina laisa re I nailowpa bo nfamat poci ta naplanganna nenena toca.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">I bo nute smatna denabe ta damolangna, duntung mali ta damolang pana.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Gabe farumi suku bangsana osta rmaulango I.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna du, Yesuse npake Beelzebul ni kawasa bo nfaungo setanna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20">Mrk. 3:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk. 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Bahngana, en ta dute smat isa setane ncungi lali Yesus i. Smatca nempa fare nmomow. Gabe Yesuse nfaungo setanca ncapang mali smat cia denabe smatca nem fare nmauting hawe. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Smatna dem ta Yesuse nfamafia smat ta setane ncungica si rherangna gaole. Gabe rfauwo si, “I tae to laha, kolano Daute ni duri ta ite totoman ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nlafo?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Smat Yahudi ta rderera sogaro farisi rlonga tina, si dailow pa, gabe rfauwo si, “I nfaungo setanna npake Beelzebul, setanna riri kolanoca ni kawasa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Ga Yesuse nto si wlorina, gabe I npo andeande isa laitane, “Gabe mali kerajaan isa rfakotale ga rfasaksake si, osta kerajaan cia namjakam. Mali bendar isa ga ni smatna rfakotale, osta rfasaksake si. Fare mali man re maping ese rfakotale, osta si ma rfasaksake si, denabe mjakam. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Laina bena re setanna riri kolanoca. Gabe laisa setanna riri kolanoca nfaungo ni wawaina setanna, si osta rfasaksake si fare si le ma osta rfasangnang pa. Gabe setanna riri kolanoca ni karanjanna ntahan pa? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Mewe ma jaga fu, Ya ifaungo setanna ipake Beelzebul, setanna riri kolanoca ni kawasa. Gabe fatutua laina, smat ta rderera mew smat Farisina, si tina rfaungo setanna rpake ise ni kawasa? Gabe laisa me fu si le ma rpake setane ni kolanoca ni kawasa, si tutling osta du mew ta mew fu si fare Ya tina ncal! <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Gabe laisa Ya, ifaungo setan ipake Jou Lahatalla ni Rohca fare ni kawasa, tina ningalena Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa to ndadi Kolano mali mewi.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Andeande laitane, smatna osta enpa ta bo rcung namul smat ta ncicoalca ni ebai bo rloise ni ginana, I nane npitane smat ta ncicoal cia, taga i ndadi nloise smat cia ni ginana.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Smat ta rderera Ya pana, si riri le Ya. Laina bena smat ta rgali Ya pa rfayalo smate bo rderera Ya, si ta rpei denabe smatna dalaspa mali Ya i. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Mewe flonga famafia! Farumi dosa ta smatna rpeina, bo nduk ampung sube, laina bena re smat ta riri le smatna, rduk ampung sube. Gabe laisa smatna riri le Jou ni Rohca, si osta rduk ampung pa. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Gabe laisa en smat ta du okosesi ga rlawang Smat ta mali sorogaica, i rduk ampun sube. Ga smatna du okosesi ta rlawang Jou ni Rohca, i rduk ampung pa, mantane denabe lali.”<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat cia nmafia fare nmayai tina tto mali ahai ta i nuna fare ta npeina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk. 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />Yesuse nu, “Gabe aica nmafia, piyona ma mafia. Gabe aica nmayai, piyona ma mayai. Ite osta tto gabe laisa ai cia nmafia fare nmayaina, ite tem mali piyona be. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Me nimew mayaina laisa gu ni bisana. Osta bisa pa bo mew fu okosesi ta mafia, ningalena mew wlomewna mayai. Ga ahai ta smatna dising mali wlorina, tina ta bo ncapang mali si fmorina. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Smat ta mafiana du be okosesina ta mafia, ningalena si dising be okosesi ta mafia mali wlorina. Ga smat ta mayaina osta du be okosesi ta mayai, ningalena si dising be okosesi ta mayai mali wlorina.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Flolam e, lomanta Jou bo nadili farumi smatna, farumi mauting ta mew fu to, biare mauting tina ni ngale pa, ga mauting tina ta Jou Lahatalla bo nfautno mew hawe. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Jou Lahatalla ta bo nfato mew smat ta famolang fare smat ta bo fduk salsal, tderera be nimew mauting ta mew funa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna rdor fafayal Yesus i mali Jou Lahatalla i mali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mrk. 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk. 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Ga sifis guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa, fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi dua Yesus, “Guru, amame kdor Guru mfaemo am Mujizat faisa bo ame kto, ga fatutua Guru Aw tane mali Jou Lahatalla i mali.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Ga Yesuse nua si, “Mew smat ta ftub oras taena, wlomewna mayai fare famolang pa re Jou, gabe mew fdor Ya ifaemo mew mujizat faisa. Ga Ya osta ifaemo mew paisa pa, Ya osta ifawlo yaneto mew, mujizat ta ndadi i to mali nabi Yunus i tantuba. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Ningalena, laisa nabi Yunus i pumul iyan mamagalca hnyao lolo mnuona wol pitol doram pitol, laina bena re Smat ta nlafo mali sorogaica, osta ipumul pilingna lolo mnuwona wol pitol fare doram pitol. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Lomanta ni oras Jou bo nadili farumi smatna, smat Niniwe ta ntubana osta rpaling hawe laisa mew smat ta oras taena, fare si osta rfasala mew. Ningalena, smat Niniwe tina diwane wlorina oras ta Yunuse nfabinga Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali sili. Ga oras tae mantane en smat isa ta nfoloi mali nabi Yunus i, ga mew flonga pa tina bo fiwane wlomewnana! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Ga lomanta mali wol kiamatca oras ta Jou bo nadili farumi smatna, kolano maping ta pumulo malica bo npaling hawe nfarerer re mew smat ta oras tae, fare i osta nfasala mew bo mew fduk salsal. Ga popiseina, oras i nlonga ga kolano Salomo ni sogarona, biarega i nalaspa i nfan bo nlonga kolano Salomo ni sogarona. Ga oras tae mantane, en smat ta nfoloi mali kolano Salomo i ta nut sogaro bo mew, ga mew flonga tina pa!”<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Setanca osta nlolai hawe lali smat ta i ntetemo i toca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk. 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe setanca ncapang mali smat isa, i nfan nyel gagaw ta mlileina niyawa gagaw bo nfafolfola i, ga i nduk pa. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Gabe setanca nbafikir laitane, ‘Ta mafiana ya ilolai lali smat ta ya itetemo i popise ica,’ ga oras ta i nlolai lali smat cia, i nem smat cia wlona mumuang, laisa ebai isa ni smato pa, rlesan i ga nberesi rfato famafia. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Gabe setanca nfane nololaw ni del sifit wlorina mayaina foloi mali ii. Fola tina, si rfarerer rcung mali smat cia taga rteteam mana. Ni morco napna, smatca ni tubca nmayaina foloi mali tantubana. Laina bena ta osta ndadi i mali mewi smat ta ftub oras taena.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rpei ta Jou Lahatalla nimauna, si tina Yesuse hnye, rama re teno si</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mrk. 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Oras ta Yesuse nmauting sube re smat ta lal tina, I hnye fare teno re ramana rlafo dosal po talil, si dolna gaole bo rfadukduk re Yesus. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Ga smat isa mana nua Yesus, “Apa, Apa hnyem fare tenom re ramamna si potalil. Si bo rfadukduk re Apa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Gabe Yesuse nua smat ta nfabingaca laitane, “Ya hnyekca tenokna re ramakna ise ga?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Fare, Yesuse nafcul ni muritna taga nu laitane, “Si tane ma Ya hnyek fare Ya ramak re tenok! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Ise be ta npei Ya nik Apa ta mali sorogaica ni mauna, i cia to Ya tenok re ramak fare i cia to Ya hnyekca!”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Andeande smat ta rcake gei mali rakrak fara pifat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mrk. 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk. 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Wol cia bena, Yesuse ncapang mali ebai cia taga nfan lali talaga Galilea mtopo, taga ntotolang mana. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Smatna lal rlafo ga rfayalo si mali i. Gabe I lalaw ndawil pelang asa mana taga ntotolang, smat ta lalna dosal mali talagaca mtopo. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Gabe Yesuse nfafcule si okosesina lal npake andeande. I nu laitane, “En smat bet isa nfane ncake gei mali na betna. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Oras ta i ncake gei tina, en gei ta marapawil mali lalingca. Gabe manina rlafo ga dan gei tina denabe mnyei. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />En gei ta nesana marapawil mali rakrak ta ni patna, ga ni rakrakna okocebe lal be pat. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Gabe laisa wolca nca, tatanaman tina mulaine mang ningalena ni waca ncung napna lau pa. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Fare en bena gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta ni momna soga. Laina gei tina ntub, mom ta ni sogana ma ntub nbang i nmamagal gabe nbalat tatanaman tina denabe nmat. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Ga en bena gei ta nesana marapawil mali rakrak ta nboka. Gei tina ntub, fare piyo. Gabe ni anona denabe tutuwafe slubisa, en ta tutuwaf yafawonam, fare en bena ta tutuwaf yafatol. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Gabe, flonga tina famafia fare fising mali wlomew!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga pesaga I fafculena npake andeande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mrk. 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk. 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Fola tina, Yesuse ni muritna rdahle I taga rfautan, “Guru, pesaga Guru mfafcule smat lalocana mpake andeande?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Gabe Yesuse ncanglo si, “Jou Lahatalla npei bo mew ndadi fto rahasia ga mfalaisa Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano, ga mali smate nesana, enpa. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Ningalena, gabe laisa smatna dailow ahai ta Ya ikuna, lomanta Jou Lahatalla osta n'gali i bo ntaifna lal. Gabe laisa smatna dailow pa ahai ta Ya ikuna, ahai ta i ntona Jou Lahatalla osta nyal hawe mali i. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Gabe tina, Ya ifafcule sina ipake andeande, ningalena biarega si dem, si rtaif pa ahai ta si demna. Biarega si rlonga, ga rlonga famafia pa fare rtaif pa ahai si rlongana. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Ahai ta ndadi i mali smat tanena, Jou Lahatalla nua nabi Yesaya ntuba to laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Biarega mew flonga turus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">ga mew ftaif pa ningalena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">Biarega mew fem turus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">ga mew fto pa ningalena.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Ga smat ta oras taena bobokorina cicoal.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Si kanyorina dailow pa bo rlonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">fare si mtarina rfasisio, bo si mati dema re mtarinana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">mati si rlonga re kanyorinana, fare si mati rtaifna re wlorina.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Gabe si dailow pa bo diwane wlorina, ga Ya osta ifasalamat si pa.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Ga mew ta fderera Ya tane, fsangnangna gaole ningalena Jou Lahatalla npe mew bo fem tutuling, fare mew flonga re kanyomewna tutuling. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Flolam e! Tantuba, nabina lal fare smat ta jaga rpei ta molang mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, si rlokolo bo dem fare rlonga Mesias ta mew fem fare flonga I oras taena, ga si rcuna dem pa fare rlonga pa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gei ta marapawil mali rakrak fara pifatna ningale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mrk. 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk. 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe mew flonga famafia, Ya bo ifabinga mew andeande gei ta marapawil mali rakrak fara pifat ta nana i cia ningalena. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Gei ta marapawil mali laling ciana fatailo laisa smat ta rlonga Jou ni mauting ga mfalaisa Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano, ga si rtaif uwatu pa. Rlonga Jou ni mauting tina fola, setanna riri kolanoca nlafo ga nyal mauting tina mali si wlorina.<verse eid="MAT 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta ni patna, tina fatailo laisa smat ta rlonga Jou ni mauting fare jal re wlorina sangnang. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ga mauting tina si dising famafia pa mali wlorina, gabe ntahanna mnu pa. Gabe laisa si rduk kangela ningalena si rdela Jou, si rdela Jou Lahatalla panto.<verse eid="MAT 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta ni momna soga, tina fatailo laisa smat ta rlonga Jou ni mauting, ga si wlorina tengtengan pa bo si riri tubcana, fare si diyawa be arata. Gabe mauting ta rlongana si rpeo pa, denabe mauting tina ningale paisapa.<verse eid="MAT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ga gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta nbokana, tina fatailo laisa smat ta rlonga Jou ni mauting ga rtaif mauting tina. Gabe, si rtubna rderera ta Jouca nuna, laisa gei ta ntub denabe piyo. En ta piyona denabe tutuafe slubisa, tutuafe yafawonam, fare en bena tutuaf yafatol.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande i na ntub mali gandumna fapaluan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Ga Yesuse nafetang hawe andeande isa lali smat laloca, I nu, “Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali ni smatna, tina ni rupana laisa andeande tae: Smat isa npei bet, ncake gei gandumna mafia mali na betna. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Orasna doram gabe farumi smatna damtuli ga damtoal, smat ta na betca ni musuna rlafo. Ga musu tina rcake gei i na mali gelgelto gei gandum ta mafiana. Fola tina musu tasa rfanci. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Gabe oras ta gei tina ntub piyona mulaine ncapang, i nama ntub farerer re gei gandumna. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Oras smat ta na betca ni smat karajanna dem i tina, si rfan lali ga du laitane, ‘Tuan, ame kto tuane msake be gei ta mafia mali betna. Ga oras tae, mfalaisa ga denabe i na enna?’<verse eid="MAT 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Smat ta na betca nua si, ‘Tina nik musuna ta rpei.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">Ga i ni smat karajanna rfautno i hawe, ‘Tuan, mailow ame bo kfan lalei beti bo ksibit i tina.’<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Ga smat ta na betca ncanglo, ‘Matina! Ningalena ga laisa mew fsibit i tina, osta gandumna ma marasibit. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Gabe ta mafiana, inanai to gandum tina ntub farerer re i na denabe ni oras ta bo tfakatina. Lomanta Ya bo isula smat ta rfakatina rfayalo ntuba su i na taga rpitan isa-isa, taga rtaping. Fola tina, taga si rfayalo gandum tina taga dising mali gagaona.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande silu ningale wol de wol nbang i ga lal smat ta rderera Jou Lahatallana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mrk. 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-21">Luk. 13:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Gabe Yesuse nafetngo si carita isa. I nu, “Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mulain mali smatna ese be, ga wol de wol nbang i ga lal, tina fatailo laisa tatanaman ta peona nenena, smatna jal taga rtiwa mali betna. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Ga tatanamane peo tina nenenana gaole, gabe laisa ntube to, i ndadi tatanaman ta mamagal molang mali farumi tatanamane nesana mali bet lilewingca, denabe i ndadi ohlo aisa, gabe manina rlafo ga rpei fafual mali ni magalna.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesuse nafetngo si hawe andeande ta nesana laitane, “Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali ni smatna, mulain mali smatna ese be, ga wol de wol nbang i ga lal. Tina fatailo laisa ragi ta maping isa nyal taga nfulta re tirigu liter yafafat. Ragi tina npei denabe roti tina ndawilega lal.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesuse nfafcule smat lalo tina npake andeande. I nfabinga si paisapa gabe laisa npake andeande pa. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />I nmautingna npake andeande tina, ga tina ta ntuba Jou Lahatalla nua I ni nabina mali Kitabca laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ya bo imauting ipake andeande.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">Ya bo ifabinga okosesi ta smatna isa nto paube tantuba be oras ta Ya ipei dunia taena.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">I ta ntub mali gandumna fapaluan ni ngale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfateam smat ta lalna taga nlolai lali ebai i. Mana I ni muritna rlafo ga du, “Guru, co mfabinga am andeande i ta ntub mali gandumna fapaluan ningalena.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Smat ta ncake gei gandum ta mafia, cia Smat ta mali sorogaica. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Gabe bet cia, fatailo laisa re dunia tae. Taga gei ta mafiana, fatailo laisa smat ta Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali sili. Ga en bena i cia, laisa smat ta rderera setane ni kolanoca. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Ga musu ta rcake gei i tina, setanna. Fare oras ta bo fakatina, wol kiamat, wol ta Jou Lahatalla bo nadili farumi smat. Gabe smat ta rfakati tina, tina malaikat ta rduri mali sorogai.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Gabe, laisa i ta smatna rcibit taga rtopa lali yapca, laina bena ta bo ndadi i mali wol kiamatcana. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Oras tina, Smat ta mali sorogaica bo ncula ni malaikatna. Si bo rfayalo smat ta rpei smate nesana rdadi rbaradosa fare smat ta rpei okosesi ta mayaina, fare bo rfasaksake si mali Jou Lahatalla ni smatna ta I Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali si ta rdela Ina. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Ga malaikat tina bo rtopa smatna lali yap ta nmat-mat paca. Mana si osta rtangis denabe fmorina kikik ningalena rkangelana gaole. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Ga smat ta rpei ta molang mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, si osta rcung mali gagaw ta si Fmarica nkawasa ndadi Kolano ga si daplangan laisa wolca. Gabe, flonga tina famafia fare fising mali wlomew!”<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smatna, tina ni haragana foloi mali ahai be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe ite tderera Jou Lahatalla bo tdadi I ni smat, tina ni haragana foloi mali ahai be. Tina fatailo laisa andeande tae: en arata ta mulona mamagalna gaole, ta mnu to rgogan mali rakrakca lolo mali bet i. Wol pusana, en smat isa nduk arata ta mulona mamagal tina, ga i npuco nmbang re nyinyen. Smat cia nccangnangna gaole gabe i nwage farumi ta i nina, taga npake tiwi tina n'gon bet ta ni arata ta rpucona bo tina ndadi i ni.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe ite bo tdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano, tina ma fatailo laisa andeande tae: En smat isa nfawage niyawa mutiara ta mafia fare mulona mamagal bo n'gon. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Bahngana, i nduk mutiara isa nmafia fare mulona mamagal. Gabe i nwage farumi ni okosesi tina, taga ni tiwina npake n'gona mutiara ta mulona mamagal cia.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta mayai fare smat ta rpei okosesi ta mafiana bo rfasaksake si mali wol kiamat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali I ni smatna, tina bisa tfasama re andeande tae hawe: en smat diranca rtopa labang mali talagaca si rduk iyanna rupa lalo i. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Riri labangca nbakbake to, si rdas labangca taga duti mali talagaca lapo. Fola tina si rtotolang taga rfisang iyan ta mafia fare iyan ta mayaina. Ta mafiana dising mali karanjangna, ta mayaina rtopa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Laina bena ta bo ndadi i mali wol kiamatcana. Oras cia malaikatna bo rlafo rfara smat ta rmayaina mali smat ta jaga rpei ta molang mali Jou Lahatalla nbona. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Fare malaikatna bo rtopa smat ta wlorina mayaina lali yap ta nmat matpaca. Pulina si rtangis denabe fmorina kikik ningale si rkangelana gaole.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sogaro ta po fare sogaro ta ago, bisa fatailo re arata ta po fare arata ta ago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Fola tina Yesuse nfautno ni muritna, “Mew ftaife ndumi andeande ta Ya iku i nanaica?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Gabe muritna dua Yesus, “I me, amame ktaif.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ga guru agama ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa, si bena rto sogaro ga Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano, i cia laisa ebai ppu isa bo ncapnga arata ta po fare arata ta ago mali gagaw ta nising arata tina.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat mali nasarena dailow Yesus pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mrk. 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Nu fola andeande tina, Yesuse nfateam gagaw cia. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Nlafo mali I ni pnu Nasaret, Yesuse nfafcule mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina. Ga smatna rherangna gaole, fare du, “I nto sogaro tina manca mali? Fare ise ta npoi kawasa npei mujizat tina? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Naga I bas ai isa ntu i paga? I hnye Maria, ga I tenona Yakobus, Yusuf, Simon fare Yudas bena paga? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />I ramana ma nteteam farer re amam mantane, paga? Gabe manca mali I nduk sogaro fare Kawasa tina?”<verse eid="MAT 13:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ga smat ta manana rto tina, gabe si dailowi pa, Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ga fatutua, manca-manca nabina smatna daraga si, ga mali I ni ppnu fare ni ebai tutuling, si dailowi pa.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Gabe si rdela Yesus pa, I npei mujizatna lal pa manana.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Yohanes ta nfasisopca rpuni ga nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mrk. 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Oras cia, Herodes ta ndadi kolano mali Galilea, mana i nlonga smatna dafetang abar ga Yesuse. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Gabe i nua ni pegawaina, “Japa Yesus cia Yohanes ta nfasisop popiseica nmat ga npaling hawe! Denabe, I nafena npei mujizat tina!”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Kolano Herodese nu laina, ga bahngana, i ncula rwagfo Yohanes taga rpitan i re rante, taga rfasunga i bui. I npei laina ga tina poko be Herodias. I ni caritana laitane: kolano Herodes nyal Herodias taga npeo ni ngolo i. Naga, Herodiase nfasawe to re Filipus, Herodese teno tutuwo i. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Gabe Yohanese ntolea Herodesna lale to. I nu laitane, “Apa, apa mcapial Jou Lahatalla ni fatfatona, ningalena apa mnyal apa nim tamaica Herodias taga mpeo nim ngolo i!”<verse eid="MAT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Oras ta Herodese nlonga laina, mali I wlona npun Yohanese bo nmat, ga i namcait smat lalo ta manana, ningalena si rto Yohanes cia nabi i ta jaga nfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Bahnga laitane, oras Herodese ni umurna nbang i gabe i npei rame. Manana, Herodiase ntu mapingca nowa mali Herodes fare ni smat ta rlafona rbona. I nowa npei Herodese wlona sangnang. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Gabe tina, Herodese njaji denabe ncasi, bo npo ahai be ta wai cia ndorna.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Rlonga tina, waica hnye ncula i nfan lali Herodes i taga nu laitane, “Ya idor Yohanes ta nfasisopca bobokoca, mising i mali loyang faisa, taga mpo ya mantane!”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Oras ta kolano Herodes nlonga ahai ta wai maping cia ndorna, i wloyancusa. Ga i ncasi to mali wai maping cia fare smat ta rlafona rbona, fare i nfaiyo ahai be ta wai cia ndorna. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Gabe, Herodese ncula ni wawaina rfan lali buica bo rkati Yohanese bobokoca. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Taga, Heredose ni wawaina dising Yohanese bobokoca mali loyang isa taga rpoi lali wai mapingca. Taga wai mapingca npo hnye. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Oras ta Yohanes ta nfasisopca ni muritna rlonga Yohanese nmate to, si rlafo jale ni mayatca taga rgaile i. Fola tina, si rfane rfabinga abar tina lali Yesus i.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfatube smatna lalan lime re gle</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mrk. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk. 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Yoh. 6:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Oras ta Yesuse nlonga Yohanes ta nfasisopca nmate to, I re ni muritna rfan mana. Si rcaplo pelang asa ga rfan lali gagaw ta nalaspa mali pnu i fare namliley, bo I ntutuling puli tina. Ga orasna smat lalna rto tina, si rcapang mali riri bendarna taga rfanye ficori lali bo rfa dukduk re Yesus. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Oras ta Yesuse nduri mali pelang tasa, I nem smat ta lal tina, ga I nbasamna nmasie si. Gabe I nfamafia smat ta dowilna.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Bo malingine to, Yesuse ni muritna rlafo I taga du, “Guru, gagaw tae nalaspa mali pnu i, fare bo dorame to. Gabe ta mafiana Guru msula smat ta lal tane rfan lali pnuna bo rgon an.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Ga Yesuse nua ni murit tina, “Si mate rfanna. Mew ta nane fatub si.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Gabe muritna dua Yesus, “Guru, ta en mali amam i tane roti pilim fare iyan silu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesuse nua si, “Fut tina to mali.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Fare, I ncula smat ta lalna rtotolang mali momna popo. Taga I nyal roti pilim fare iyan silu tasa. I nbo nais langitca taga ndor tarima kase lali Jou Lahatalla i. Fola tina, I nfawogwogla roti tina taga npo ni muritna. Taga ni muritna rlowto smat laloca. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Gabe farumi smatna rceli denabe rmosi. Fola tina, Yesuse ni muritna rfayalo ane gleona, en karanjang yafasa re pilu bakbak. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Ta rceli wol ciana, lalan lim smatna man bakbako, tina tetang paube maping fare wai nenenana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfanfan puis wayaca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-56">Mrk. 6:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yoh. 6:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Fola mana, Yesuse tina to ncula ni muritna rcaplo pelang asa bo rfane rtuba lali talagaca puli pao. Ga oras tina, I ncula smat laloca duwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Oras ta Yesuse ncula smat laloca duwe, I ndawil nais popoca bo ncombayang mana ntutuling. Orasna bo doram, Yesuse ntutuling sube mana. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Tinana, Yesuse ni muritna dalaspa nto mali talagaca fapaluan, taga latanca ncicoal nuf mali uhngori mali denabe si riri pelang tasa rngangala ndumi.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Lase bo sema, Yesuse nlafo si, I nfanfan puis wayaca popo. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Oras ta ni muritna dem ta I nfanfan puis wayaca popo, si damcaitna gaole, gabe rgigam, “Setan!”<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Ga Yesuse nua si, “Fteng-tengan. Mati famcaitna! Tae Ya!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Gabe Petruse nua I, “Guru, gabe fatutua Aw Guruca, msula ya bo ifan lali Awi Guru.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Gabe Yesuse nua i, “Mali to!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Gabe, Petruse nduri mali pelang tasa, taga nfan lali Yesus i. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ga oras ciana Petruse nbasamna latanca ncicoal, i ndadi namcait gabe mulaine namduri. I n'gigam lali Yesus i, “Guru, mgali ya!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Gabe Yesuse fatowal be nice Petruse kakamona, taga nlange i. Yesuse nu, “Ee, aw tane mdelana uwatu pa, pesaga aw mdela fatutua pana?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Fola tina si rdawil pelang tasa, latanca ma nfola. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Dem farumi tina, smat ta si mali pelang tasana rcuba Yesus fare du, “Guru, fatutua Aw tane Lahatalla Ntu Aw.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smatna lal mali Genesaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mrk. 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Laina Yesuse I re ni muritna rlafo mali talagaca puli pao, si rcoal mali batang Genesaret. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Ga oras ciana smat tamanana rfayala Yesus, si fatoal be rfabinga lali farumi gagaw mali batang ciana, Yesuse nlafo to. Rlonga tina, si dute smat ta dowilna farumi lali Yesus i. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Fare si rdor lali Yesus i bo I npo si oras smat ta dowilna bo dice I, biarega dice ni jubaca be. Farumi smat ta dowilna dice I na ndadi rmafia.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Smat Yahudina rcapial Jou Lahatalla ni parenta ningalena si rderera be fmare bburi tantuba riri fatfatona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mrk. 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Bahnga laitane, en smat diranca mali agama Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa, rfan lali Yerusalem, rlafo lali Yesus i bo rfautno I, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Apa, pesaga Apa nim muritna rcapial ite ririr agamaca ni maffatonana? Ga si rcelina duase kakamorina ntuba pa laisa ta hma re bbur tantubana rfafcule itna.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Pesaga mew tutuling fcapial Jou Lahatalla ni parentana, taga fderera be hma re bbu mew ta ntubana riri fatfatona? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ga Jou Lahatalla ni parentana laitane, ‘Mew nane flonga famafia hma re hnye mewna,’ fare en hawe, ‘Ise ta nmautingna ntolea i hma re hnyena, i osta nduk salna nmat.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Gabe mew fafcule smat, ahai ta si dailow rpo bo rgali si fmarica penepa hnyerica, mdel pa ta bo fgali si, ga fpei be sadaka to lali Jou Lahatalla i. <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Mewe fafcule si laina, tina laisa re mew fu mati rgali sina hmarica penepa hnyerica. Mew fafcule ta lainana, tina mewe fderera Jou Lahatalla ni parentana pa, ga mew fderera be mew nimew fatfatona tutuling. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Ee mew tane, smat ta fmadarawa! Ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nua nabi Yesaya ntuba tona ga mew tina ndadi i to, laitane,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Bangsa tae nfamamagal Ya ga mali fmori be,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">ga wlorina laspa mali Ya i.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Ni guna pa si rfamamagal Yana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">ningale ta si rfafcule smatna ga rderera be smate ni fatfato.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahai molang ta npei smatna ndadi rbaradosa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mrk. 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Fola tina, Yesuse nololaw smatna lal taga nua si laitane, <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />“Flonga famafia ta Ya iku tane bo mew ftaif! Ahai ta ncunge smatna fmorina, tina osta npei smatna rbaradosa pa mali Jou Lahatalla ina. Ga ahai ta ncapang mali smatna fmorina, tina ta npei denabe smatna ndadi nbaradosa mali Jou Lahatalla i.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Fola tina, Yesuse ni muritna rlafo I, ga si rfautan laitane, “Guru, Guru mto pare mto pa, ta Guru mu nana ina tina npei smat ta rderera fatfato farisi na rmarasa si?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Ga Yesuse nua si laitane, “Smat ta rfafcule fatfato ta rderera Ya nik Apa ta mali sorogaica ni mauna pa, tina fatailo laisa re farumi tatanaman ta i ntiwa i pa ga ntub tutuling, ga tatanaman tina osta rcibit denabe ni wana. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Gabe mew ffabiar si beto smat Farisi tina. Ga si tina fatailo laisa smat ta dem pana rtuda smat ta dem pana bena. Gabe smat ta nem paca rfafcule laling lali smat ta nem pa benaca, smat silu tasa osta marapaolo lopna.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Fola tina Petruse nua Yesus, “Guru, ta Guru mu nana ina, ningale ahai? Co mfabinga am.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mewe ma ftaif paube tina ningalena? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Mewe fto to, ahai ta smatna danna, tina ncung mali i hnyaorca lolo, taga ntopa i mali kakusna, paga? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ga mauting ta ncapang mali smatna fmorina, tina farumi ncapang mali wlorina, gabe tina to npei denabe smatna ndadi rbaradosa. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Ningalena, mali smatna wlorina lolo, ncapang farumi ta mayai: Fikiran ta mayai, tfamate smat, nlokolo smat ta i ni uat i paca penepa ta i ni ngolo i paca, jal sal sabarang, malois, rdadi saksi ta molang pa, fare rfamayai smate ngahnyo. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Farumi mayai tina to ta npei smatna denabe rbaradosa. Ga laisa smatna rceli ga kakamorina duas pa rderera hma re bburina riri sogaro, tina pa ta npei smatna ndadi rbaradosana.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse n'gali maping isa smat Yahudi i pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mrk. 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Fola tina, Yesuse I re ni muritna rfan mana, ga si rfan lali batang ta ndahle bendar Tirus fare Sidon. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mana en maping isa smat Kanaan i mali batang tina, ga i smat Yahudi i pa. Maping cia nlafo lali Yesus i, taga ndor liona mamagal “Apa, kolano Daute ni durina, masie ya lae! Ya ntuk mapingca setane ncungi gabe i nkangelana gaole.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Ga Yesuse nua i paisa pa maping cia. Gabe ni muritna rdahle I taga rdor, “Guru, ta mafiana Guru mua i nfane to, ga i n'gigam turus mali ite taomamna.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Gabe Yesuse nu, “Jou Lahatalla ncula Ya bo igali animam smat bangsa Israel ta rcal laling, laisa domba ta damningningna.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Ga biare ga Yesuse nu laina, maping cia ndahle be Yesus taga nlu nap Yesuse nbona, fare nu, “Apa, mgali ya lae!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Manana I nu laitane, “Aw smat Israel aw pa, gabe laisa Ya igali aw, tina laisa re Ya iyal roti ta rfasiape bo wawai nenena, taga ipo lali funna.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Maping cia nua Yesus, “Fatutua Apa, ga fun ta mali meja papapo cama nan ane gleo ta marapawil mali si riri tuanca ni mejacana.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Nlonga tina, Yesuse nua i, “Maping ta aw, aw fatutua to mdela. Gabe ahai ta awe mdorna, ndadi to.” Oras cia to, maping cia ntuca nmafia.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat ta dowilna lal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Fola tina, Yesuse I re ni muritna rfateam gagaw cia, taga rfan lali talaga Galilea lapo. Fare, si rdawil nais lolas isa, taga rtotolang mana. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Oras tina, smatna lal rlafo Yesus. Si rlafo dute smat ta rfanfan pa, smat ta dem pana, smat ta rtempangna, smat ta rmomounna fare en bena smat ta dowile nesana. Smat ta dowilna dising si mali Yesuse nbona, taga Yesuse nfamafia si. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Smat lalo ta si manana ndadi rherang ningalena si dem smat ta momouna rmautinge to, smat ta rtempangna rmafia to, fare smat ta rfanfan pana rfane to hawe, fare smat ta dem pana dem hawe to. Gabe tina, si farumi rcuba re rfamamagal Jou Lahatalla, Jou ta smat Israelna rcuba i.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfatube smatna lalan fate re gle</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mrk. 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Gabe Yesuse nololaw ni muritna taga nu laitane, “Ya ibasamna imasie smat lalo tae. Wol pitole to Ya re sina, ga si rari anna enpa nto. Ya ikailow pa bo ikuwa si duwe re hyaorina lolo pana, matina denabe rbaulaco mali laling popo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Gabe Yesuse ni muritna dua I, “Guru, gagaw tae nalaspa mali pnu i, gabe mfalaisa ite bo tduk an bo tfaseli smat lalo taena?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Ga Yesuse nfulasi ga nfautno si, “Mewe namew rotina pifis?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Si du, “En pifit, fare iyan nenena sifis lalina.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Fare Yesuse nua smat laloca rtotolang nap nyinyenca. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Fola tina, I nyal roti pifit fare iyan sifis tina, taga I nu tarima kase lali Jou Lahatalla i. Fare I nfawogwogla roti fare iyan tina, taga npo ni muritna, taga si rlow to smat lalo tina. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Gabe si farumi rceli denabe rmosi. Fola tina, Yesuse ni muritna rfayalo ane gleona. Ni lalona karanjang pifit bakbak. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Smat ta rceli oras ciana lalorina lalan fat manna, tetang paube maping fare wai nenena. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Fare, Yesuse ncula smat lalo tina duwe. Gabe I re ni muritna rdawi pelang, taga rfan lali batang Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Ta rfaboboko Yahudina rdor mujizat bo diyawa Yesuse na sal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mrk. 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk. 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />En smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi fare fatfato Saduki rlafo lali Yesus i. Si rlafo bo diyawa Yesuse na sal. Si rdore bo Yesuse nfaemo si mujizat faisa, bo si rto Yesus cia i mali Lahatalla i mali.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Gabe laisa wolca bo ncope to, ga langitca temina nkakala, mew fu, ‘Mdoma, batangca bo wol.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Gabe laisa dororam isube mew fem metna kapcut fare gogo, mew fu, ‘Wol tae bo ulan.’ Gabe mew fto fafayal ta mali langitca tina, fare mewe ma fto batangca bo ndadi i tina, ga mew fto pa fafayal ta Jou Lahatalla npei oras taena. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Mew smat ta ftub oras taena, mew fmayai fare fderera Joue ni parenta pa! Mew fdor Ya ifaem mujizat faisa bo ndadi fafayali, Ya mali Jou Lahatalla i mali. Ga Ya osta ifaemo mew pa, ga ifawlo yaneto mew mujizat ta ndadi i mali nabi Yunus i tantubana.” Nmautinge fola laina, Yesus I re ni muritna rfateam si taga rfan mana.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fpei famafia re fatfato mali smat Farisi fare Sadukina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mrk. 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Yesus I re ni muritna bo si lali talaga Galilea puli pao. Oras ciana si rtalinga ga dut roti pa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mew nane fpei famafia re smat ta rderera fatfato Farisina rari ragina fare ta rderera sogaro Sadukina rari ragina.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Rlonga tina, muritna rfauwo si, “Ee, Guruca nu laina, ningalena amame kut roti pa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Ga Yesuse nto ahai ta si du tina, gabe I nua si, “Mew fu Ya imauting lainana ningalena mew fut roti pa? Wah, ga mew tane fdela Yana uatu pa! <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Mew nane ftoto! Ga mew wlo mew yaneto sube oras ta ifawogwogla roti pilim bo ifatub smat lalan lime re gle. Oras tina, en karanjang pifis ni gleo ta mew fayalona? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ga oras ta Ya ifatub smat lalan fate re glena ga tina roti pifit be, ni gleona karanjang pifis lalona oras ta mew fayalona? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Gabe laina, pesaga oras tae mew ftaif pana? Ga ta Ya iku nana i tina, ga rotina pa. Ga Ya ikua mew hawe, mew nane fpei famafia re ragi smat ta rderera fatfato Farisi fare fatfato sadukina!”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Mana taga I ni muritna rtaif. Ta Yesuse nu si nane fpei famafia re ragi, mali Yesuse wlonana ragi ta tpeo rotina pa, ga smat ta rderera Farisi fare Saduki riri fatfato mayai, matina denabe si rderera.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petruse nfatuwo Yesus cia Mesias</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mrk. 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk. 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesus I re ni muritna rlafo lali batang ta ndahle bendar Kaisarea Filipi. Mana, Yesuse nfautno ni muritna, “Ta mew flongana, smatna jaga du Smat ta mali sorogaica ise?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Gabe si rcanglo, “En ta du Yohanes ta nfasisopca, ta nesana du nabi Elia. Ga ta nesa hawena du nabi Yeremia penepa isa mali nabi ta nesana.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Gabe Yesuse nfulasi taga nfautno si, “Gabe laisa mew Ya tane ise?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Gabe Simon Petruse ncanglo, “Guru cia to Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatna. Guru cia Lahatalla ntu I!”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Gabe Yesuse nua Simon, “Simon, Yunuse ntu ta aw! Awe msangnangna gaole, ga ta aw mu tina smatna pa ta rfabingana, ga Ya nik Apa ta mali sorogaica ta nfabinga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Gabe tina, Ya ifangahnyo aw Petrus, ta ni ngale, pat fandasi ta ncicoal. Puis pat fandasi cia, Ya bo ifaosal Ya nik Jamaat. Ga Ya nik Jamat cia osta en turus, fare osta isa nafena pa bo nfafola sina, biarega setanna riri kolanoca. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Ya ipo aw kawasa bo mut Ya nik Jamatca. Tina laisa re Ya ipo aw kuci sorogaca, bo ahai ta aw mu matina mali dunia taena, tina bena ta Jou Lahatalla nu matina. Laina bena ahai ta aw mpo kawasa mali dunia tae, tina bena ta Jou Lahatalla npo kawasa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Nmautinge fola, Yesuse nua ni muritna bo si mati dafetang lali re malina I cia Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatna.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ntuba to, i osta nduk kangela fare bo nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mrk. 8:31–9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk. 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Mulain mali tina, Yesuse nfabinga ni muritna, I nane nfan bendar Yerusalem, ga pulina I bo nduk kangelana lal mali simosimo Yahudina, imamna riri ta rfaboboko sina fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa. Si tina bo rpun I denabe nmat, ga mali wol pitol Jou Lahatalla bo nfapaling I hawe.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Rlonga Yesuse nu laina, Petruse ndas Yesus mali lapona taga ntolea i, “Guru mati mu lainana. Tdor-dorna Jou Lahatalla nfalaspa tina mali Guru i.”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Ga Yesuse nfulasi taga ntolea Petrus, “Mati liomna aw ya! Anim mautingna laisa setanna riri kolanoca ni mauting. Aw mailow pa bo Ya ipei ta Jou Lahatalla ni mauna. Ga aw mfikir be ta smatna rfikirna. Ga ta Jou Lahatalla nfikirna aw mfikir pa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Fare, Yesuse nua ni muritna, “Ise ta bo nderera Ya, i bisa nderera i ni mauna pa. I nane nciap nkangela denabe nmat ningalena nderera Ya, tina laisa i npapa i ni salipca, taga nderera Ya. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Gabe ise ntubna bo i ni dirica tutuling, I cia osta nmatna, i re Jou Lahatalla pa denabe lali. Ga ise npo ni tubca ningalena nderera Ya, i osta ntubna i re Jou Lahatala denabe lali. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ga ni untung pusa pa, gabe laisa smat isa nduk farumi arata ta mali dunia taena, ga i ntubna i re Jou Lahatalla pa mantane denabe lali. Ta molangna osta npa ta i bo npo bo nduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lalina. <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Ga Smat ta mali sorogaica bo nlafo hawe mali dunia tae, nfarerer re Apa ni malaekatna fare I ni kawasa ta mamagalna. Ga oras tina, Smat ta mali sorogaica bo nbalco lali smatna isa-isa nderera ahai ta si rpeie tona. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Flonga famafia ta Ya ikua mewna. Ta mew mantanena, en ta bo rmat paubena gabe laisa si dem I paube, Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse naplanganna gaole puis lolasca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mrk. 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Wol piwonamna maralapis, Yesuse nut Petrus, Yakobus i re tenoca Yohanes, si rfarerer rdawil lolas isa tigo. Manana smate nesana enpa. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Smat sitol tasa dem Yesuse ni rupana naiwani ga nesa i. I uhngoca naplangan laisa wolna, taga ni Jubaca naiwani ga nbubulang sasaletam. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Rgarayanna si dem nabi Musa fare nabi Elia rbacarita re Yesus. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Dem tina, Petruse nua Yesus, “Guru, amame ksangnangna gaole am mantanena! Gabe laisa Guru mailow, ya bo ipei ebai nenena fasitol mantane: Isa bo Guru isa bo nabi Musa fare isa haweca bo nabi Elia.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Oras Petruse nmauting sube, garayanna met ta planganna nduri ntabak si. Gabe si rlonga pumul metna lolo tina, en isa lio nu laitane, “Tae Ya ntukca ta Ya igogoru i. I npei Ya wlokna sangnang. Flonga I to!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Rlonga mauting tina, Yesuse ni murit sitol tasa damcaitna gaole denabe rpakpak nap rakrakca. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Gabe, Yesus i lali ga nbek si, fare nu, “Fpalinge to. Mew mati famcaitna!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Oras ta si rlange bobokorina, si deme smate nesa panto manana, motle be Yesuse ntutuling.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Gabe oras ta si rduri mali lolas cia, Yesuse nfatnawe si laitane, “Mati fafetngo faisana su ahai ta mew fem nana ina! Lomanta Smat ta mali sorogaica nmate to ga npaling hawe, taga mew fafetang.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Gabe Yesuse ni muritna rfautno I, “Pesaga guru agama ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa du, nabi Elia nane nlafo ntuba mali Mesias i, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatnaca?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesuse nua si laitane, “Ga, nabi Elia nane nlafo ntuba bo nfasiap farumi. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Ga flonga famafia ta Ya iku tane, smat ta laisa nabi Elia cia nlafo to, ga smatna rfayala i pa. Gabe si, rfakangela i rderera si riri mauna. Laina bena, si le ma osta rfakangela Smat ta mali sorogaica.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Rlonga tina, taga Yesuse ni muritna rtaif, smat ta laisa nabi Elia cia, Yohanes ta nfasisopca.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo setan mali wai man isa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mrk. 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk. 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Oras ta Yesus i re ni murit sitol tasa rlolai mali gagaw ta ni smatna lal cia, en smat isa ndahle Yesus, taga nlu nap Yesuse nbona. <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />Smat cia nua Yesus, “Apa, mgali ntukca su lae! I ntokobo gabe nkangelana gaole. Gabe laisa neta i, i jaga nmarapawil mali yapna penepa mali wayana. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Ya ikuti lali Apa nim muritna to, ga si dafena pa bo rfamafia ina.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Rlonga laina, Yesuse nu, “Gampang pa mew smat ta oras taena. Fdela pa fare fdelo lalingna ncal! Opfis hawe Ya nane iteteam farerer re mewna? Fare opfis hawe Ya nane itotomane mewna? Futi mali to wai cia!”<verse eid="MAT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Oras ta si dut wai cia lali Yesus i, Yesuse nparenta liona nu to mamagal lali setanca bo ncapang mali wai cia. Ga oras setan cia ncapang, wai cia tina to nmafia.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Fola tina, Yesuse ni muritna rfan lali I oras I ntutuling, taga si rdahle I, fare rfautan, “Guru, pesaga amame bisa kfaungo setanca pana?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Tina ningalena mew fdela Jou Lahatallana uatu pa. Flonga famafia Ya ikua mew, gabe laisa nimew ta fdela tina en, biarega nenena laisa gei ta nenena molang mali dunia tae, mew bisa fu lolas tae, ‘Mdirak aw lali!’ Osta lolas tae ndirak i lali. Gabe farumi mew bisa fpei, ga mew nane fdela be Jou. [<verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Fare mewe ma nane fto setan ta lainana, mew fafena faungo gabe laisa mewe sombayang fare fpuasa.]”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse failu to nfabingana I bo nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mrk. 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk. 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Oras ta Yesuse i re ni muritna rfayalo si mali batang Galilea, Yesuse nua si, “Lomanta Smat ta mali sorogaica bo rpo i lali smatna, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />ga bo rpun famati, lomanta mali wol pitolna npaling hawe.” Oras ta muritna rlonga Yesuse nu tina, si wlorina ncusana gaole.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule mfalaisa tpalas pajak bo Ebai Sombayang Mamagalcana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Oras ta Yesus nlonga ni muritna rlafo mali bendar Kapernaum, smat ta jaga rfautno pajak Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni pajakna nlafo mali Petrus i ga rfautno i, “Apa nim Guruca jaga npalas Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni pajak pare enpa?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Gabe i nua si, “Ime, I npalas turus.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Oras ta Simon Petruse ncung mali ebai i, Yesuse nfautno ntuba i, “Simon, gabe bo aw, ise ta nane npalas pajak lali kolano ta rkawasa mali dunia tae? Si nturina tutuling pare smate nesa?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Gabe Petruse ncanglo, “Ga smate nesa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Fare Yesuse nua i, “Fatutua tina. Kolanona nturina rpalas pajak pa. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Laina bena re it, it tane Jou Lahatalla Ntu it, gabe ite tpalas pa ma paisapa, ningalena ite ma Jou Lahatalla Ntu it. Ga bo si mati rmarasa sina, aw mfane to lali talagaca bo mnyawa iyan. Mnyal iyan ta mate ntuba ica, taga msalawe fmona. Mana awe bo mduk tiwina nlafo i bo mpalas ite smat it lu rir pajak bo Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Awe mnyale to tiwi tina taga mpalas smat it lu rir pajakna.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Ise ta nmamagal molang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mrk. 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Oras tina, Yesuse ni muritna rlafo I, ga rfautan, “Guru, gabe laisa Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano, ise mali Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta bo ndadi smat mamagal?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Rlonga tina, Yesuse nololaw wai nenena isa taga nfaosal i mali si fapaluanna. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Fare nua si, “Flolam famafia ta Ya bo ikua mew tane, gabe laisa mew fiwane nimew tubca pa ndadi laisa wai nenena ta ncombong pa tae, mew osta fdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smate mew pa gabe I nkawasa ndadi Kolano ya. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Gabe, ise ta nanggape ni dirica biasa be laisa wai nene tae, i cia to ta Jou Lahatalla nanggap i nmamagal mali Jou Lahatalla ni smatna ta I bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Ga ise ta nailow smat ta biasa be laisa re wai nene tae ga smat cia ndela Ya, tina ni ngalena i nailow Ya.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati mpei denabe smatna ndadi rbaradosana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mrk. 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk. 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe en smat ta rpei smat ta biasa be laisa re wai nene tae rdadi rbaradosa denabe rdela Ya pa, ta mafiana tpitane smat cia waoca, taga tcagta pat mamagal fapusa mali i ina taga tfaduri i po law olatca. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Fkapalange to mew smat ta mali dunia taena, ningalena okosesina lal ta fpei denabe smatna rpei dosa ga rdela panto hawe. Ga okosesi tina osta bo en, ga fkapalange to smat ta rpei denabe smate nesana rdadi laina.<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Gabe laisa kakamo mewna fare fico mewna ta npei gabe fbaradosa denabe fdela panto, fkati bo ftopa to tina. Ta mafiana mew fsung sorogana kakamo mewna pao be fare fico mewna ma pao be, biare ga fico mewna fare kakamo mewna ntotim ga rtopa mew lali naraka ta ni yapca nmat-mat pa. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ga mta mew pao ta npei gabe mew fbaradosa denabe fdela panto, flebate bo ftopa mta mew tina. Ta mafiana mew fsung soroga re mtamew pao be, biare ga ntotim ga rtopa mew lali narakaca.”<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Domba ta namnyangisca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk. 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Flolam famafia, smat ta biasa laisa wai nenena tae, mdel pa bo fu i smat ta ni ngale pa. Smat tae en ni malaikat ta i re Jou Lahatalla mali soroga i. [<verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Ga Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo mali dunia tae bo nfasalamate smat ta rbaradosana.]”<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mewe fikir andeande tae su. En smat isa ni dombana slubisa, ga isaca namnyangis. Ga smat cia bo npesa e? I osta nfateam domba yafaisiwe re isiwe tina mali lolase ppuna, taga i nfane niyawa domba isa ta namnyangisca. <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Laina i nduk domba isa ta namnyangis cia, i ncangnangna gaole. Ya ikuwa mew e, i ni sangnang tina mamagalna foloi mali i ni sangnang mali domba yafaisiwe re isiwe ta damnyangis pa tasa. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Laina bena re nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica, I nailow pa bo ntuna damnyangis mali Ina, makse isa be.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta riri halna nane rfamafio si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe laisa en nimew del ta ndela npei sal mali mewi, mewe to ta nane fan lali i ina, ga smate mew luna be, taga mew fabinga ni salna. Gabe laisa i nfatuwo i ncal, tina ningalena smate mew luna famafio mewe to. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Gabe nimew delca nailow pa i ncal, ga mew ffan lali. Mew fpei laina ningalena rlefo mali Jou ni Kitab cana laitane, ‘Gabe en smat ta du si rpei sal, nane en smat silu penepa sitol ta rdadi saksina bo du smat cia ncal.’<verse eid="MAT 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Gabe laisa i nailow paube ahai ta si duna, fabinga to hal tina lali jamaatca. Gabe laisa jamaatca ntolea i, ga i nailow pa nlonga, tina ningalena i laisa smat ta nfayala Jou Lahatalla pa. Ga nanggapna i nbaradosa laisa re smat ta nfautno pajak ta jaga nakal be smatca.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Flolam e, ahai ta mew fu matina mali dunia taena, tina bena ta Jou Lahatalla nu matina. Fare ahai ta mew fpo hak mali dunia taena, tina bena ta Jou Lahatalla npo hak.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Ya iku mew hawe, gabe dunia tae en smat silu mali mewi wlori be pusa rcombayange rdor ahai be, ga Ya nik Apa ta mali sorogaica osta npo ahai ta si rdor tina. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Ningalena gabe laisa, en smat silu penepa smat sitol rfayalo si ningalena rdela Ya, mana to Ya ifarerer re si.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande smat karajan ta nampunge ni delca pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Fola tina, Petruse nlafo lali Yesus i taga nfautan, “Guru, gabe laisa ya nik del isa npei sal mali ya i, denabe faifis ya ikampung ina? Denabe faifite lae?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Gabe Yesuse ncanglo i, “Laina pa! Ya ikua awe, aw nane mampung i ga faifit be pa, ga yafafitna nlolai faifit. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Awe nane mpei laina ningalena gabe Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali I ni smatna, laisa re andeande tae: en kolano isa nuruse ni smat karajan ta rpei lingan mali i ina. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Oras ta kolano cia nmulaine nuruse riri lingan tina, en smat karajan isa nbo kolanoca. Smat karajan cia ni linganna tiwi guracina tas lalan yafasa. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Ga smat karajan cia nafena panto bo npalase ni lingan tinana. Gabe tina, kolanoca ncula rwage smat karajan cia ni ngolota nturina fare farumi ta i ni na, bo bisa npalase ni linganna. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Nlonga tina, smat karajan cia, tina to ndor laitane, ‘Tuan kolano, folfolo ya faokoce su, mpo ya oras su, bo ya bisa ipalase nik linganna farumi.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Nlonga smat karajan cia nu laina, kolanoca nbasamna nmasie i, gabe nfabiar i, fare nfayangise ni linganna.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ga oras ta smat karajan cia ncapang mana, i nfadukduk re ni del karajan isa. Ni del cia ni lingan mali ina tiwi perake slubisa, tina okoce be gabe bo laisa tfasama re i ni lingan ta mali kolanocana. Ga i nwagfo ni delca taga nafoki. I nua ni del cia, ‘Oi, mpalase to nim lingan ta mali ya ina!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Nlonga tina, i ni delca ndor, ‘Wataw, gabe laisa bisa mpo ya oras faokoce su, bo ya ipalas farumi nik lingan tina.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Ga i nailow pa, taga nfasunga ni del cia bui. I ni del cia nane npalas farumi su ni lingan tina, taga i osta ncapang mali bui ca. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Oras ta i ni del karajan ta nesana dem ahai ta ndadi i tina, si wlorina ncusa gabe rfane ga rfabinga lali kolanoca. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Rlonga tina, kolanoca ncula dololaw smat karajan cia taga nu, ‘Oi, smat karajan ta aw tane wlomna mayai! Farumi nim lingan ta mali ya ina, ya ifayangise to ningalena awe mdor ya igali aw. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ga aw bena nane masie nim del cia, sama re ya imasiye awna.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Gabe kolano cia ntolea smat karajanca, kolanoca npo smat karajanca ni smat ta njaga rpune smat mali buicana bo si rfakangela i denabe i npalase ndumi ni linganna.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Laina bena Ya nik Apa ta mali sorogaica, gabe mew fampunge smatna, nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica nampunge mew. Gabe laisa mew fampunge smatna pa, nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica ma nampunge mew pa.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Jou Lahatalla npei man re mapingna ndadi pusa, gabe smatna mati fatalakna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mrk. 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Nu ndumi fola tina, Yesuse nfateam batang Galilea taga nfan lali batang Yudea mali waya Yordan puli pao. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Mana, smatna lal rderera I, fare I nfamafia smat ta dowilna.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Fare, smat sifis agama Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi rlafo bo diyawa Yesuse na sal. Si rfautno I laitane, “Gabe laisa bo tderera animam agamaca ni fanfanna, bisa pare bisa pa man ta rfasawe tona, rtalake riri ngolona rpake sabab ahai be?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Japa mew fbaca to mali Jou ni Kitabca, tantuba mali be oras ta Jou Lahatalla npei smatnana, I npei man fare maping. <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Ga Jou Lahatalla nu laitane, ‘Gabe tina, manna osta rfateame hma re hnyerina taga si re riri ngolo si ndadi be isa.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Gabe smatna silu panto hawe, ga ndadi be isa. Gabe tina, ahai Jou Lahatalla npei denabe ndadi isa, smatna mdel pa ta bo tfatalak.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Rlonga Yesuse nu laina, smat Farisi tina rfautno Yesus hawe, “Gabe laina, pesaga nabi Musa nfabiare smatna rtalake riri ngolona asal ta i npo surat talak?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Gabe Yesuse nu, “Poko be wlomew ta cicoalna, denabe nabi Musa nfabiare mew ftalake nimew ngolona. Ga mali tantuba be Jou Lahatalla npei man fare maping, I nailow pa bo mew fpei lainana. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Flonga famafiae, manca bisa ntalake ni ngolota gabe laisa ni ngolota nyal sal. Gabe enpa, ga manca ntalake ni ngolota, taga man cia nfasawa mapinge nesa, mali Jou Lahatalla nbona man cia ncale to, ningalena i nlokolo maping ta i ni ngolo i pa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Rlonga tina, Yesuse ni muritna dua I, “Ali, gabe laisa man re maping farererca macan be tina, ta mafiana tarusa tfasawe to.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Farumi smat dailow pa fatfato tina, ga smat ta Joue npo si cicoalna be. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Ga, en man ta rfasaw pana ningalena mulain ta ntub be i mfalaina to. Ga en bena man ta rfasaw pana ningalena smate nesa npei denabe i nfasaw pa. En bena ta rfasaw pana tina si riri mau tutuling, bo si rpake riri orasna rleleyane Jou Lahatalla ta bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano. Ise ta nafena nyal Ya nik sogaro tane, i nyale to.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nbarakati wawai nenena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mrk. 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Ga en smatna dut wai nenenana lali Yesus i bo I nlange kakamona mali sili fare ncombayang. Ga ni muritna rtolea smat tina. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Gabe Yesuse nua ni murit tina, “Inanai to wai nena tane rlafo mali Ya i. Mati ftolea si na. Wai nenena tane rcombong pa fare jampa be rdela famafia. Si tina ta rpo riri dirica lali Jou Lahatalla i bo I nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali riri tubca.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Fola tina, Yesuse nlange kakamona taga nbarakati si wai nenena tina. Folana, I nfani mana.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rkayangna ncusai bo rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smatna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mrk. 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk. 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Bahnga laitane, en wai po isa nlafo lali Yesus i, i nfautan laitane, “Guru, ta mafiana ya nane ipei ahai bo ya bisa iduk tub re Jou Lahatalla dena be lali?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesuse nua i, “Pesaga aw mfautno Ya okosesi ta mafianana? Ta mafiana Jou Lahatalla be. Gabe aw mailow mduk tub re Jou Lahatalla, awe nane mderera Jou Lahatalla ni parentana.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Ga smat cia nfautan hawe, “Parenta ta manca?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesuse nua i, “Mati mpune smate bo rmatna, mati mlokolo smate ni ngolona fare smate ni uatna, mati mloisna, mati mdadi saksi ta molang pana, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />aw nane mlonga famafia hma re hnyem tasa, fare aw nane mgogoru smate nesa laisa re aw mgogoru anim dirica tutuling.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Gabe wai po cia nua Yesus, “Farumi parenta tina ya ipeie to. Ahai sube ta nkurangna?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesuse nua i, “Gabe laisa mlokolo mderera Jou Lahatalla re fatutua, aw mfane to bo mwage farumi anim aratana, taga ni tiwina moce smat ta riri re rari pana. Gabe aw mpei laina, aw mduk arata mali sorogai. Fola tina, aw mali to bo mderera Ya.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Oras ta wai po cia nlonga Yesuse nu lainana, i nfan fare wlona nmagogoru i, ningalena i ni aratana lalna gaole.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua ni muritna, “Flolam famafia ta Ya ikuwa mewna, ncusa ina gaole smat ta rkayangna riri dirica bo rpo Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali riri tubcana. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Fare mew flolam hawe ta Ya iku tane, mafia sube unta isa ncung paplaki mtana ga ta ncusa i foloina smat ta ni re na ga bo npo ni dirica bo Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa mali i ni tubca.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Rlonga tina, Yesuse ni muritna rherang. Gabe si du, “Gabe laina, ise ta bo ncalamatca?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesuse natngalo si taga nu, “Smatna bisa pa bo rfasalamate si riri dirica tutulingna. Ga Jou Lahatalla be ta bisa nfasalamate smatna, ga bo Jou Lahatalla ahai be bisa ndadi i.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Gabe Petruse nua Yesus, “Amam tane kfateame ndumi to ta animamna ga kderera Guru. Gabe ahai ta amame bo kdukna?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesuse nua si, “Flonga famafia ta Ya ikuwa mew tane, lomanta Jou Lahatalla bo npei dunia tae ndadi po i hawe, manana Smat ta mali sorogaica bo ntotolang puis karapesa kolano ta nmafia molangca. Oras tina, mew farumi ta fderera Yana bo ftotolang bena mali karapesa yafasa re silu tasa, bo ffadili fiyawa ta molang mali suku Israel yafasa re silu tasa. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Ga smat ta rderera Ya denabe nfateame ni ebaica, ramaca fare tenoca, i hma fare hnye, ntuna fare betna, smat cia osta nduk hawe tuwtuwafe slubisa farumi tina, fare i bena osta nduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Smatna lal ta smat mamagal si mali dunia tae, lomanta rdadi smat ta riri ngale pa, ga smat ta riri ngale pa mali dunia taena, osta rdadi smat mamagal si.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Andeande smat ta rkarajan mali bet anggurca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Jou Lahatalla bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdela I na, laisa andeande tae: En smat isa ta na bet anggur. Lase bo sema, i ncapange ga niyawa smate bo rkarajan mali na bet anggurca. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Oras ciana i nduk smat sifis lalina, i nfatatur re si mfalaisa rkarajan wol pusa mulona. Tina ta i bo npalco smat isa, wol pusa tiwi guraci pusa. Fola tina, i ncula si rkarajan mali i na bet anggurca. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Rasa ttok faisiwe dororam sube, i ncapang hawe nfan lali pasar i. Pulina, i nem smat sifis rkarajan pa. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Gabe i nua si, ‘Mewe fkarajan mali ya nak bet anggurca. Lomanta ya ipalco mew tderera ta mew fkaranjanna.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Fare rasa orasna ttok yafasa re pilu wolca nfapaluan re malingin ttok faicol, i ncapang hawe nfan lali pasarca, laisa ta i npei nana i na. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Fola tina, rasa ttok failim malingin, i ncapang hawe ga i nem en sube smate nesa hawe mali pasarca ta rkarajan pa. Gabe nfautno si, ‘Pesaga wol pusa tae mewe fosal be mantane taga fkarajan pa?’<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Si dua i, ‘Amame laitane to, ga ise npo am karajan pa’.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:7">Gabe i nua si, ‘Gabe laina, mewe ffan lali ya nak bet anggurca, taga fkarajaan pulina to.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Orasna bo doram, smat ta na betca nua ni mandorca, ‘Mololaw farumi mali smat karajan tina taga mpalase rari sagige mulona. Aw mpalco si na mulain mali ta ncung mesamul molangna denabe ta ncunge ntubaca.’<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Mana, smat karajan ta rkarajan mesamulna jale rari sagige mulona ntuba, isa-isa nyal perak pusa. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Gabe oras smat ta rkarajanna mali dororam isube rlafo jale rari sagige mulona, si dunama si isa-isa bo rdukna foloi mali smat ta rkarajan mesamul na. Ga si le ma jalna isa-isa perak pusa. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Oras ta si jal tiwi tina, si rfauwa smat ta na bet cia. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Si du, ‘Tuan bisa laitane pa! Smat ta rlafo mesamulna, rkarajan jam bahnga be. Taga rari sagige mulona sama re amam! Ga amam tane karajanna wol pusa molang, denabe sagigena ncapang’.<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Ga tuan ta na bet cia nua isa mali silina, ‘Tenok ta aw, mati mtolena e! Tane ya ikakal aw pa. Ga ta ntubana ya re aw tfatatore to paga, ya bo ipalco aw re perak pusa tina karajan wol pusa. <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Gabe ta mafiana mnyale to sagige mulo tina re wlomna sangnang fare muwe. Ya ilokolo ipo sagige mulo sama re aw, sama re ya ipo smat ta rcung mesamulna. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Ya nik hak ipake ya nik tiwi ya nik mau tutuling, paga? Pare aw msangnang pa ningalena ya imasie smat tina?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe mali andeande tina ite tdadi tto, smat ta rdadi smat ta foloi mali dunia tae, osta rdadi smat ta riri ngale pa, ga smat ta riri ngale pa mali dunia taena, osta rdadi smat mamagal si.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ta faicol I osta nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mrk. 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Bahnga laitane, Yesus i re ni muritna rfan lali bendar Yerusalem. Mali lalingca fapaluan, I nololaw ni muritna taga nfara si lali faokoce, taga nua si laitane, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Flonga e! Tane ite bo tfan lali bendar Yerusalem. Pulina, smatna bo rpo Smat ta mali sorogaica lali imam ta rfabobokona fare guru agama ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa. Ga si bo rfasal I denabe nmat. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Si bo rpo I lali smat ta Yahudi si pana, taga smat tina rfamaimai I, rpuni rpake wala ta ni soga mali tubona, fare si rcalipi. Ga mali wol ta pitolca, I osta npaling hawe.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rcicoal mali Jou Lahatalla nbona tina smat ta rleleane smate nesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mrk. 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Fola tina, Zebedeuse ni ngolota fare ntuna Yakobus i re Yohanes rlafo lali Yesus i. Maping cia nlu nap Yesuse nbona, ndor paisa lali Yesus i.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesuse nfautno i, “Maping ta aw mdor ahai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">I nua Yesus, “Guru, gabe Guru mdadi Kolano ga Mkawasa to, Guru msula ya ntuk silu tasine rtotolang mali Guru lapomna. Isa mali nim welana, isa i mali nim balitna.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Nlonga tina, Yesuse nua si laitane, “Ahai ta mew fdorna, mew ftaif pa. Ya tane bo iduk kangelana osta lal. Ga mew bisa fpapapa kangela tina laisa re Ya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Ga si rcanglo, “Amame bisa!”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Fare Yesuse nua si, “Fare mew osta fkangela laisa re Ya. Ga ise ta bo ntotolang mali Ya nik balit fare wela tina, Ya nik hak pa bo ifatona. Gagaw tina Ya nik Apa nfasiape to bo smat ta I nafculna.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Oras ta murit yafasa ta nesana rlonga ahai ta smat silu tasa rdor tina, si wlorina pirpir re silu ta rfatenow tasa. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Gabe Yesuse nololaw farumi si, taga nu laitane, “Mew fto, smat ta rfaboboko mali bangsa ta rfayala Jou pana, si tina biasa rfaboboko rayatna cicoal. Laina bena re si riri smat mamagalna, si jaga rfakangela smat ta si rfabobokona. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ga mew bisa fderera ta si rpeina pa! Ise mali farumi mew ta wlo lolo ndadi smat ta cicoal mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, i nane ndadi laisa smat karajan ta nleleane mew. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Fare ise mali mewi ta nlokolo ndadi smat ta rcicoal foloi mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, i nane npei ni dirica laisa re smat karajanna bo nleleane mewna foloi. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Tina laisa re Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo mali dunia tae bo nduk leleane pa, ga bo nleleane fare npo ni dirica bo nmat fare nfayangise smat lalo ni dosa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat silu dem pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mrk. 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk. 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Oras ta Yesus i re ni muritna rfane rcapang mali bendar Yerikho, en smatna lal rderera I. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ga en smat silu dem pa rtotolang mali lalingca lapo. Oras ta si rlonga Yesuse ndel mana, si rgigam, “Apa, kolano Daute ni duri, masie ame lae!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Rlonga si rgigam tina, smatna lal rtolea si bo si mati liorina. Ga smat silu tasa rgigamna rfacicoal si hawe, “Apa, kolano Daute ni duri, mmasie ame lae!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Gabe Yesuse nfola, fare nololaw smat silu tasa. I nfautno si, “Mew wlomew lolona Ya bo ipeo mew ahai?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Si rcanglo, “Apa, ame kdore bo bisa kem hawe.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Nlonga tina, Yesuse nbasamna nmasie si. I nice mtarina tina to si dem hawe. Fola tina, si rderera Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Smatna lal ta rtotoman fare rfamamagal Yesus oras ta I ncung mali Bendar Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mrk. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk. 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Oras ta Yesus I re ni muritna bo rdahle bendar Yerusaleme to, ga rlafo mali pnu Betfage ta mali popo Zaitun, Yesuse ncula ni murit silu, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />fare nfatnawe laitane, “Mewe ffan lali pnu ta en potao tina. Mana mew osta fem keledai maping isa rpitna i, ga mali lapona en ntu isa. Mew fsupate ni walaca bo ffut si mali Ya i. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Gabe laisa smatna rfautno mew, mew fua si laitane, ‘Jouca bo npake keledai tae. Gabe laisa npake hola i to, tina to kfawe i.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Farumi tina ndadi i, laisa re ta Jou Lahatalla nua nabina tantuba mali be laitane,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Fua si to smat ta rteteam mali bendar Yerusalem na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">ta smatna rfangahnyo si hawe Sion, fu laitane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">‘Co fem, nimew Kolanoca nlafo mali mewi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">I ncombong pa. I ndawil keledai isa, keledai cia poi sube.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Rlonga fola tina, murit silu tasa rfane ga rpei laisa ta Yesuse nua sina. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Si dut keledai maping cia fare ntuca lali Yesus i. Fare, si difa i re riri jubana puis keledai ciana fare Yesuse ma ndawil keledai cia. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Oras Yesuse ndel mali lalingca, smatna lal riri jubana rcesa mali lalingca. En bena ta rkati ai ni magal ta nenenana ta wluna po sube, dising mali lalingca bo rtotoman Yesus. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Smatna lal ta rfan mali Yesuse nbona fare ta rdel mali tao, rfamamagal I fare liorina mamagal, si du laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosana! Tfamamagal I, kolano Daute ni duri!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Tfamamagal I ta Jou Lahatalla ncula I nlafo mali!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Hosana! Tfamamagal Jou Lahatalla ta tigo molangca!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Oras ta Yesuse nlafo mali bendar Yerusalem, tina to bendar cia namlelang. Gabe smat ta mali bendar ciana rfautan, “Smat tae ise ga?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Gabe smat laloca ncanglo, “I cia Yesus, Nabi i mali Nasaret mali batang Galilea!”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo smat ta rfawage fare rfagon mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagal cana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mrk. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk. 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Fola tina, Yesuse ncung mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna. Manana smat ta rfawage fare rfagonna, ga Yesuse nfaungo ndumi si. I nfapalpalna smat ta jaga rfaiwna tiwina riri mejana fare smat ta jaga rwage mani pombona riri bangkona. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Fare Yesuse nua si, “Mali Jou ni Kitabcana en rlefo laitane, ‘Ya nik Ebai tae osta ndadi Ebai ta smatna rlafo bo rfalafo riri mautingna nais Jou I.’ Ga mew fpei ndadi smat ta rmadarawana gagawori bo rgogan si!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Fola tina, smat ta dem pana fare smat ta rtempangna rlafo lali Yesus i mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna, fare I nfamafia si. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ga oras ta imamna riri ta rfaboboko fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa dem Yesuse nfamafia smat tina, si rtole. Fare si rtole bena oras ta si rlonga wai nenenana rgigam mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalnana, “Hosana! Tfamamagal kolano Daute ni duri tae!”<verse eid="MAT 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Gabe si dua Yesus, “Ya, ga Aw mlonga pa lae ta wai nenenana rfamamagal Awna?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesuse nua si, “Ya ilonga. Mew rasa fbaca to ta Jou Lahatalla nu mali Kitab cana laitane, ‘Jouca nfafcule wai nenena ta ficorina kakala subena fare wai nenenana bo si rfamamagal I.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfateam si. I nfan lali bendar Yerusalem potalil mali pnu Betania, taga namtuli doram pusa mana.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncasi ai ara ta piyo paca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mrk. 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Ni semaca dororam isube, Yesus I re ni muritna rlolai hawe lali bendar Yerusalem. Mali lalingca, Yesuse nbasamna nbibisil. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Ga I nem en ai ara mali lalingca lapona. I dahle lali ai cia bo niyawa piyona, ga i nduk paisapa manana, ga wluna be. Gabe I nua ai cia, “Awe osta piyom panto denabe lali!” Oras cia to, ai araca namang.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Oras ta Yesuse ni muritna dem tina, si rherangna gaole, gabe rfautno I, “Pesaga ai ara cia jampa be namangna?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesuse nua si, “Flonga famafia e, gabe mew fdela Jou fatutua molang, mew fafenana famang ai cia be pa, mewe ma bisa fparenta lolas tae, ‘Nlange i tigea i lalaw olati!’ Tina osta ndadi i. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Fare, laisa mewe bo ffalafo nimew mauting nais Jou Lahatala I bo fdor okosesi, ahai be ta mewe bo fdorna, I osta npo, asal ta mew fdela fatutua.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rfaboboko agama Yahudi rfautno Yesus mduk kawasa manca mali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mrk. 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Laina rlafo mali Yerusalem, Yesuse ncung mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna. Oras Yesuse nfafcule smat ta pulinana, imamna riri ta rfaboboko fare simosimo Yahudina rlafo I ga rfautan laitane, “Farumi ta Aw mpei tane, Aw mduk kawasa manca mali? Fare kawasa tina ise ta npo Aw.”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ya ma bo ifautno mew. Fare mew bisa fsanglo ahai ta Ya iku tane, Ya ma osta ifabinga mew ise ta npo Ya kawasaca bo ipei farumi tanena. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Co mew fua Ya, ise ta npo Yohanese kawasa ncisope smatnana? Jou Lahatalla pare smatna?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Rlonga tina, si rfauwo si laitane, “Gabe laisa ite tu, ‘Jou Lahatalla’, I osta bo nua it, ‘Pesaga mew fdela Yohanes pana?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Ga laisa ite tu, ‘Smatna rpo i kawasa,’ ite tamcait smat lalo tae osta ntole, ningalena si danggap, Yohanes tae nabi ta jaga nfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Gabe si dua Yesus, “Ame kto pa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Gabe Yesuse ma nua si, “Gabe laina, Ya ma ifabinga mew pa ise ta npo Ya kawasaca bo ipei farumi tane.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta npei ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nculana, i cia to Jou Lahatalla ni smat i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yesuse nfautno smat ta rfaboboko agama Yahudi tina, “Flonga Ya bo ikafetang andeande tae su, fola taga Ya bo ifautno mew. En apa isa ntu manna smat silu. Bahngana, i nfan lali ntu ta abanica taga nu laitane, ‘Wol tae, awe mfane bo mkarajan mali bet anggurca.’<verse eid="MAT 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Ga wai cia ncanglo, ‘Apa, ya ikalow pa bo ifanna.’ Morco napna, wai cia nmanyasal fare wlona niwan, gabe nfan lali bet anggurca.<verse eid="MAT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Fola tina, apa cia nfan lali ntu ta wawaica taga nua i laitane, ‘Awe mfane mkarajan mali bet anggurca.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:30">Waica ncanglo hma, ‘Ime apa.’ Naga i nfan pa.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Gabe laisa mew, mali wai silu tasa, ise ta npei fmarica ni mauna?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina rcanglo, “Wai ta abanica.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Gabe tina flonga ta Ya bo ikua mew tane, smat ta rbaradosa si riri karanjanna rfautno pajak fare maping mayaina, si ta rtuba mali mewi bo rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta I bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Ga, oras ta Yohanes ta nfasisopca nlafo mewna, i nfafcule mfalaisa smatna bo rtub fatutua mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, ga mewe fdela pa ahai ta i nuna. Naga, oras ta smat ta rfautno pajak fare maping mayaina rlonga Yohanes, si rdela, ga mew failou pa bo fiwane wlomewnana, fare fdela pa ahai ta Yohanese nuna.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus npo andeande ga smat Yahudi ta dailow I pana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mrk. 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk. 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Co mew flonga andeande isa tae hawe. En tuan isa, npei bet anggur taga npei pagar nyel bet cia. Fare i n'gali lop bo ndadi gagaw ta bo nfo anggurna. Fare i npei hawe ebai bet isa tigo bo smat ta rjaga bet cia. Fare, i nfatator re smat ta rkarajan mali bet cia bo rjagana betca. Fola tina, i nfan lali batange nesa. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Oras ta bo tkati anggurna nlafo i to, i ncula ni smat karajanna rfan lali smat ta rjaga bet cia bo rdore i na loatna. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Ga rlafo pulina, smat ta rjaga bet tina rwagfo smat karajan cia. Si rpun isa, ga ta nesana si rpun famat, taga ta nesa benana rtigeo si re pat denabe rmat. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Fola tina, tuan ta na bet cia ncula ni smat karajan ta nesana hawe rfanna dalal okoce mali ta ntubana. Ga smat karajan ta rcula si tina ma rdukna sama re smat karajan ta ntubana.<verse eid="MAT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Morco napna, tuan ta na betca ncula i ntuca to nfan lali smat ta rjaga bet cia. Smat ta na betca nu laitane, ‘Gabe ya ntukca ta i lali, si osta rcuba i.’<verse eid="MAT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Oras ta smat ta rjaga betca dem tuan ta na bet cia ntuca, si rfauwo si laitane, ‘I ta osta ndadi waris mali bet cia. Gabe mali to bo ite tpun famati, bo bet tae ndadi ite rar i.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Gabe si rwagfo wai cia, taga rcapnga i mali betca potalil, taga rpun famat i.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Gabe, Yesuse nfautno ta rfaboboko agama Yahudi tina, “Gabe laisa bo mew, tuan ta na betca nlafo, i bo npeo si ahai re smat ta rjaga bet cia?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Si rcanglo Yesus, “I osta npun nfamat si smat ta wlorina mayai tina. Taga i bo nfatatur re smate nesa bo duruse na bet anggurca fare ta dailow rpo i na lowat gabe laisa ni oras ta tfakatina nlafo ito.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mewe rasa fbaca to mali Jou Lahatalla ni Kitabcana? Laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Pat ta basna rpake panto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">Jou Lahatalla bo npei ndadi fandasi ta cicoal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Jou Lahatalla npei laina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">dena be ite temna mafiana gaole.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Yesuse nua si hawe, “Gabe mew wlomewyaneto tane famafia, Jou Lahatalla bo nyale mew smate Yahudi nimew hakna bo ndadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta I bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano. Ga I bo npo hak tina lali smate nesana, foloi mali smat ta rpei ta i ni mauna. Si tina fatailo laisa ai ta piyona mafia. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Ise ta nmarapawil puis pat tina, i osta namjakam. Fare ise ta patca ntabi ica i osta namjakamna foloi. Tina osta ndadi i mali smat ta dailow Ya pana.]”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Oras ta smat Yahudina riri imam ta rfabobokona fare smat ta rderera fatfato Farisi rlonga andeande tina, si rto, Yesuse nmautingna bo si le to. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Gabe si dolna gaole bo rwagfo I, ga si damcait smat laloca, ningalena smat laloca nu Yesus cia nabi ta nfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Smatna lal ta Jou nololaw bo rdadi I ni Smat, ga ese be ta bo nfisang sina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk. 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Gabe Yesuse nmauting hawe lali sili npake andeande. I nu, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Smat ta rderera Jou Lahatalla ga rdadi I ni smat si, laisa re andeande tae: En kolano isa npei ntuca ni rame fasaw. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Ga farumi tina nciape to, i ncula ni smat karajanna rfane dololaw smat ta i nlafo si tona bo rlafo to mali rame fasaw cia, ga smat tina dailow pa bo rlafona. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Gabe tina, kolanoca ncula ni smat karajan ta nesana hawe, ‘Mewe ffane to bo fua smat ta ya ilafo si to na, ya ikati sapi man isa fare sapi ta po subena isa gabe rfamasa to. Farumi tina nciape to, gabe flafo to mali rame fasawca.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Ga smat ta dololaw sina rfaduli ololaw cia pa. En ta rfan ci lalei bet i, en ta rfane ga rfawage. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Ga ta nesana rwagfo smat karajanna taga rfakangela si, fare rpun famat si.<verse eid="MAT 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Nlonga tina, kolanoca ntole. Fare, ncula ni tentarana lali bo rpun famat smat ta rpun i ni smat karajan tina, fare i ncula si hawe rtapinge smat tina riri bendarna.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Fola tina, kolanoca nua smat karajan ta nesana laitane, ‘Rame fasawca nciape to, ga smat ta ya ikololaw tina pantas pa bo rcung mali ya nik rame tae. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Gabe tane, mew fan lali lalingna, taga mew fololaw ise be ta mew re si fadukdukna, bo si mali rcung rame fasaw tae.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Rlonga tina, smat karajanna rfan. Ise be ta si rdupingi mali laling popo si dololaw i, biare ga smat mafia i ma smat mayai i, si dololawna denabe gagawna bakbaka re smat.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Ga oras ta kolanoca ncunge bo nfadukduk re smat ta rlafona, i nem smat isa npake kabaya rame pa. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Gabe kolanoca nfautno smat ta nlafo cia, ‘Ee nik del ta aw, pesaga aw mali mantanena mpake kabaya rame pana?’ Ga smat cia lio pa. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Fare kolano cia nua ni smat karajanna laitane, ‘Mew fpitane smat cia fico re kakamona taga ftopa i natalil mali gagaw ta dororam molangna. Mali gagaw cia, smatna bo rtangis denabe si fmorina kikik ningalena rkangela.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Gabe Yesuse nfatotime ni caritana fare nu laitane, “Smatna lal ta Jou Lahatalla nololawna bo rdadi I ni smat, ga ese be ta nfisang sina.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina rfautno ga tpalas pajak bo diyawa Yesuse na sal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mrk. 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk. 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Fola tina, smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi rfane rfasogaro si, bo rfautno Yesus bo diyawa na salsal. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Gabe si rcula riri muritna fare smat diranca ta biasa rderera kolano Herodesna rfan lali Yesus i fare fu laitane, “Guru, ame kto, Guru wlomna molang. Guru biasa mfafcule smatna fatutua ga mfalaisa tub tderera Jou Lahatalla ni mauna. Ga Guru mamcait isa pa, ningalena Guru miyawa taitail pa. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Gabe oras tae ame bo kfautno Guru, gabe laisa tderera animam agamaca ni fatfatona, bisa pare bisa pa ame kpalas pajak lali kolano mamagal Romacana?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ga Yesuse nto wlorina bo mayai tina. Gabe I nua si laitane, “Woi smat ta fmadarawa, pesaga mew bo fiyawa Ya nak salna? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Co mewe faemo Ya tiwi ta biasa fpake fpalas pajakna!” Gabe si rpo I tiwi perak isa.<verse eid="MAT 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Gabe Yesuse nfautno si laitane, “Gambar ise fare ise ngahnyo tane?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Si rcanglo, “Kolano mamagal Romaca ni gambar fare ngahnyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Gabe laina, fpo kolanoca to ahai ta nane mewe bo fpo ina, fare fpo Jou Lahatalla ahai ta nane mewe bo fpo Jou Lahatallana!”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Rlonga tina, si rherang fare si rduk akal panto hawe bo diyawa Yesuse na salsalna, gabe si rfane dowe I.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule ga smat ta rmatna osta rpaling hawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mrk. 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Wol cia to, smat agama Yahudi diranca ta rderera sogaro Saduki rlafo Yesus. Fatfato tae ni fatfatona, smat ta rmatna osta rpaling panto. Gabe si rfautno Yesus laitane, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />“Guru, tantuba nabi Musa nfabinga, man ise be ta nfasawe to ga nmat ntu pa, i tenoca nane nfasawa i ni balo cia bo teno ta nmat cia en ni durina. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Ga tina sal pana ndadi i to mali amam i tane laitane: En manna smat sifit rfatenow. Ta uatica nfasaw ga nmat ntu pa, gabe ta papapo napca nfasawa ta nmatca ni balo. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ga i ma denabe nmate ntu pa. Laina bena re ta faicolica denabe ta faifiti cia, si le ma rmate ndumi nturi pa. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Gabe morco napna maping cia ma nmat.<verse eid="MAT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Gabe, oras tae amame bo kfautan, lomanta mali wol kiamatca oras ta smat ta rmat rpaling hawe, ta manca i molang mali smat sifit tasa ta ndadi maping cia ni uati? Ningalena, smat sifit ta rfatenow tasa farumi rfasawa i to!”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Gabe Yesuse nua si laitane, “Mewe fsalna gaole, ningalena mew ftaif Jou ni Kitabca pa, fare mew fto pa Jou Lahatalla ni kawasa. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Ga lomanta oras Jou Lahatalla nfapaling hawe smat ta rmatna, si rfasaw panto, ga si rtub farerer re malaikatna mali sorogai. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ga smat ta rmate ga rpaling hawe, rasa mew fbaca to mali Jou ni Kitab cana. Ta Jou Lahatalla nu laitane, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Ya tane to Jou Lahatalla ta Abraham, Ishak fare Yakub biasa rcuba Ya.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:32">Oras ta Jou Lahatalla nu tina, Abraham, Ishak fare Yakub rmate to, ga si rpaling hawe re Jou Lahatalla ga rcuba I. Gabe Jou Lahatalla cia smat ta rmatna riri Jou i pa, ga smat ta rtubna riri Jou i.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Oras smat lalo ta si manana rlonga ahai ta Yesuse nuna, si rherang ningalena si wlori lolona gaole I ni sogaro tina.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Parenta ta pentingna foloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mrk. 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Oras cia, smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi rlonga ta Yesuse ncanglona ta npei denabe smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Saduki bisa du paisapa nto hawe. Gabe oras tina to, si rfayalo si, <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />fare si riri guru agama isa ta nto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa nfautno Yesus bo niyawa Yesuse na sal hawe laitane, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Guru, mali farumi ta en mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa, parenta ta manca ta cicoal foloina?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesuse nua i, “Parenta cia laitane, ‘Mew nane fatutua fmasie be Jou Lahatalla, mew nimew Jou i. Mew nane fmasie I na foloi mali farumi ta mew fmasiena, fare mew bena nane fmasie I ni lalingna wlomew yaneto I.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Tina to cial ta foloina, fare ta pusana. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Ga parenta ta failu ta laisa tinana laitane, ‘Mew ma nane fmasie smate nesana laisa re mew fmasie nimew dirica tutuling.’<verse eid="MAT 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Parenta pilu tane to ta ndadi ndumi i mali farumi fatfato mali Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare mali nabi ta nesana riri kitabna.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesias cia kolano Daute ni duri i fare i bena kolano Daute ni Jou i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:32-37">Mrk. 12:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk. 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Oras ta smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi rfayalo si mana sube, Yesuse nfautno si, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Co mew fua Ya, me wlomewna mfalaisa ga Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji. I cia ise ni duri i?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Gabe si rcanglo Yesus, “I cia kolano Daute ni duri i.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Gabe laina, pesaga popiseina oras ta Jou ni Rohca nkawasa kolano Daut, kolano Daute nololaw Mesiasna Jou? Oras ciana, kolano Daute nu laitane,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Jou Lahatalla nua Ya nik Jouca:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Mtotolange to mali gagaw ta nmafia tae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">mali Ya nik welana, denabe Ya ifakala Anim musuna farumi.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Gabe, kolano Daute ntutuling be nu Mesias cia i ni Jou i, mfalaisa hawe smatna bo du Mesias cia ga kolano Daute ni duri i?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Mali farumi smat tina, isa pa ta bo ncanglo Yesusna. Gabe mulain mali oras cia, smatna isa bere enpa ta bo rfautno Yesusna.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Mati ftalko guru agama Yahudi fare smat Farisina riri tabeatnana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mrk. 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37-54">Luk. 11:37-54</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua smat laloca fare ni muritna, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi, si riri karanjanna laisa re nabi Musa tantubana, bo rfaolang fatfato ta mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Gabe tina, mew nane flonga fare fderera farumi ta si rfafcule mewna. Ga mew mati fderera riri tabeatnana. Biarega si rfafcule mew, ga si tutuling rpeo pa tina. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Si rpei fatfato agamana lal taga tebtebna gaole, taga rcula smatna rderera tina. Ga ta molangna si tutuling rpei pa fatfato tina. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Farumi ta si rpei tina, bo smatna rtail si. Laisa pitpitan ta mali bobokorina fare kakamorina, si rlefona mali Kitabca lolo taga si rpeina rfasai. Fare, si riri juba ni lawena ma si rpeina rfalanga bo smatna rto si tina, rderera Jou famafia.<verse eid="MAT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Gabe si rcung mali ramena fare mali Ebai sombayangna, si rlokolo rtotolang po tao mali gagaw ta mafiana. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Si rlokolo smatna rfamamagal si gabe laisa si mali gagaw ta ni smatna lal. Fare si rlokolo smatna dololaw si, ‘Apa guru.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Ga mew, mati flokolo smatna dololawe mew ‘apa guruna’! Ningalena, mew nimew Guruca isa be, gabe farumi mew tina fatenow fare faramaw. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Fare mew mati fololaw smate nesana ‘apa’, ningalena mew nimew Apaca isa be, I cia Apa ta mali sorogaica. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Matinato mewe fabiare smatna dololaw mew ‘Ta faboboko’, ga mewe nimew ta nfabobokoca isa be, I cia Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatna. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Ise mali mew ta ndadi smat ta rfoloi, i nane nleleane smate nesa laisa re smat karajan ta rleleane smat. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Ningalena, ise be ta nbasame ni dirica nmamagal, Jou Lahatalla npei bo ndadi smat ta riri ngale pa. Ga ise ta nbasame ni dirica laisa smat ta riri ngale pa, Jou Lahatalla bo nlange i ndadi smat ta nfoloi.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Fkapalange to mew guru agama Yahudi ta fto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina! Mew fmadarawa ndumi. Ningalena, mew tutuling fpo nimew dirica pa bo ndadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali nimew tubca, fare mew tutuling ftibane smat ta dusaha bo rdadi I ni smat. Tina laisa re mew fakaico si bawa gabe bisa rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat si pa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 23:13">[<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Fkapalange to mew guru agama Yahudi ta fto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina! Mewe fmadarawa ndumi. Fare mew flokolo fdarawa maping balona taga fyale riri ebaina. Ga laisa mew bo ffalafo nimew mauting nais Jou Lahatalla I, flokolo falanga matingna tina bo smatna rto mew tina smat mafia, naga enpa. Gabe tina, mew osta fduk salna tebtebna gaole].<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Fkapalange to mew guru-guru agama Yahudi ta fto Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi! Mew fmadarawa ndumi. Ningalena mewe ffalai manca-manca be sung sapang mali pnuna, fiyawa smate bo rderera nimew fatfatona. Ga laina smat tina rderera mewe to, mew fpei sina osta wlorina mayai foloi mali mewi, mew fpei bo i rciape ncung naraka.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Fkapalange to mew ta ffabobokona! Mew tina fatailo laisa smat ta rbiafna rtuda smate nesa! Ga mew jaga fafcule smatna laitane, ‘Ise ta ncasi nu Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, smat cia ni sasina npitan i pa. Gabe laisa i ncasi nu guraci ta en mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagal cia, i ni sasi tina npitan i.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Mew tane fto paisapa fare fbiaf! Manca ta cicoalna foloi, guraci pare Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca? Ta molangna Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, paga? Ningalena Ebai Sombayang Mamagal cia ta npei guraci pumul tina ndadi mafia. <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Mew bena fafcule laitane, ‘Ise ta ncasi nu gagaw ta tapngo i aiwani ta tpeo sadakaca, i ni sasi tina npitan i pa. Ga ise ncasi nu aiwani ta tpo sadaka mali gagaw cia, i ni sasina npitan i.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Mew tane smat ta fbiaf! Manca ta foloina, aiwani ta tpoi sadaka cia, pare ni gagaw ta tapngo i sadaka cia? Ta molangna, gagaw ta tapngo i aiwani ta tpeoi sadakana tina,? Ningalena, gagaw cia ta npei sadakana ndadi molang. <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Gabe, ise ta ncasi nu gagaw ta tapngo i sadaka cia, i cia ncasina nu ga gagaw ta tapongo i sadaka cia be pa, ga farumi ta en puis gagaw ciana. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Fare ise ncasi nu Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, i cia ncasi ga nuna Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca be pa, ga i ncasi hawe mali Jou Lahatalla ta nteteam mana. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Laina bena, ise ta ncasi nu sorogaca, cia i ncasi nu Jou Lahatalla ni karapesa kolanoca fare nu Jou Lahatalla ta nteteam mali karapesa cia.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Fkapalange to mew guru agama Yahudi ta fto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi! Mewe fmadarawa ndumi. Ga mew jaga fpei perpuluhan, denabe rampa ta nenana laisa sulasi, ta mfanas fare pauna mafia, fare jintan, mewe fsalawe ni perpuluhan. Ga fatfato ta cicoal foloi mali Musa ni Kitab silim tasa mewe ffaduli pa, laisa fpei ta molang lali smatna, faeme nimew masiena lali smatna, fare fdadi smat ta rmanahan. Ta molangna mew nane fpei fatfato ta foloi cicoalna, fare mew bena mati folana fpei perpuluhanna. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Mew tina ffaboboko laisa re smat ta rbiafna rtuda smate nesa! Mew jaga fpei parenta ta nenena, ga Jou Lahatalla ni parenta ta cicoal foloi tina mew fpei pa. Tina fatailo laisa mewe ftapis mumumis nena mali namew wayana, taga unta mamagal isa pumul namew wayana mewe filam i.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Fkapalange to mew guru agama Yahudi ta fto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato farisi! Mew tina fmadarawa ndumi. Ningalena potalil temna mew fpei fatfato agama, naga mali wlomewna flokolo fsefto smate nesa ni okosesi fare fmampo pa bo ftahane nimew dirica tutulingna. Tina laisa smat ta duas galas fare dodai potalil be, pumul lolona pererekna gaole. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Ee mew smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina, fatailo mew laisa smat ta rbiafna! Ffaberesisu nimew fikiran ta mayaina, bo ahai ta mew fpei fare fu hawe tina ndadi mafia, tina laisa tfaberesi galas fare dodai pumul lolo bo ta potalilna ma beresi.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Fkapalange to mew guru agama Yahudi ta fto Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi! Mewe fmadarawa ndumi. Mew tina laisa piling ta ni cetna bubulang. Potalil temna mafia, naga pumulna bakbaka re smat ta rmatna riri long fare farumi ta mayaina. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Tina fatailo laisa re mew, potalil temna laisa smat ta damolang mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, naga pumul wlomewna, mewe fmadarawana gaole fare wlomewna mayai.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Fkapalange to mew guru agama Yahudi ta fto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi! Mewe fmadarawa ndumi. Mew jaga fpei nabina riri pilingna mafia. Fare mew bena jaga famafia smat ta rmate tona riri tugu bo wlomew yaneto si, tugu cia ta npei bo wlor yaneto si smat ta jaga rpei ta molang mali Jou Lahatalla nbona. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Ga mew fu laitane, ‘Gabe laisa ite tcuna ttub farerer re hma re bbur tantubana, ite osta tderera pa rpun famat nabi tinana.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Gabe laisa mew fu laina, mew fatuwo to, mew tina smat ta rpun nabina ni duri mew. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Gabe ta mafiana, mew fpei be okosesi ta mayaina to, fderera hma re bbu mew tantubana riri tabeat ta ncal tina!<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Woi mew smat ta fmayai. Mew laisa gu ta nbisana. Mew tane nimew durina smat mayai, laisa gu ta nbisa ni durina. Jou Lahatalla osta nfasunge mew lali narakaca, fare mew osta fpiyana bisa pa. <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Gabe tina, flonga famafia. Ya bo isula nabina, smat ta rpandena, fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa. En sifis mali sili ta mew bo fpun famatna, ga ta nesana mew bo fsalip si. En bena ta nesana mali mew nimew ebai sombayangna ta mew bo fpun si re wala mali cicapona mdalim. Fare en bena ta mew bo fatagtagana bo fkangela si mali bendar isa fola lali bendar isa fare bendar ta nesana. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Gabe tina, Jou Lahatalla bo nfasale mew ga farumi smat ta mew hma re bbu mew tantubana rpun famate to mali dunia tae, mulai mali Habel denabe Berekhya ntuna, nabi Zakharia, ta rpun famati mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca mali gagaw ta tapngo i sadakaca ni fapaluan re gagaw ta nmafia ta biasa Jou Lahatalla nlafo mana. Si tina smat ta jaga rpei okosesi ta molang mali Jou Lahatalla nbona. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Flonga famafia ta Ya iku tane. Mew ta en oras taena, osta fduk salsal ningalena poko be farumi okosesi ta mayai tina.”<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nmagogoru i, ningalena smat Yerusalemna dailow pa bo rlonga I na</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk. 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Fola tina, Yesuse nu, “Sene mew smat Yerusalemna! Mew ta fpun famat nabi ta jaga rfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw, fare mew bena ftig si re pat denabe rmat, smat ta Jou Lahatalla ncula si lali mewina. Ilolai mailolai Ya ilokolo ifayalo mew bo fdahle Ya, laisa tatale ta rwobo nturina. Ga mew failow pa. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Gabe tina, co mew ftarokira, Jou Lahatalla osta i ni panto mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagal taena gabe Ebai tae bo ndadi namlileina gaole. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Flonga famafia e, mulain oras tae mew osta fem Ya panto. Ga lomanta orasna Ya ilafo hawe, mew osta fem Ya hawe taga fu laitane, ‘Ffamamagal I, Jou Lahatalla ta ncula I nlafo mali.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca bo dewisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Fola tina, Yesuse ncapang mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Oras tina, I ni muritna rdahle i taga rfaemo i Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni gedung-gedung ta mafiana. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mewe fem gedung-gedung tina to? Flonga famafia e, lomanta ni orasna farumi tina osta mjakam, fare patna osta pusa bere enpa ta bo en mali gagaonana.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ahai ta bo ndadi i ga kiamat paubena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mrk. 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk. 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan lali popo Zaitun taga ntotolang mana. I ni muritna rdahle I bo si re I be rmautingna. Si du, “Guru, mfabinga ame to, opfis ta Guru mu nana i tina bo ndadi ina? Fare ni fafayalna ahai gabe laisa Guru bo mlafo hawe, fare fafayal wol kiamatna mfalaisa e?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesuse nua si, “Matina denabe dakale mew. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Ningalena smatna lal osta rlafo rpake Ya ngahnyokna, fare si du laitane, ‘Ya tane to Mesias, kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatna!’ Ga si tina dakal be smat ta lalna rderera si. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Mew osta flonga parang mali batang isa penepa mali gagawe nesa. Biarega laina, mewe mati famcaitna. Farumi nane ndadi i, ga tina ni oras paube dunia tae bo nkiamatna. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Lomanta fola suku re sukuna osta rfaparang, fare kerajaan isa nfaparang re kerajaan ta nesana. Fare osta en hawe smatna rmata an fare sui manca-manca. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ga farumi tina taga ni kangelana wol kiamatca paube, tina laisa re kangela ta mapingna rbasam oras ta nturina bo ntub. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Ga oras cia, smat ta rdela pana bo rwagfo mew, taga rfakangela mew fare rpun famate mew. Gabe smat mali farumi suku osta riri le mew ningalena mewe fderera Ya. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Fare, smat lalo ta rdela Yana osta rdela Ya panto hawe. Si osta rfaututna mayai, fare rpo riri delna bo rfakangela si. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Lomanta smatna rlafona lal taga du, si tina nabi ta rfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw. Tina si dakal be bo smat ta lalna rderera si. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Gabe smat ta rpei okosesi ta mayaina nbang i ga lal, gabe tina smatna lal osta rgogoru smate nesana panto. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Ga smat ta rdela Ya turusna denabe riri tubca morco, Jou Lahatalla bo nfasalamat si. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Ga lomanta Abar Mafia ga Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali ni smatna, Abar mafia tane osta smatna rfabinga mali farumi suku, fola tina taga kiamat.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ta bo ndadi i mali wol ta kangela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mrk. 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk. 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Lomanta smat isa nmakotalena gaole lali Jou Lahatalla i bo nlafo. Smat cia bo nosal mali gagaw ta Jou Lahatalla nlafo ni smat pumul Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, laisa ta Jou Lahatalla nua nabi Daniel popise i na. (Ise ta nbaca tane, tarokira famafia bo bisa ftaife ningalena.) <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Gabe laisa smat ta nmakotaleca nosal mana to, smat ta en mali batang Yudeana, ta mafiana rfarera bo fgogane mew mali lolasna. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Smat ta si puis ebai popo, mati fduri bo fyal okosesi mali ebai lolona, ga fduri bo ffarera to. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Laina bena re smat ta mali betina, mati flolai mali ebai i bo fyal pakena. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Ta kangela molang oras ciana, maping ta riri badanna fare maping ta nturina rcus subena. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Fsombayange to, bo oras ta mew farumi fpiaya bo fgogane mew mali lolas ina, mati faduduk re ulanna fare feta wol Sabat pa, wol ta smat agama Yahudina bisa rkarajan pa. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Ningalena, wol tina kangelana gaole, ta kangela foloina mali farumi ta smatna rbasamna. Mulain mali ta po be Jou Lahatalla npei dunia tae denabe oras tae, enpa nto kangela ta bo ndadi laisa tina hawena, fare tina osta ndadi i panto. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Gabe, laisa Jou Lahatalla nfakokope wol kangela tina pa, farumi smatna osta rmat. Ga I n'gogoru smat ta I nfisange tona, I nfakokope wol kangela tina. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Oras tina, gabe laisa en smatna du mew, ‘Co fem! Mesias I mantane!’ Penepa si du, ‘Mesiase I pulina!’ Mewe mati fdelana ahai ta si du na. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Ningalena smatna osta rlafona lal taga du si Mesias, penepa du si nabi ta rfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw. Fare si le ma rpei mujizat fare fafayal ta nfaeme riri kawasana cicoal. Fare, osta rdarawa smat ta Jou Lahatalla nfisang si tona, bo mati rderera Jouna, ga rderera be si. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Gabe flolam famafia e, farumi tane Ya ikuwa mewe ntuba to ga tina ndadi i paube.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Gabe laisa en smatna dua mew, ‘Co fem, Mesiase I mali padang gurun,’ mati mew lalina. Gabe laisa en ta du, ‘Co fem, Mesias I mali gagaw ta isa ntopana,’ tina ma mewe mati fdelana. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Gabe oras Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo hawe, farumi smat ta mali dunia tae bisa dem. Tina fatailo laisa lemlemna ta ncapang mali wolca nca denabe wolca ncop. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Fatailo laisa aiwani isa nmat mali gagaw isa, farumi smatna ndadi rto ningale manina osta rfayalo si dan aiwani ta nmatca.”<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fafayal ga Yesus bo nlafo hawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mrk. 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk. 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Laina wol ta nkangelaca nfola to, wolca osta ndadi ndororam, fare ngaca plangno panto. Ototafna osta marapawil mali langitca, fare farumi ta en mali langitcana ndadi laisa tantuba panto. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Fare oras tina to, osta en fafayal mali langitca bo tto Smat ta mali sorogaica bo nlafo hawe. Dem tina, farumi suku mali bumi taena ndadi damcait fare rtangis. Si farumi osta dem Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo puis metna langitca fare farumi kawasa fare planganna mamagal. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Fare trompetca osta liona mamagalna gaole, gabe Smat ta mali sorogaica ncula ni malaikatna rcapange bo rfayalo farumi I ni smat ta I nfisang mali farumi gagaw mali dunia tae, mali cicapo denabe cicapo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ahai ta bo ndadi i oras ta Smat mali Sorogaca nlafo hawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mrk. 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Yesuse nu andeande isa laitane, “Mewe nane fbalajar mali ai ara tae. Gabe laisa ni magal nenena mulaine ntipa i tina, mew fto wolwolna bo mnu panto. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Laina bena gabe laisa mew fem wol ta kangelana ta Ya ku tina mulaine ndadi i, mewe ndadi fto, mnu panto Smat ta mali sorogaica bo nlafo hawe. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Flonga famafia ta Ya ikua mew tane, smat ta rtub oras taena, en ta rtub sube denabe farumi tina ndadi i. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Langit fare bumi tae bo mnyei, ga Ya nik mautingna osta menyei pa denabe lali.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rdelana nane rciap Yesuse bo nlafo hawena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mrk. 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk. 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Smatna isa pa ta nto oras laisa Smat ta mali sorogaica bo nlafo hawena. Malaikat ta mali sorogaina rto pa, ga Apa ta mali sorogaica be ta ntona. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Gabe laisa Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo hawe, tina laisa re oras ta jaman nabi Nuh popise ina. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Oras tina, smatna rto pa ipis mamagalca bo nlafona, gabe si rtubna biasa be, si rceli re rdom biasa be, fare si rfasawna biasa be. Si riri tubca laina be denabe nabi Nuh ncung mali kapal mamagalca. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Ga smat tina rto pa ipis mamagalca bo nlafona. Lomanta si damduri to taga rto, si bo rbodito. Laisa re tina bena, osta smatna rciap pa oras Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo hawena. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Lomanta mali oras cia, gabe en man silu rkarajan mali beti, isaca Jou Lahatalla bo nlange i, taga isa bo nfateam i. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Ga oras cia bena, gabe laisa en maping silu rtok gandum, ta isa ica Jou Lahatalla bo nlange i taga isaca bo nfateam i.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Gabe tina, fjagjaga to, ningalena mewe fto pa opfis nimew Jouca bo nlafona. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Ga mewe ma nane flolam famafia andeande isa tae: Gabe laisa ebai ppuca nto to opfise smat ta rmaloisna bo rlois mali i ni ebai ciana, i osta nailow pa bo namtulina i njagjaga bo smat ta rloisna bisa rcung pa mali i ni ebai ciana. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Laina bena re mew, mew nane fsiap turus, ningalena Smat ta mali sorogaica osta nlafo hawe ni orasna mew fto pa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nane fdelana fatutua bo Smat ta mali Sorogaca nlafo hawena, mew fsiape to</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk. 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe laisa en smat karajan ta npande fare nmanahan, i ni tuanca nlange i ndadi ta nfaboboko bo nfatube smat karajan ta nesana gabe laisa ni orasna nlafo i. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Smat karajan cia osta rcangnang gabe laisa ni tuanca nlafo, ncuna i npei ni karajan tina famafia. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Flonga famafia ta Ya iku tane, ni tuanca osta nlange i taga npo i kawasa bo njaga farumi tuanca ni okosesina.<verse eid="MAT 24:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Ga laisa smat karajanca wlona mayai, i osta nu mali wlona laitane, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />‘Ya nik tuanca nuwena mnu sube.’ Taga i nmulaine npune smat karajan ta nesana, taga nceli re ndom farerer re smat ta nmon sina. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Ga lomanta mali wol ta i nto pana, fare mali oras ta i nto pana, garayanna i ni tuanca nuwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Gabe ni tuanca nfasal i re salsal ta tebteb. I nduk salna nmat. Gabe i nduk salsal laisa smat ta rmadarawana. Mana, si bo rtangis turus denabe fmorina kikik ningalena rbasamna kangelana gaole.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Smatna nane rciap turus denabe Yesuse nlafo hawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Lomanta Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo hawe fare nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali ni smatna, tina fatailo laisa andeande tae: en malesna smat yafasa dut padamara bo rtotoman man ta nfasawca. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Mali yafasa tasa, silime rbodok, silim tasa rpande. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Silim ta rbodok tasa dute riri poci, ga dut egatna foloi pa. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Ga silim ta rpande tasa en dute riri pocina fare riri egatna foloi.<verse eid="MAT 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Males yafasa tasa rtotoman man ta nfasauca, ga mnu nlafo pana. Si damtututil gabe damtuli.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Gabe wop fapaluan, si rgarayan smatna rgigam, ‘Ya, man ta nfasauca nlafo to! Mali to bo ttotoman i!’<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Rlonga tina males yafasa tasa rpaling, taga rfapepeya riri pocina. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Fare males ta rbodok tasa dua males ta rpande tasa, ‘Fpo am egat faokoce, ningalena animam poci tae bo nmate to.’<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Ga males ta rpandena du laitane, ‘Amame bisa koce mew egat pa, ningalena osta egat tane nlafo pa bo amam fare mewna. Ta mafiana mew ffane to bo fgon egat mali smat ta rwagena.’<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Gabe males ta rbodokna rfane rgon egat. Oras ta si rfane rgon egat, man ta nfasauca nlafo. Ga males ta rpandena rsiape to, rcung farerer re man ta nfasauca mali gagaw ta rpeo i rameca, taga rkait bawaca.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Fola tina, males ta rbodokna duwe rgon egatna, si dem bawaca rkait i to, gabe si dololaw, ‘Apa, Apa! Msalawe bawaca lae.’<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Ga man ta nfasauca nu pumul ebaica lolo nata, ‘Flonga, ya ifayala mew pa.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Nafetange fola andeande cia, Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe mew fjaga to, ningalena mew osta fto pa, opfis Ya bo ilafo hawena.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat karajan ta rmanahan fare smat karajan ta rmanahan pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk. 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo hawe Nkawasa ndadi Kolano, tina ni rupana fatailo laisa andeande tae: En smat isa bo nfan lali gagaw ta laspa. Oras ta i bo nfan, i nololawe ni smat karajanna rfayalo farumi si, taga ni aratana si diyawa ni lalingna mfalaisa bo rdukna foloi hawe mali tina. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Mali i ni smat karajan isa, i npo i tiwi mas tas pilim. Mali ni smat karajan isa ta nesa i haweca, i npo tiwi masna tas pilu. Taga, ni smat karajan ta nesana hawe, i npo tiwi masna tas pusa. I npo si kawasa tiwi mas tina, rderera si riri mampona isa-isa. Fola tina, i nfan.<verse eid="MAT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Gabe, smat karajan ta nyal tiwi mas tas pilim cia tina nfakiwaila tiwi tina, gabe i nduk tiwi masna tas pilim hawe. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Laina bena re smat karajan ta nduk tiwi tas pilu cia. I nfakiwaila tiwi tina, gabe i nduk tiwi masna tas pilu hawe. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ga smat karajan ta nduk tiwi mas tas pusaca, i nfane ga n'gali lop mali nyinyenca, taga n'gogan tuan cia ni tiwina.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Mnuna gaole taga riri tuanca nuwe. I nlafo laina, i nfayalo ni smat karajanna taga ncula si rfabinga i, mfalaisa re tiwi ta ipo mewna. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Smat karajan ta nduk tiwi mas tasa pilim cia i lali ni tuanca taga npo i tiwi mas tas yafasa lali ni tuan cia. Gabe smat karajan cia nua ni tuan cia, ‘Laisa apa mdela ya mpo ya tiwi mas tas pilim hawe, ga oras tae mem, ya idukna tas pilim hawe.’<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Ga ni tuanca nua i, ‘Mafiana gaole ta awe mpei tina. Aw tane Ya nik smat karajan ta mmafia fare manahan. Awe manahan re okosesi ta nenena, gabe Ya osta ipo aw okosesi ta mamagal, gabe mali to bo farerer re ya, tfasangnang it farerer.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Fola tina, smat karajan ta nduk tiwi mas tas piluca i lali ni tuanca. Smat karajan cia nua ni tuanca laitane, ‘Apa, apa gabe laisa mdela ya mpo tiwi mas tas pilu hawe, oras tae mem, ya ifakiwaila ga iduk tas pilu hawe.’<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Gabe ni tuanca nua i, ‘Mafiana gaole ta awe mpei tina. Aw tane Ya nik smat karajan ta mmafia fare manahan. Ningalena awe manahan mali okosesi ta nenena, gabe tane Ya bo ipo aw okosesi ta mamagal. Gabe mali to bo mfarerer re Ya, bo tfasangnang it farerer!’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Fola tina, smat karajan ta nduk tiwi mas tas pusaca i lali ni tuanca. Taga nua ni tuanca laitane, ‘Ya ito, apa wlomna cicoal. Apa jaga mfakati mali gagaw ta apa msake gei pa, fare apa jaga mnyal an bet mali bet ta aw mfatiwa pana. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Gabe tina, oras ta apa mpo tiwi tane, ya ikamcait, matina denabe tiwi tane myangis. Gabe ta mafiana, tiwi tina ya igaile bo mati isa nyalna.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Fare, ni tuanca nua i, ‘Hei, aw tane smat karajan ta wlomna mayai fare mmabusu. Aw mto, ya jaga ifakati mali gagaw ta ya isake gei pana, fare ya jaga iyal an bet mali gagaw ta ya ifatiwa pana. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Gabe ta mafiana, ya nik tiwi tina aw mfakiwaila bo oras ya ikuwena, ya bisa iyal tiwi tina fare ni foloina.’<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Gabe tuanca nua smat karajan ta nesana, ‘Fyale to tiwi mas tas pusa ta mali i ica, taga foce smat karajan ta nduk tiwi mas tas yafasa cia. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ningalena, gabe laisa smatna dailow ahai ta Ya ikuna, lomanta Jou Lahatalla n'gali i bo ntaifna lal. Ga smat ta dailow pa ahai ta Ya ikuna, ahai ta i ntona, Jou Lahatalla osta nyal hawe mali ii. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Gabe, oras tae wagfo smat karajan ta ningale pa tae, taga ftopa i lali gagaw ta ndorororamca. Mali gagaw cia, smat ta bo rduk salna rtangis denabe fmorina kikik, ningale si rkangelana gaole.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga mfalaisa lomanta oras ta I bo nadili farumi smatna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Smat ta mali sorogaica bo nlafo hawe re ni kawasa ta mamagalna fare farumi malaikatna rfarerer re I, fare I bo ntotolang mali karapesa kolano ta nmamagalca. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Mana, farumi suku bangsa osta rfayalo si mali I nbona. Fare I nfara si ndadi gagaw pilu, laisa smat ta rjaga domba nfara ni dombana mali kabilna. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Smat ta jaga rderera be Jou ni mauna, si tina fatailo laisa dombana, ga i bo nfayalo si mali I ni welana. Ga smat ta rderera Jou ni mau pana, si tina fatailo laisa kabilna, ga I bo nfayalo si mali I ni balitna. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Oras tina, Smat ta mali sorogaica ndadi Kolano cia bo nua smat ta si mali ni welana, ‘Flafo mali to mew ta Ya nik Apaca nbarakati mewna! Flafo to mali gagaw ta Ya bo Ikawasa idadi Kolano, Ya ifasadia to gagaw bo ipo mew mana mali tantuba be oras ta dunia tae ndadi ina. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Ningalena, oras ta Ya ibibisil, mewe fatub Ya. Oras Ya glaok yamang, mewe faroma Ya waya. Oras Ya ilafo potalil mali, mew ta fyal Ya mali nimew ebai i. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Oras ta Ya nik kabaya pa, mewe fpo Ya kabaya. Oras Ya ikowil, mew ffapepeya Ya. Oras ta Ya mali buica, mewe flafo fem Ya.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Ga smat ta jaga rpei okosesi ta molangna bo dua I laitane, ‘Jou, popise i ga ame kem Jou mbibisilna ame kfaseli Aw, Jou glaom yamang gabe kfaroma Aw waya? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Popisei ame kem Jou ndadi smat po mali animam batang tae gabe amame kololaw Jou mali animam ebai i? Fare popisei ame kem Jou nim kabaya pa gabe ame kpo Jou kabaya? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Fare popisei ame kem Jou mowil gabe ame kleleane Jou? Fare popisei ame kem Jou mali buica gabe ame klafo kem Aw Jou?’<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Lomanta fola Kolano cia nua si laitane, ‘Flolam famafia ta Ya ikua mew tane, farumi ta mew fpei bo fgali Ya nik del ta smatna du si riri ngale pa, tina fatailo laisa mew fpeo mali Ya i.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Gabe I bo nua smat ta mali ni balitna laitane, ‘Fdirake mew mantane to smat ta Jou npei fduk salsal ta tebteb, fare lali to bo fsung mali yap ta nmatmat pa cia, ta rfasiap i bo setanna riri kolanoca fare ni wawaina. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Ningale, oras ta Ya ibibisil, mewe fatub Ya pa. Oras Ya glaok yamang, mew faroma Ya waya pa. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Laina bena, Ya smat Ya potalil mali nimew batang tane, mewe fololaw Ya mali nimew ebai i pa. Oras ta Ya nik kabaya pa, mewe fpo Ya kabaya pa. Oras Ya ikowil, mewe ffapepeya Ya pa, fare oras ta Ya mali buica, mewe flafo fem Ya pa.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Gabe lomanta smat tina osta du laitane, ‘Jou, popise i ame kem Jou mbibisilna, glaom yamang, mdadi smat po aw mali smate ni batang, nim kabaya pa, mowil, fare Aw mali buica ga ame kleleane Aw pa Jou?’<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Gabe I osta ncanglo si laitane, ‘Flolam famafia ta Ya ikuwa mew tane, wol del wol mew failow pa bo fgali smat faisa mali Ya nik del ta smatna du riri ngale pa, tina laisa mew failow pa bo fgali Ya na.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe, “Smat ta rfaduli smat pana osta Joue nfasal si mali yap ta nmatmat pa cia denabe lali. Ga smat ta rpei be okosesi ta molang, osta rtubna re Jou Lahatallana denabe lali.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina rfasogaro si bo rpun famat Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mrk. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesuse nfafcule si fola tina, I nua ni muritna, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mewe fto to, motle wol pilu hawe ite bo tpei wol mamagal ta ngahnyo Paska bo wlor yaneto oras ta Jou Lahatalla nfabebas ite hma re bbur ta ntubana mali bangsa Mesir ta rfakangela sina. Ga oras wol mamagal cia, en smatna bo rpo Smat ta mali sorogaica bo rcalipi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Oras cia, smat Yahudina riri imam ta rfaboboko sina fare simosimo na rfayalo si mali imam mamagal ta ngahnyo Kayafas ni istanaca. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Mana si rfatator si bo rwagfo Yesus. Si bo rwagfo i ni lalingna rgogogan si, fare bo rpun famati. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ga si rfauwo si, “Mati twagfo I na mali wol mamagalna, mati denabe smat lalo ta rlokolo I na rpei hal.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maping isa ta nbaradosa nduplo Yesus egat pau mafia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mrk. 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh. 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Oras Yesus I mali pnu Betania, I ntuli mali Simone ni ebaica. Simon tae popiseina npanyaket pado. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Oras Yesuse ntotolange ga nceli, en maping isa nlafo nut egat botol pusa pauna mafia fare mulona mamagal. Fare maping cia nduplo egat falalalo mali Yesuse bobokoca.<verse eid="MAT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Oras ta Yesuse ni muritna demi i npei laina, si rcangnang pa. Gabe si du, “Egat ta pauna mafia fare mulona mamagal, pesaga i nfalibiru ina! <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Gabe laisa twage egat pau mafia cia, mulona mamagalna gaole, taga ni tiwina bisa toce smat ta riri re rari pana.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Ga Yesuse nto wlori tina, gabe I nua si, “Pesaga mew ftolea maping taena? Inanai to. I npei okosesi ta mafia mali Ya i. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Smat ta riri re rari pana osta si mali mewi turus, gabe oras ahai be mew nane fgali si, ga Ya tane ifarerer re mew turus pa. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Ningalena, oras ta i nduplo egat pau mafia cia mali Ya nik badan taena, tina laisa i nfasiape to Ya nik mayatca oras ta bo rgaile Ya na. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Flolam famafia ta Ya iku tane, manca be smatna rfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i tane mali farumi dunia, si osta dafetang ahai ta maping tae npeo Ya na, denabe smatna osta rlolam i turus.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudase bo nwage Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mrk. 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk. 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Isa mali Yesuse ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, i ngahnyo Yudas Iskariot. I nfan lali imam ta rfabobokona. <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />Nlafo pulina, i nfautno si, “Gabe ya iwage Yesus lali mewi, ahai ta mewe bo fpo ya na?” Gabe si rpoi tiwi perak yafatol lali Yudas i. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Mana, Yudase mulaine niyawa oras ta mafia bo nwage Yesus lali sili.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncula ni muritna rfasiap bo wol mamagal ciana si rceli farerer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mrk. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk. 22:7-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Wol ta pusa oras ta si bo rpei wol mamagal Roti ta Npake Ragi paca, Yesuse ni muritna rlafo ga rfautan, “Guru, manca ta Guru mailowna bo amame kfasadia an wol mamagal Paska bo ite tceli farerer?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mewe ffan lali bendar Yerusalem, pulina mew osta faduk-duk re smat isa. Fua smat cia laitane, ‘Guruca nu ni orasna mnu panto hawe. Gabe ite rir wol mamagal Paska tae, I bo nceli farerer re I ni muritna mali apa nim ebaica tae.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Rlonga Yesuse nu fola tina, I ni muritna rpei laisa ta I ncula si tina. Gabe si le ma rfasiap an wol mamagal Paska cia.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Orasna bo doram, Yesuse ntotolang nceli farerer re ni murit smat yafasa re silu tasa. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Orase si rceli, Yesuse nu, “Flolam famafia ta Ya iku tane, en smat isa mali mewi tane osta nwage Ya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Rlonga tina, si wlorina nmagogoru ina gaole. Gabe isa-isa nua I, “Guru, ya pa paga?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesuse nua si, “Smat cia isa mali mewi mali ta ttuke roti mali galas isa be tane. I cia to ta bo nwage Ya ca. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Ga Smat ta mali sorogaica osta nmat laisa re ta Jou Lahatalla nu ntuba tona. Nabina rlefo laina to mali Jou ni Kitab ciana. Ga mkapalange to smat ta mwage Smat ta mali sorogai ciana, aw osta mduk salna tebteb! Ta mafiana, mati aw mtub mali dunia taena.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Gabe Yudase ta bo nwage Yesus ca nu, “Guru, smat ta mu ica, ya pa paga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Gabe Yesuse ncanglo i, “Aw tutuling ta mu lainana.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nceli farerer re ni muritna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mrk. 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk. 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kor. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Oras ta Yesuse I re ni muritna rceli, Yesuse nyal roti taga nu tarima kase nais Jou Lahatalla I. Fola tina, I nfawogwogla rotina taga noce si, I nu, “Roti tane Ya nik badanca, fyale to bo fan.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Fola tina, Yesuse nyal cawan taga nu tarima kase nais Jou Lahatalla I. Fare I noce si taga nu, “Mewe farumi fdom anggur tae to. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Ningalena, tane Ya nik laflaf. Oras Ya imat, Ya nik laflafna osta maraepa bo fatutua Jou Lahatalla ni jaji mali smatnana. Gabe Ya nik laflaf ta maraepa tina bo nfayangise smat lalo ni dosa. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Flonga famafia ta Ya bo ikuwa mew tane, mantane bo lali, Ya osta idom anggur panto. Ga lomanta oras Ya nik Apa Nkawasa to ndadi Kolano mali I ni smatna, taga Ya idom hawe anggur ta pona farerer re mew.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ntuba, Petruse bo npida nfayala Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mrk. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Fola tina, Yesuse I re ni muritna rmanyanyi rfamamagal Jou Lahatalla, taga si rfan lali Popo Zaitun.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Oras cia, Yesuse nua si, “Doram tae to mew farumi ta fdela Yana nimew delana osta ngangala denabe mew ffarera fateam Ya. Ningalena, ta ntubana Jou Lahatalla nu mali ni Kitabca laitane, ‘Ya osta ipun smat ta njaga dombana, gabe domba ta I njagana damsaki lali re mali.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Tina ni ngalena, Ya osta imat, ga oras Ya osta ipaling hawe, Ya osta ilafo ntuba mali mewi mali batang Galilea taga ite tfadukduk mana.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Gabe Petruse nua Yesus, “Biarega farumi si riri delana ngangala denabe rfarera rfateam Aw Guru, ga ya tane enpa!”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Gabe Yesuse nua Petrus, “Mlonga famafia Ya bo ikua aw tane, doram tae tatalena rkuku paube, aw osta mu mfayala Ya pana law faicol.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Gabe Petruse nua I laitane, “Biarega ya imat farerer re aw Guru, ya osta iku ifayala Aw Guru.” Ga Yesuse ni murit ta nesana du laina bena.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncombayang mali bet Getsemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mrk. 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk. 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Fola tina, Yesuse I re ni muritna rfan lali gagaw isa ta ngahnyo Getsemani. Fare Yesuse nua ni muritna, “Ftotolang mantane su e, Ya lali bo isombayang.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Ga Yesuse nut Petrus, Yakobus fare Yohanes, Zebedeuse ntu silu tasa, rderera I. Oras ciana, I wlona mulaine nmagogoru i, fare namderer. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Gabe I nua smat si tol tasa, “Ya wlokna kangelana gaole, ibasamna laisa bo imatna. Mew mantane su e. Fjaga farerer re Ya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Fola tina Yesuse nfan lali okoce, fare I nlu nap denabe uhngoca neta rakrakca, taga ncombayang, “Ya Apa, gabe laisa bisa, mati Ya iduk kangela taena. Ga mati mderera Ya wloknana, mderera be Apa wlomna.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ncombayange fola, Yesuse nlolai lali ni murit sitol tasa, ga nem sina damtoal. Gabe I nfapaling si fare nua Petrus, “Ee, aw manahan pa biarega jam bahnga mjaga farerer re Ya? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Fjagjaga fare fsombayang, bo mew mati fmarapaulo salsal cana, ningalena biarega mew wlomewna flokolo bo fderera Ya, ga nimew badanca nafena pa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfane ncombayang hawe. I ncombayangna nu laitane, “Apa, gabe kangela tae nane Ya bo iduk i, laina to Apa nim mauna ndadi i!” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Ncombayange fola, Yesuse nlolai hawe lali smat si tol tasa, nem sina damtoal hawe, ningalena damtututilna gaole.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Yesuse nfateam si mana hawe taga I lali ga ncombayang ta faicolna. I ni sombayangca nu laisa ta nanaina hawe. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ncombayange fola, I nlolai hawe lali ni murit smat si tol tasa. I nfapaling si taga nu laitane, “Mewe ffamtuli sube fare ffafolfola mew hawe? Tane i ni oras, co mew fem, Smat ta mali sorogaica bo rpoi lali smat ta rbaradosana. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Fosale to bo tfan. Smat ta bo nwage Ya ca nalaw panto.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse rwagfo I</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mrk. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk. 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoh. 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Oras Yesuse nmauting sube, isa mali Yesuse ni murit yafasa re silu tasa ta ngahnyo Yudas cia nlafo. I nlafona farerer re smatna lal, en ta dut eta fare en bena ta dut ai motmoto. Smat tina imamna riri ta rfabobokona rcula si fare simosimo Yahudina. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yudas ta nwage Yesusca npei fafayale to lali smat lalo tina, i nu laitane, “Smat ta ya bo ifatan ica cia to, ta mewe fwagfo i.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Gabe smat ta lalna rlafo mana, Yudase tina to dahle Yesus taga nu, “Guru, isuba Aw.” Fare i nfatan Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Gabe Yesuse nua i, “E wataw, mpei be to ahai ta aw bo mpei na.” Gabe smat ta rlafo rfarerer Yudasna rfadahle si taga rwagfo Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Ga smat isa mali smat ta jaga rderera Yesusna ncibete ni etaca taga ntota Imam mamagalca ni smat karajan isa kanyona denabe morit.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Gabe Yesuse nua smat cia, “Msunga i hawe nim eta cia! Ningalena isa npune smate ga npake eta, i ma osta nmata re eta. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Mati mewe flupana, Ya bisa idor lali Ya nik Apa i, tina to I osta nfayeit malaikatna re ni calan bo rgali Ya. <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Gabe laisa Ya ipei laina, tina ningalena, farumi ta rlefoe ntuba mali Jou ni Kitabcana ga Ya oras tae, osta ndadi i pa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Gabe Yesuse nua smat lalo ta rlafo bo rwagfo I na, “Mewe fu rasa Ya tane smat ta ipei ta mayai, denabe mewe flafo fut eta fare ai motmoto bo fwagfo Ya? Naga Ya wol de wol ifabinga Jou Lahatalla ni Abar ta mafia mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, ga mewe fwagfo Ya mana pa. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ga inanai to, ningalena farumi tina nane ndadi i, laisa ta Jou Lahatalla nu ntuba mali nabina ta rlefo mali Kitabcana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Ga Yesuse ni muritna farumi rfarera rfateam I.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse durus I mali Mahkama Agamana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mrk. 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk. 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">66-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh. 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Laina smat ta lal tina rwagfo Yesus, si duti lali imam mamagal Kayafas ni ebaica. Mana guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare simosimo Yahudina rfayalo si to. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Oras ta dut Yesus mana, Petruse nderera si ga nalaspa denabe i ncung mali imam mamagalca ni ebaica ni kintalna. Nlafo pulina, i ntotolang farerer re si ta rjaga manana bo nem ahai ta bo ndadi i mali Yesus i na. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Mana, imamna riri ta rfaboboko sina fare farumi Mahkama Agamana riri ta rfabobokona diyawa smat ta rcaksina molang pana bo rfatuwo Yesuse na salna, bo si rfasal Yesusna nmat. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Ga si rduk pa na sal tina, biarega smat ta rlafona lal bo rdadi saksi ta molang pa lali Yesus I. Ni morco napna, en smat silu ta rcaksi laitane, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />“Smat tane jaga du, I osta nfamop Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, ga mnuwo wol pitol I nfaosal i hawe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mana, imam mamagalca nosal, fare nua Yesus, “Smatna lale to ta du msalna, ga Aw mgali nim dirica pa?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ga Yesuse lio pa. Gabe imam mamagalca nua I hawe, “Ya isasi re Jou Lahatalla ta ntub ngahnyona, Awe mua am mali, fatutua Aw tane Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji ta ntuba be? Fare fatutua Aw Lahatalla Ntu Aw pare enpa?”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Gabe Yesuse ncanglo, “Apa tutuling bere mu laina gabe Ya to. Ga Ya ikua mewe, lomanta fem Smat ta mali sorogaica ntotolang mali gagaw ta tigoca mali Jou Lahatalla ta Nkawasa molangca ni welana, ga nlafo puis metna mali langitca.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Rlonga Yesuse nu laina, imam mamagalca ntolena gaole denabe ncekane ni jubaca taga nu laitane, “Ce e, ga smat tae npei laisa Jou Lahatalla ya! Gabe, ite tarausa tiyawa saksi hawe to ta bo tfasal ina! Mew tutulinge flonga to paga? <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Ga tane bo mew, mfalaisa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Si rcanglo, “I nane nduk salna nmat.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Fola tina, si ditfo Yesuse uhngoca fare rpun I, en bena ta daspakal I. <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Fare dua I, “Gabe laisa fatutua Aw Mesias, coba mu, ise ta naspakal Aw!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petruse nfayala Yesus pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mrk. 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh. 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Oras cia, Petruse ntotolang mali imam mamagal cia ni ebaica ni kintalna. Ga smat karajan isa mana mapingi nlafo, fare nua i, “Aw tane bena ta jaga mderera Yesus, smat Galileaca paga?”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Ga Petruse nfatuwo mali smat lalo ca nbona, nu i nfayala Yesus pa. I nu laitane, “Enpa! Ya itaif pa anim maksut pesa mu lainana!”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Fola tina, Petruse ncapang nata bawa pagarca. Manana en smat karajan maping ta nesana nem i, fare nua smat ta manana, “Smat tae jaga nderera Yesus, smat Nasaret ca.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Ga Petruse npida hawe. I ncasi nu, “Ya isasi ku Jouca ngahnyo, ya ifayala I pa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Mnu pana, smat ta si manana rdahle Petrus taga dua i, “Molange to, aw tane isa mali sili, tina tfayala mali nim logatna.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Tina to Petruse ncasi, “Ya isasi iku Jouca ngahnyo, ya ifayala I pa!” Ga oras tina to, tataleca nkuku.<verse eid="MAT 26:74" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Fare Petruse wlo yaneto ta Yesuse nua i na, “Tataleca nkuku paube, aw mu mfayala Ya pana faicole to.” Tina to, Petruse ncapang taga ntangis ningalena nmanyasalna gaole.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Smat Yahudi ta rfabobokona rpo Yesus lali gubernur Pilatus i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mrk. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk. 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoh. 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Orasna dororam i sube tamayai, farumi imam ta rfaboboko fare simosimo Yahudina rfayalo si bo jal faorit bo rpun famat Yesus. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Gabe si rpitan Yesus, taga duti lali gubernur Pilatus i.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudase nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Kis. 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Oras Yudas ta nwage Yesusca nlonga Yesuse nduk sal denabe nmat I ndadi nmanyasalna gaole. Gabe i nfawe tiwi perak yafatol tina lali imam ta rfabobokona fare simosimo Yahudina <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Yudase nua si, “Ya ibaradosa to, ningalena ya iwage smat ta na sal paca.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Ga si dua i, “Tina amame kfatoto pa, lomanta aw!”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Nlonga tina, Yudase nfan lali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca taga ntigeya tiwi perak tina lali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Fola tina, i nfane ga nyal wala taga npake nfakawkawil i denabe nmat.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Ga imam-imam ta rfabobokona rfan lali djal tiwi perak tina fare du, “Tiwi tane tiwi haram, ningalena rlonga rwage smat denabe smat cia nmat. Gabe bo tderera ite rir agamaca ni fatfatona, tiwi tane bisa tpeo sadaka pa pumul Ebai Sombayang Mamagalcana.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Rfauwo fola si tina, si rfatator hawe bo rpake tiwi tina rgon rakrak. Si rgon rakrak tina mali smat ta jaga npei okosesi mali rakrak ta biasa ite tu, tanah liat. Rakrak ta si rgon tina bo ndadi rakrak piling bo si be smat ta Yahudi si pana ta rmat mali si riri batang tina. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Tina ta ndadi hal i denabe oras tae rakrak cia smatna du, rakrak laflaf.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Fare si rgon rakrak tina, gabe ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nua nabi Yeremia tantuba tina ndadi i, laitane, “Si rjal tiwi perak yafatol tina, tina to mulo ta smat Israelna rfatator bo rpalco I na. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Fare tiwi tina, si rgona rakrak mali smat ta jaga npei okosesi mali rakrak ta biasa ite tu, ‘Tanah liat.’ Tina laisa re Jou Lahatalla nfato ntuba to ga nua ya.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gubernur Pilatuse nurus Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mrk. 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk. 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoh. 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Oras cia, si dut Yesus taga rfabo i re gubernur Pilatus. Gabe gubernurca nfautno Yesus, “Fatutua Apa Aw tane smat Yahudina riri Kolano Aw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesus ncanglo, “Apa, aw tutuling ta mu laina gabe Ya to.”<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Ga oras ta imam ta rfaboboko fare simosimo Yahudina rfautno Yesus bo diyawa na sal, ga Yesuse nmauting pa.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Gabe Pilatuse nua Yesus, “Apa, Apa mlonga pa? Ga lalna gaole si rfautno Apa, ga Apa mfagali pa?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ga Yesuse nua si mauting pusa bere enpa, denabe gubernur Pilatuse nherangna gaole.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus nduk salsal denabe nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mrk. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk. 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoh. 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Etnga be taun, oras wol Paska, gubernurca jaga ncapnga smat isa mali buica. Smat ta i bo ncapnga ica, i nderera smat lalo ni mauna. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Oras tina, mali buicana en smat isa wlona nmayai ga bisa i, i ngahnyo Yesus Barabas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Gabe oras smat lalo tina rfayalo si mali gubernurca ni istanaca, gubernur Pilatuse nfautno si, “Ise ta mew flokolo ya bo isapnga ica, Yesus Barabas pare Yesus ta smatna du Kristus?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />(Gubernurca nfautan laina, ningalena i nto ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina rpo Yesus lali i ga si riri le Yesus.)<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Oras ta gubernur Pilatuse ntotolang mali gagao ta i jaga npake nuruse smatna, i ni ngolota nfayeit fatnaw lali i. I nu laitane, “Awe mati mcampurna Smat ta namolangca ni halna, ningalena poko be I, popei ya iduk mahngel ga I denabe ya idadi kamcait laitane.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Ga imamna riri ta rfaboboko sina fare simosimo Yahudina dua smat laloca bo rfabinga gubernurca ncapnga Barabas, taga rfasal Yesusna denabe nmat. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Gabe gubernur Pilatuse nfautno smat laloca, “Ga smat silu tasine, ise ta ya bo isapnga ica?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Si rcanglo, “Barabase to.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilatuse nfautan fawe, “Gabe laina, ahai ta nane ya ipeina re Yesus tae ta smatna jaga du Kristus?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Si farumi si rgigam, “Fsalip I to!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Gabe Pilatuse nfautno si fawe, “I npei hal ahai ga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Ga Smat ta laloca rgigamna rfacicoal si hawe, “Fsalipi to I ya!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Oras ciana, gubernur Pilatuse nemna I bisa npei paisapa nto gabe manana mulaine mlelang. Gabe i nyal waya taga nuase kakamona mali smat laloca nbona bo ndadi fafayal i, i ncal pa, ga i nderera smat lalo wlorina. I nu laitane, “Ya itanggung jawab panto gabe laisa Smat tae nmat ya, mew farumi ta ftanggung jawab!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Gabe smat laloca nmauting du, “Inanai to lomanta amam fare ntu re bbumamna ktanggong jawab smat cia ni matmatna.”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Nlonga tina, Pilatuse nderera smat laloca riri mauna, ga I nfabebas Barabas. Ga Yesus, i ncula tentarana rpun I rpake wala ta tubona mdalim. Fola tina, I npo Yesus lali sili bo rcalip I.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tentarana rlal Yesus fare du I</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mrk. 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Fola tina, gubernur Pilatuse ni tentarana dut Yesus lali gagaw ta i mali gubernurca ni istanaca ni kintalna. Taga si dololawe riri del tentarana farumi rfayalo si ga rjel Yesus. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Si rcalawe Yesuse ni kabayaca taga rfapake I juba isa ni warnana ungu laisa ta kolanona biasa rpakena. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Fola tina, si rjanam siseping isa mali wala ta ni sogana taga rfapake Yesus mali bobokona. Taga rfakawco I re sop isa mali I kakamo welana, rpei laisa I kolano i na. Fola tina, si rlu nape ga dakale rcuba I, taga du laitane, “Tabea Jou Kolano, ksuba Aw smat Yahudina riri Kolano Aw!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Taga si ditfo I. Fare si jal sop ta mali kakamo ca taga rpeseo bobokoca. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Rfamiamia fola I, si rcalawe ni juba unguca taga rfapake i hawe I ni juba molangca. Taga si dute rcapnga I mali bendar Yerusalem bo rcalip I.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse rcalip I</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mrk. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk. 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Oras cia tentarana dut Yesus rcapnga I mali bendar Yerusalem, si rfaduduk re smat isa ngahnyo Simon. Simon tae smat Kirene i. Ga tentarana rpaksa Simone bo npapa Yesuse ni salipca. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Fare si rlafo mali gagaw isa ngahnyo Golgota, ta ningale gagaw ta smat boboko ni long. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Rlafo mali gagaw cia, si rfaroma Yesuse anggur ta rbanga lalau ta ngahnyo empedu. Yesus nbasam okoce anggur tina, fare I nailow panto bo ndom hawena.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Fola tina, si rcalip I. Taga si rcibit lot bo rto ise ta nduk I ni kabayaca. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Gabe si rtotolang mana rjagjaga I. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Mali Yesus boboko naisna, si rpaku fafan ungo taga rlefo laitane, “Tae Yesus, smat Yahudina riri Kolano I.” Tulisan tane ta ndadi fatotole i, denabe si rcalip Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Mana en bena smat silu wlorina mayai, rcalip si farerer re Yesus. Isa imali Yesuse ni welana, isa imali Yesuse ni balitna.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Smat ta rdel mali Yesus ni salipca nbona jowa bobokorina ningalena, riri le Yesus. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Si du, “He, Awe mu, Awe bisa mfamarapu Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca taga mpei hawe mnuwona wol pitol be, paga? Gabe laisa, fatutua Aw Lahatalla ntu Aw, mfasalamate nim dirica, fare mduri to mali salipca!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Laina bena, imam ta rfabobokona, guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare simosimo Yahudi, si le ma rfamiamia Yesus bena. Si du, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Smate nesa bisa nfasalamat si, ga i ni tubca tutuling bisa nfasalamat I pa! Naga I nu I smat Israelna riri Kolano i. Tina fatutua, mduri to mali salipca bo amame kdela Aw! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />I ndela Jou Lahatalla. I ma jaga nu bena, I Jou Lahatalla Ntu I. Gabe inanai to, lomanta Jou Lahatalla nailow, taga nfasalamat I.”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Smat silu ta rcalip farerer re Yesus tasa, si ma rfamiamia Yesus bena.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mrk. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Orasna tok yafasa re pilu, wolca nfapaluan batang tina farumi dororam denabe tok faicol malingin. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ga orasna sal pa tok faicol malingin, Yesuse n'gigamna nfacicoali npake mauting Aram. I nu laitane, <char style="tl">“Eli, Eli, lama sabakhtani?”</char> Ni ngalena, ‘Jou Lahatalla ite rir Jou i, pesaga Jou mfateam Yana?’<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Rlonga tina, smat sifis ta dosal mana tasa du laitane, “I nololaw nabi Elia.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Gabe oras tina to, smat isa mali sili fatoal be nyal kapa, taga ncoula i mali cuka ta nkakaninca. Taga rfadahle i mali Yesuse fmona bo I ndomi.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Ga ta nesana du, “Ftotoman su! Lomanta kem i su, faramanega nabi Elia nfasalamat I.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Ga Yesuse n'gigam hawe nfacicoali, fare I npo ni jiwaca.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Pumul Ebai Sombayang Mamagalcana en kain mamagal isa rcagta i bo rtiban gagaw ta Jou Lahatala nlafo biasa I mana, gagaw ta smat biasana bisa rcung pa. Oras Yesuse nmat, kain cia nmarasekan ndadi pilu puis denabe nap. Tina nfarerer re sui ta ncicoalna gaole denabe lolas patna marapaw. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Piling guana masalawe gabe smat ta rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smatna, lal ta rpaling hawe. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Ga lomanta Yesuse npaling hawe, si ma rcapang mali si riri pilingna taga rcung mali bendar Yerusalem, Jou Lahatalla ni bendar i. Pulina si rfaeme riri dirica lali smat laloca.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />En komedan kompi Roma i re ni wawaina ta rjaga Yesus oras ta rcalip Ina. Si damcaitna gaole oras sui ta ncicoal cia fare si deme ndumi ta ndadi i tina. Gabe si du, “Fatutua, I tae Jou Lahatalla Ntu i!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Manana en bena mapingna lal ta dem Yesusna ga dalaspa. Si tane ta rderera Yesus mali batang Galilea, rleleane I. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mali sili tina, en Maria smat Magdala, Maria tae Yakobus fare Yusufe hnyeri i, fare Zebedeuse ni ngolota Yakobus i re Yohanese hnyeri ca.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse rgaile I mali piling goa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mrk. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />En smat isa nkayang i mali batang Arimatea, i ngahnyo Yusuf. I bena smat ta ndela Yesus. Oras wolca bo ncop, <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />i nfane bo nbo gubernur Pilatus, i ndor Yesuse ni mayatca bo n'gaile I. Gabe gubernur Pilatuse nua si rpo Yesuse ni mayatca lali Yusuf i. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Gabe Yusufe nyal Yesuse ni mayat cia, taga nopi i re kain bubulang ta mufuf, laisa re ta smat agama Yahudina jaga rpei oras ta rgaile smatna. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Fola tina, i nising Yesuse ni mayat cia mali piling gua isa ta rgaile i mali popo ta ni pat. Piling tina i ni, gabe po sube. Nisinge fola i mana, i nfaulol pat mamagal isa bo ntabak piling gowa ni bawaca. Fola tina, taga Yusufe nuwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Oras tina, Maria smat Magdala re maping ta nesana rtotolang rbo lali pilingca ni bawa sapngona.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gubernur Pilatuse ncula tentara smat sifis rjaga Yesuse ni pilingca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Ni semaca, neta wol Sabat wol ta smat Yahudina bisa rkarajan pa, imamna riri ta rfaboboko sina fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi rfane ga rbo gubernur Pilatus. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Si dua Pilatus, “Apa gubernur, amame wlomam yaneto oras ta Yesus ta nmadarawaca tub subena, I nu, ‘Ya osta mat, ga ni wol pitol, Ya osta paling fawe.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Gabe tina, mgali ame bo msula tentarana rjaga I ni pilingca denabe wol pitol. Matina denabe I ni muritna rlafo lois I ni mayatca, taga si rfabinga smatna, ‘I npaling fawe.’ Gabe laisa denabe rpei abar laina, tina nbang be rfacaite smatna, tina mayaina foloi mali oras ta Yesuse tub subena.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Rlonga laina, Pilatuse nuwa si, “Me fute to ya nik tentara smat sifis mana, bo rjaga pilingca famafia.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Fola tina, si rfan lali piling cia. Si rfagagaw mali bawaca pilingca, gabe smatna rcalawe bawa cia, si rto to. Fare si rcula tentara sifis mana rjaga mali pilingca nbona.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse npaling hawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mrk. 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Oras ta wol Sabat ca nmaralapis, wol ta smat agama Yahudina bisa rkarajan pa, neta wol Minggu dorororam isube ta mayaina, Maria smati mali Magdala fare Maria ta nesana rfane dem Yesuse ni pilingna. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Rgarayanna suica ncicoalna gaole ningalena Jou Lahatalla ni malaikat isa ndurui mali sorogai. Malaikat cia nfaolol pat ta tiban bawa piling goa taga i ntotolang puis pat cia. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />I uhngoca nsasaletam laisa lemlemna, taga ni kabayaca nbubulangna gaole. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Tentara ta rjaga manana damcaitna gaole denabe damderer, gabe rmarapawil nap, rngangala pa laisa smat ta rmatna.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Gabe Malaikatca nua maping tasa, “Mati famcaitna! Ya ito mewe fiyawa Yesus ta rcalip i cia. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />I mantane pa. I npaling hawe, laisa re ta I nu popise ina. Fsung mali bo fem gagaw ta si dising mayatcana. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Tane to, mewe flolai, taga fabinga I ni muritna, fu, ‘Yesus ta nmatca npaling hawe. Gabe I ntuba lali batang Galilea to. Pulina mewe osta fem I.’ Gabe wlomew yaneto e, farumi ta ya iku tane!”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Gabe, mapingna rfateam piling cia. Si damcait ga rbasamna rcangnangna gaole. Si rfarera bo rfabinga Yesuse ni muritna.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Garayan mali lalingca popo, Yesuse nlafo ga nu tabea lali sili. Gabe si rdahle Yesus, rgope I ficona, taga rcuba I.<verse eid="MAT 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mati famcaitna. Lali bo ffabinga Ya nik delna, fu Ya ipaling hawe. Gabe Ya bo ituba lali Galilea, pulina taga si bo dem Ya.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tentarana rfabinga du, muritna rlois Yesuse ni mayatca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Oras ta maping tina si mali laling popo sube, tentara ta rjaga Yesuse ni pilingna rfan Yerusalem. Pulina tentarana rfabinga agama Yahudina riri imam ta rfaboboko sina ga farumi ta ndadi i tona. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Gabe imamna riri ta rfabobokona fare simosimo Yahudina rfayalo si taga rfatator. Gabe si riri fatatorca bo doce tentarana tiwi bo si mati rfabingana. <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />Gabe si dua tentara tina, “Laitane: gabe laisa smatna rfautan, mewe fu beto, ‘Doram, orasna amame kamtoal, Yesuse ni muritna rlafo ga rlois Yesuse ni mayatca.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Gabe laisa gubernur Pilatuse nlonga tina, mewe mati famcaitna, lomanta amame kmauting re i bo mew mati fduk salna.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Fola tina, tentarana jal tiwi tina taga rpei laisa ta rcula sina. Gabe denabe oras tae, smat Yahudina jaga dafetang, Yesuse ni muritna ta rlois Yesuse ni mayatca.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncula ni muritna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mrk. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk. 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Kis. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Yesuse ncula ni murit yafasa re isa tasa rfan lali lolas isa mali batang Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Rlafo pulina, si dem Yesus gabe rcuba I, ga smat sifis mali silina rdela uatupau be cia fatutua Yesus.<verse eid="MAT 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesuse ndahle si taga nu, “Ya iduke ndumi to kawasa ta mali sorogai fare mali dunia taena. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Gabe tina, mewe ffane to bo fpei farumi suku tae ndadi Ya nik murit. Mew ta fsisop si fpake Apa ngahnyona, Jou Lahatalla Ntuca fare Jou Lahatalla ni Rohca. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Fare mewe fafcule si rpei farumi parenta ta Ya ifafcule mewna. Mew wlomew yaneto famafia e, Ya ifarerer re mew denabe lali.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>